<p. 1a>

oṃ namaḥ śrīgurugaṇeśāya namaḥ |

śrībhavānyai namaḥ |

ūrjjitānandagahanāṃ sarvadevasvarupiṇīṃ |
parāmbāgrupiṇīṃ vande mahānīlasarasvatīṃ ||

nīlatantransamājñāya siddhasārasvataṃ paraṃ |
vīratantraṃ matsyasūktaṅgādhārve bhairavī tathā ||

guruṇāśca mataṃ jñātvā kṛtā śrīśaṃkareṇa vaiḥ |
sarvāmnāyasaṃpannaṃ vai tārārahasyavṛttikā ||

sarvakarmasusiddhārthaṃ likhyate pūjanādikaṃ |
prathame paṭale devyā nityapūjā prakāśitā ||

dvitīye paṭale tāvad dīkṣāvidhiviśeṣataḥ |
tṛtīye tu puraścaryā yena maṃtratva labhyate ||

<p. 1b>

naimittikaṃ caturthe syāt pañcame kāmyanirṇayaḥ |
rahasya nirṇayaḥ ṣaṣṭe kumārī saptame tathā ||

aṣṭame tu puraścaryā tārāyāḥ parikīrtitāḥ |
navame paṭale devyā maṃtrāṇāṃ parinirṇayaḥ ||

daśame paṭale stotraṃ phalamekādaśe tathā |
dvādaśe paṭale samyak bhāvanā parinirṇayaḥ ||

nityapūjā prayogastu paṭale tu trayodaśe |
samyag vidhānaṃ homasya tārāyāśca caturdaśe ||

pañcadaśe tu maṃtrāṇāṃ vāsanā tatva nirṇayaḥ |
iti tārārahasyaṃ tu samyagadhyāyanirṇayaḥ ||

<p. 2a>

atha brāhme muhurte utthāya mūlādhāra padme taddritkoṭi karālāṃ 
mūlavidyāmayīṃ kuṇḍalaṇīṃ dhyātvā suṣumnā brahmaṇā paratejasi 
saṅgamaryadamṛtadhārayā lolaibhūtāścaitanyamayī punamūlādhāramālayet |

tathā ca śrutiḥ |

prakāśamānāṃ prathame prayāṇe prati prayānepyamṛtāyamānāḥ |
aṃtaḥ padavyāmanu saścarantīmānandarūpāmamalāprapadye ||

tadutthāyāvaśyakaṅkuryāt |

taduktamatsyasūkte |

<p. 2b>

utthāyacottare yāme kuṇḍalintaṃ ḍiḍā kṛtiṃ |
dhyātvā siddhiḥ svaro bhūtvāmubhāgī bhavet naraḥ ||

nīlatantrepi ||

utthāya cottare yāme ciṃtayadugra tāriṇī |
mulādi brahmaraṃdhrāntaṃ cisantu tanīyasīṃ ||

mūlamaṃtramayī sākṣādamṛtānandarūpiṇīṃ |
sūryakoṭipratīkīśī candrakoṭi suśītalāṃ ||

taḍitkoṭi samaprakhyā kāmānandaśikhopari |
tatprabhāpaṭalavyāpta pāṭalīkṛta dehavān ||

<p. 3a>

sarvamaṃgalasampannaḥ snānakarmasamācaret |
mṛtkūśānapi saṃgṛhya gatvā jalānnikaṃ tataḥ ||

malāpakarṣaṇasnātvā maṃtrasnānaṃ samācaret |
vidyayā triṇimajyaivamācāmetpāpaśāntayet ||

mūlānte tarpayāmīti svāhāntaṃ tarpaṇanmataṃ |
evaṃ tridhā tarpaṇaṃ tu sarvapāpakṣayo bhavet ||

tataḥ snānakāle saṃprāpte yathā vidhi snātvā santarpaṇaṃ kṛtvā 
mūlavidyāntena śrīnīlasarasvatī śrī ugratārāmvā ekajaṭāmvā tarpayāmiti 
triḥsaṃtarpayet ||

<p. 3b>

kuśānte meḍhrapuṣpacandanapuṣpaṅkuśākṣataṃ |
prasthāgrāhitāmupātre kṛtvā cārghannivedayet ||

mūlānte udyedāditya vartinyai śivacaitanya mayai svāhā |

iti manuḥ |

smṛtasūryārghaprajñāyaivaṃ pūjāsyānamathā caret |

sūryamaṇḍale devī cintayet |

tato bilvākṣata javāraktacaṃdanavajrapuṣpasādhinārghyaṃ nivedyataṅgāyatrā 
mūlavidyayā vā |

taduktaṃ | 

kālikātaṃtre |

bhagavatyeka jaṭe vidmahe vikaṭa dante dhīmahi tannostārā pracodayāt |
tato hṛdi dhyātvā |

aṣṭottare śataṃ japtvā jalasthānaṃ yāyāt |

<p. 4a>

taduktaṃ |

phetkāriṇi tantre |

ekaliṃge śmaśāne vā śūnyāgāre catuḥpatheḥ |
tatrasthaḥ sādhayed yogī vidyātribhuvaneśvarīṃ ||

tatreva |

pañcakrośāntare yatra liṅgāntaranna dṛśyate |
tadekaliṅgamākhyātaṃ tatra siddhiranuttamā ||

catuspatha lakṣaṇa tantrāntare |

catuspathaṃ vijānīyād yatrāste tāriṇī śilā |
tatra yatnena taṃ tavyaṃ japtavyaṃ siddhikākṣibhiḥ ||

anyatrāpi  |

ujjaṭe parvate vāpi nirjane vā catuṣpathe |
devāgārethavā śūnye nirjjane kāntaveśmani ||

iti sthāna |

vīratantre |

śūnyāgāre śmaśāne yadi japati janastveka liṅge taḍāge gaṅgāgarabhe 
giraudhāsucivimalamatiḥ sarvadā bhaktiyuktaḥ |

<p. 4b>

vidyāśrīnīlacānyābhuvabhajanapati sarvaśāstārtha vettā dehānte yogi mukhya 
paramaśivapadaṃ brahma nirvāṇameti |

evaṃ yathāsthānamāśritya tatra pīṭhaṃ viciṃtayet |

taduktaṅgadharvataṃtre |

śmaśānantatra sañcitya tatra kalpadruma smaret |
tanmūle manipīṭhaśca nāmaṇivibhūṣaṇaṃ ||

nānālaṃkārabhūṣādyān mūnidevaiśca maṇḍita |
śivābhirbahumāṃsāsthi modamānābhirantataḥ ||

<p. 5a>

caturdikṣuśavāṅgānāṃ citābhasmasthi bhūṣitāḥ |
tanmadhye bhāvayed devī yathokta dhyānayogataḥ ||

iti dhyātvā |

oṃ vajrodake huṃ phaṭ svāhā tajjalamadhiṣṭāya | oṃ hrīṃ svāhā ityanena hastau 
pādau prakṣālya | oṃ hrīṃ suvisuddhadharma sarvapāpāṇi 
mayāśayavikalpamapanaya hūṁ phaṭ svāhā |

ityācamya |

oṃ maṇidhari vajriṇi sarvavaśaṃkari huṃ phaṭ svāheti śikhāvaṃdhanaḥ |
rakṣa (2) svāheti jalābhiṣekādbhumiśodhanaṃ | oṃ sarvavighnānutsāraya huṁ phaṭ 
svāhā | 

iti akṣatanprakṣipya akṣatakṣeyā yānuttaraṃ nānā ca mudrayā trivighnānutsārayet | 
oṃ apavitra vajrabhume huṃ phaṭ svāhetiṃ bhūmijalenābhi mantrājalena ||

tatra kaścala komala vistarāmṛdvāsanānyāstīrya | ā āḥ surekhevajakhe huṁ phaṭ 
svāheti raktacandana puṣpābhyāṃ tāmantryarcya svastikādyāsana krameṇa 
tatropaviśet |

taduktaṃ matsyāsūkte ||

mṛdukambala āsīno anyeṣu komaleṣu vā |
viṣṭareṣu samāsīnaḥ sādhayet siddhimuttamaṃ ||

<p. 6a>

saṅgrāme pativāpi vyādikamadhūdrakaṃ | ṣaṇmāsāntiḥ 
sitanprāpyacitāyāmvātadantike ||

asyāyarthaḥ |

daśamāsādadyāk ṣaṇmāsaparyantaṃ yāvat | garbhacyutabālakamviduḥ acūḍako 
akṛtacūḍākaraṇaḥ ||

upanayana samayādadyāk cūḍākaraṇāprāk komalamavidhanaṃ eṣāmabhāve 
viṣṭare kuśeṣu vā |

tadukta śrīkrame |

vīrāsanamabhāve tu mṛtāsanaṃ śṛṇu priye |

pañcavarṣābhyantaraṃ yāvat mṛtambālaka cūḍakaṃ ṣaṇmāsābhyāntaraṃ 
yāvat daśamā sācca pūrvakam |

<p. 6b>

garbhayutambālaṃ śṛgarbhāṣṭamānpuraḥsaraṃ | etat komala vidyā haviṣṭareṣu 
kuśeṣu vā || taduktaṃ matsyasūkte |

kṛṣṇasāradvīpi carma acūḍakantaraṃ tathā |
pītaśca śvetanīla ca āsanāya prakalpayet ||

prata tu viṣṭaraṃ vātha athavā kuṇḍalī kṛtamiti | evamāsanarahasyamārādhya 
gurumukhādavagantavyamiti || oṃ maṇidharaṇi vajiṇi mahāvajiṇi mahāpratisare 
rakṣa (2) mā huṁ phaṭ svāheti vastrantike rakṣāgratthimbadhniyāt |

<p. 7a>

oṃ āḥ hū ā hū svāheti karābhyāṃ vyāpaka tadyokāya vākcitta śodhanaṃ |

oṃ namaḥ puṣpakekaṃturājārhate tathā gatāya samyak saṃbuddhāya puṣpe puṣpe 
mahāpuṣpe supuṣpe bhūṣiteṣuṣpa ca yāvakīrṇe huṃ phaṭ svāhā | 

iti puṣpādinmaṃtraṃ mayaṃ kṛtvā suvarṇādi pīṭhe 
raktacandanagorocanākuṃkumavajrapuṣpādilipne |

oṃ āḥ sulekhe vajrarekhe huṃ phaṭ svāheti mantreṇa adhomukha trikoṇa 
garbhitamaṣṭadalapadmaṃ catudvārātmakaṃ rātramuddharet ||

<p. 7b>

taduktañca cūḍāmaṇau |

tataḥ kularasena ca pīṭhannirmāya yatnataḥ |
aṃ āḥ surekhe huṃ phaṭ dvayameva ca ||

maṃtrenānena saṃlikhye vasupatranmanoharaḥ |

tasya padmasya pūrvadale hrīṁ likhet | yāmye trīṃ likhet | uttare pha likhet | paścime 
ṭa likhet | trikoṇa madhye hūṁ likhet |  taduktaṃ pheravītantre ||

sa yonī candanenāṣṭa yatra mantraṃ likhet tataḥ |
mṛdumāsanamāsādyaḥ māyāṃ pūrvadale likhe ||

<p. 8a>

madhyabījaṃ dvitīye tu cottara paścime vacaḥ |
madhyabījaṃ likhennāra bhūtaśuddhimathācaret ||

tāraṃ huṃkāra huṁkārasya tārāpraṇavaṃdene prasiddha tvāt |
athavā ugrāyānīlasarasvatyā vidhāne sādhyatārasya ||

athavā ugrāyānīlasarasvatyā vidhāne madhye tārasya vidhāra kecit |
madhya ṣaṭkoṇāṅkita padmamiti kecit ||

taduktaṃ gāndharve ||

ṣaṭkoṇānantaraṃ padmaṃ bhūbimbadvitayaṃ punaḥ |
tanmadhye pūajayed devyāvāhanamvaca || 

iti bīja likhane bhūpūrvavat | tatraiva viśeṣo yadā |

<p. 8b>

ṣaṭkonānte likhed bījaṃ pretākṣaṃ pūrvavachavaṃ |
sārasvatārthināntu viśeṣa tantrāntaramuktaṃ ||

taduktannīlatantre ||

vyāme dvau rasanārṇakarṇitamacāndvandvau sphurat 
keśaravargāllāsitamuchadambasumatī gehena saṃveṣṭitaṃ |

tārādhīśvaravārivarṇavilasat dvikkoṇa saṃśobhitaṃ yantromīlatanoḥ 
parannigaditaṃ sarvārthasiddhipradaṃ |

evameteṣāmanyatamaṃ viracaryapurato gambhāryādi pīṭhe nidhāya pīṭhamarcayet |

oṃ hūṁ śmaśānāyai namaḥ |

