kakartṛkena smaret svamātmāmapitārirṇimayambiruddhavākyārtha sa 
vahnimaṇḍalena vāṃbudā bhāṅguṇasaṃnatodarīṃ | atīva kharvānavayauvana 
sthitāmadhastha śārdula kṛta bandhajaṃghilo |

<p. 15a>

anekamāhātmaśavoparisthitāṃ śavorddhamālīḍhatayādapaṃkajāṃ |
viśīrṇavarṇāmṛśiraśrajodbhaṭāntrayīvivartāruṇalocanatrayāṃ ||

abhedapiṃgaikajaṭāvirājitāmvibhūṣaṇāsthi nṛkapālabhīṣaṇāṃ |
mahāṣṭasiddhi prakaṭā hi bhūṣaṇāmaṭṭāṭṭahāsai jagatāmabhitidā ||

jaṭā anantaḥ śravaṇau ca takṣakau mahādi padmo hṛdihārabhūṣaṇāṃ |
tathaiva karkoṭakṛtopavītikāṃ sumekhalāyāmatha deva vāśukiṃ ||

sa śaṃkhapāle na ca kakaṇo gateḥ padeṣu padmaḥ kilanūpure śriyaṃ |
ujeṣunāgaḥ kulikoṅgado mato bhujorddhamālāmanujāsthibhirmatāḥ ||

<p. 15b>

śitañca rakto dhavalaśca mecakastathaiva pītāpyaśitañca pāṇḍuva |
bhujaṅgamālā iha varṇajātayo bhavaṃti sarve maṇibhirjvalambitā ||

kapālakartṛgranthitogramūrddhajāṃ samānamandīvarakāntimālikāṃ |
vikoṣakhaḍgaśatataśca dakṣiṇe svapauruṣe paidedhatīṃ bhujaiḥ sadā ||

padābjadraṣṭā dvaya paṃcamudrayāvirājamānāmasitotpalaśrajā |
acintayentā ca kavitvakāṇiṃ manogatārthañca jatmutāriṇīṃ ||

<p. 16a>

iti śrutaya |

atha śrīśaṅkarabhagavatpūjyapādamatandhyāyet |

śrīnīlasāradāyai namaḥ |

jvalatyāvaka jvālamālāti bhāsvaccitāmadhyasaṃsthāṃ supuṣṭāṃ sukharvāṃ |
śavamvāmapādena kaṇṭhe nipīḍā sthitān dakṣiṇenāṃghriṇānnipīḍyaṃ || 1 ||

bṛhallambamānodarī meghamarṇaṃ sumuntṛgapīnastanābhogaramyāṃ |
javārāgāñja pravṛtta trinetrāṃ lalajihvayā draṃṣṭrayābhīṣaṇāsyāṃ || 2 ||

<p. 16b>

lasadvīpi carmāvṛtāṅgāsmitāsyāṃ jaṭājūṭamadhye sthitendīvarāṅgī |
śirodeśabhāsvatpiśaṅgāti sarpyājaṭājūṭamadhyasthitākṣobhyamūrktim || 3 ||

mithaḥ keśavaṃddhāśirachinnasamyak galallohitānmānavīmuṇḍamālāṃ |
dadhānānṛpañcāśadakhena saṃkhyāśirachinnamuṇḍāvalī nirmitāṅgī || 4 ||

sadodyannṛmāṃsankarādhārya savyasphuratyāninādhārayaṃtīnmahāsiṃ |
kare vāma iṣatsyuradraktanālasphurannīlayaṃ keruhandhārayaṃtī || 5 ||

<p. 17a>

kare savya uccairadhastāddadhānāṃ sitāṅkartṛkāmvāmapāṇau kapālāṃ |
jagatmūrtiṃ saṃsārajāḍyāti pūrṇaṅkare kartṛkādhārayā khaṇḍayantī || 6 ||

vanābhā hi baddhaṃ jaṭājūṭamūccairjavārāganāgollasatkuṇḍalāśca |
lasaddhumarovirmahānāgakāya sphuraccārukeyurasobhābhirāmāṃ || 7 ||

suvarṇābhanāgollasatkaṃkaṇena spharannīlasatsvetanāgabhirāmāṃ |
śarīre ca durvādalasyāmanāgaiḥ kṛtaścāru yajñopavītandadhānā || 8 ||

dadhānāṃ ca kundābha nāgena samyak kṛtaścāru koṭeya sūtraṃ pavitra |

<p. 17b>

mahāpāṭālobhena nāgena vṛttāmvibhūṣaṇāśca pādadvaye sadadhānāṃ || 9 ||

vicitrāsthimālāṅkapālaṃ karālaṃ lalāṭe ca paścānvitandhārayantī |
ciraścintayāmīdṛśāṃścārurūpāṃ sameyāmadoṣāmatarkyāmapārāṃ || 10 ||

muraśreṇimauriprabhāraṃjitāghriṃnatāśeṣadoṣāpadāmiṣṭadātrīṃ |
yadīya prasādādīdamviśvajātāṃ yaśaḥ prāpnuyānmodate sāsvatīti || 11 ||

sadaimaṃstavaṃ yaḥ paṭhed dekacitto vasastasya loke bhavedatranūnaṃ |

<p. 18a>

na dāridryapāpai na vā durmatiḥ syāllabhetāpi mokṣantathā dharmakāmo || 12 ||

ete dhyāna bhedādakajaṭāvidyān sundaratayā tattatprakaraṇa darśanat |

iti śrīśaṃkarācārya viracito devyābhujaṅgaprayātadhyānabhedaḥ |

evaṃ bhūtamātmānaṃ dhyātvā bhūtaśuddhiḥ |

atha svavāmabhāge trikoṇasuvarttula caturaśramaṇḍalaṃ kṛtvā tatra sādhāraṃ 
kapālādi pātrannidhāya tadukta kapālaṃ sphuṭaṃmatra siddhijanaka ityādi 
tantrarājavacanāt |

<p. 18b>

taṃ mūla mantreṇa vimalajalenāpūrya bilvapatra raktacandana vajrapuṣpākṣatādi 
nikṣipyārghyāsya aṃgayādiṣu madhye dikṣu ṣaḍaṃgādi vinyasya tataḥ |

daśadhāmūlavidyaṃ japtvā tejo mayena tajjaptena jalena sarvavidyāmayaṃ 
kṛtvārghyamviprāṇāyāmādikaṃ kuryāt |

taduktaṃ phetkāriṇyāṃ |

bhūtaśuddhimvidhāyātha arghyādisthāpanaścaret |
prāṇāyāma tataḥ kuryād ṛṣyādi nyāsamācaret ||

nyāsaukarāṃgakau kṛtvā ātmānantāriṇīṃ smaret |

<p. 19a>

tato vāmanāsāpuṭe mūlavidyayā caturvālaṃ japan vāmanāsāpuṭena 
vāyumārpurya tasyaiva ṣoḍaśavāraṃ japan madhyanāḍyāṃ kuṃbhayitvā 
bālāṣṭaka jayena dakṣiṇanāsāpuṭhe recayet | ityaśaktau || 

śaktasu ṣoḍaśacatuḥṣaṣṭidvātriṃśatsaṃkhyāyā kuryāt | śirasi |

akṣobhya ṛṣaye namaḥ | mukhe vṛhaṭichandase namaḥ | hṛdi ekajaṭāye 
devatāye namaḥ | hūṁ bījāya namaḥ | guhye śeṣamuccāryakīlakāye namaḥ | 
punastathaiva ca | mama huta kavitvā pāṃḍityādi siddhyarthe viniyogaḥ |

<p. 19b>

nīlatantre |

akṣotya ṛṣiretasya bṛhatī chanda (* *) ritaṃ |
nīlasarasvatī devī triṣu lokeṣu gopitā ||

hūṁkārabījamantra śaktiḥ syāccaturvargāphalapradaṃ |
karāṃga nyāsau kuryāt | yataḥ | hrāṃ akhilavāgrūpiṇyai namaḥ | aṃguṣṭaye | 
hrīṁ akhaṇḍavāgrūpiṇyai namaḥ | tarjanyauḥ | hūṁ brahmavāgrūpiṇyai namaḥ | 
madhyamayoḥ | hraiṁ viṣṇuvāgrūpiṇyai namaḥ | anāmayoḥ | hrauṁ 
radravāgrūpiṇyai namaḥ | kaniṣṭayoḥ | hūḥ sarvagrūpiṇyai namaḥ |

<p. 20a>

karatala pṛṣṭayoḥ | iti karāṃga nyāso vidhāya | punaḥ | hrāṁ akhilavāgrūpiṇyai 
namaḥ | madhyamayoḥ | hṛdayāya namaḥ | iti tarjanīmadhyamānāmikābhiḥ | 
hṛdaye | hrīṁ akhaṇḍavāgrūpiṇyai namaḥ śirase svāhā | iti tarjanī 
madhyamābhyāṃ śirase | hūṁ brahmavāgrūpiṇyai namaḥ | śikhāyai vaṣaṭ | 
ityadhoṅguṣṭayoḥ | śikhāyāṃ | hraiṃ vijaṭe astrāya phaṭ | iti 
tarjanīmadhyamābhyāṃ | ūrddhoddhatāratrayachotikābhirdeśadigvaṃdhanaṃ 
kāryaṃ | evaṃ ṣaḍaṃgavinyasya brahmājali viracya ātmābhedena kṣaṇaṃ ||

<p. 20b>

dhyāye | yathā |

pratyālīḍha padārpitāṃghriṇa ca hṛtaghorāṭṭahāsāya 
khadgendāvarakatṛkharpastutā hūṃkārabījodbhavāṃ |

kharvānīlaviśālapiṃgalajaṭājūṭogranāgrairyutājāḍyaṃ nyasya kapālake 
trījagatāṃ haṃ ugratārā svayaṃ |

tatkarakalitadurvākṣata raktaṃ candanākṣatāddimilita dinakare 
kiraṇaruṇakusumāṃjalaumātṛkāmantudhyātvā hṛdayānmūlamantra tejo sayī 
śuddhajñāna caitanya 

<p. 21a>

mayīṃ tāṃ ṣaṭcakrannedakrameṇa śiraḥ sthitasahasradalakamalakarṇikānta gata 
paramaśivanprāpayitvā samabhihāreṇa tadamṛtāṃbudhau viśrāmya tadamṛta 
lolābhūtāmānandamacīntā pravahaṃ cāsāpuṭenānīya kalpita mūrttau 
samāvāhayet | deveśi bhakti sulabhe | parivārasamanvite |

yāvat tvā pūjayiṣyāmi tāvat tvaṃ susthirā bhava |
ekajaṭe ihāvaha 2 ityañjali sthāpanena darśayet ||

iha tiṣṭa (2) iti sayavādhyai mukhaḥ | iti sannidhe hi | ityaṅguṣṭamuṣṭibhyāṃ 

<p. 21b>

iha sannirudhyasya | sarvāṃguṣṭabharbhinīmṣṭibhyāṃ | tataḥ āde nyaṅge khaḍga 
vinyaset | 

oṃ āṁ hrīṁ kroṁ hūṁ svāheti prāṇapratiṣṭhā kṛtvā | śrīmadekajaṭe 
vajrapuṣpaṃ na praticha hūṁ phaṭ svāhetyanena pañcopacārairarcayet | tato 
yonimudrāṃ pradarśayet | āgneryaṃ | hrāṁ ekajaṭāyai hṛdayāyai namaḥ | 
aiśānyā | tato aṃ a kaṁ khaṁ gaṁ ghaṁ punastataḥ | tyāktā ca dakṣiṇamūjaṃ 
spṛset sādhaka sattamaḥ | ṅaṁ caṁ chaṁ jaṁ sumuccārya jhaṁ ñaṁ ṭaṁ 
ṭhaṁ ḍaṁ ḍhaṁ tathā iti vāma bhuje nyasya

<p. 22a>

ṇaṁ taṁ thaṁ daṁ punaḥstarait | dhaṁ naṁ paṁ phaṁ baṁ bhaṁ iti dakṣiṇe 
jaṃghake nyaset | maṁ yaṁ raṁ laṁ śaṁ ṣaṁ saṁ haṁ kṣaṁ iti vāmake | iti 
vyādhya pravinyaśya mūlavidyāmuccaret | 

saptadhāvyāpakaṅkuryāt yena devī mayo bhavet | 

tataḥ pūrvoktaṃ yadheṣṭadhyātvā kalakalitadurvākṣatavajrapuṣpādi milita dinakara 
kiraṇa kusumāñjalau mātṛkāmantra dhyātvā hṛdayānmūlamantra tejomayīṃ 
śuddhajñāna caitanya rūpatāṃ ṣaṭcakrabhedakrameṇa śirovasthita sahaśradala

<p. 22b>

kamalāntargataṃ paramaśivan prāpayitvā kriyāsamabhihāreṇa tadamṛtāvudhau 
viśrāmya tadamṛtalolībhūtāmānanda caitanyamayīmvahaṃ nāsāpūṭenānīya 
kalpitamūrttau samāvāhayet |

deveśi bhaktisurabhe parivāra samanvite |
yāvat tvā pūjayiṣyāmi tāvatvaṃ susthiro bhava ||

śrīmaddeka jaṭe ihāvaha (2) ityaṃjaliṃ sthāpane darśa | iha tiṣṭa ityadho mukha iha 
sannidhe hi | ityaṃguṣṭamuṣṭikābhyāṃ | iha sanniruddha sva (2) 
sarvāṅguṣṭagarbhiṇī | tata ātmavad devyaṃge 

<p. 23a>

ṣaḍaṅgāni vinyaset | āṁ hrīṁ svāhā iti prāṇapratisthāpya mūla vidyā yānte 
śrīmaddekajaṭe vajrapuṣpa praticha hūṁ phaṭ svāhā |

ityanena pādyādibhiḥ ṣoḍaśopacārairarcayet |

taduktaṃ phetkālitantre |

āvāhya sthāpayitvā tu dhyātvaiva pūjayetat |
śrīmaddeka jaṭe vajra puṣpanpratīchamityapi ||

mūlenāgni priyāntena satālena yajet puna |

nīlatantre |

sarvamantra yuta kṛtvā devatāyai nivedayet |
abhāve vajrapuṣpasya smaraṇāt phalabhāg bhavet ||

<p. 23b>

mahātaṃtre |

mantranīlasarasvatyāṃ pādyārghyārcāmanīyasnānavasanābharaṇāni ca 
gaṃdhapuṣpadhūpadīpanaivedyācamanantataḥ |

tāmbulamarcanāstotraṃ tarpaṇaṃñca namaskṛyā |
prayojayedarcanāyāmupacārāstu ṣoḍaśa ||

taduktaphetkāliṇyaṃ |

ṣaḍaṅgamarcayed devyā dehe vā keśareṣu vā | 
asminneva samaye devyā vāyavyādiśānāntaṃ gurupaktimarcayet | tadaśaktau | 
gurutrayān | athavā ṛṣimānaṃ |

<p. 24a>

taduktambhāvacūḍāmaṇau |

śrī īśvara uvāca |

mātaddevi mahāmāye bandhamokṣa pravartinī |
idānī śrotumicchāmi gurukramamanuttamaṃ ||

śrīdevyuvāca ||

guru kramastu bahudhā maṃtragauravavistarāt |
sugaṃdhiśvetalohitya kusumairarcaye sadā ||

athavā gaṃdhāyo naivedyāḥ pūjāpaṃcopacārikā |

tatra puṣpa | nāmni yathā | taduktamatsya sūkte | 

sugaṃdhiśvetalohitya kusumairarcayet sadā |
bilvamaruvakādyaiśca tulaśī varjataiḥ śubhaiḥ ||

<p. 24b>

odrapuṣpairviśeṣeṇa vajrapṣpaṇasiṃtritaṃ |
sarvapuṣpaṃ pradadyācca bhaktiyuktena cetasā iti ||

athavā taduktaṃ maṃtracūḍāmaṇau |

arghadattvājjavāpuṣpaṃ dāpayet mantramuccaret |
vajrapuṣpaṃ pratīcheti sambodhana padānvitamiti ||

naivedyaśca yathāmatsyasūkte |

pāyasaṃ kṛśaraṃ dadyāt sarkarāguḍasaṃyutaṃ |
gavyandadhimadhumiśraṃ tathāntāni nivedayet ||

śāṃlamatsyaśca pāṭīnaṃ godhikāmāṃ samuttamaṃ |
atra ca madhunā yuktaṃ yadhā dadyācca maṃtravit ||

<p. 25a>

tato yoni mudrāṃnpradarśyājñāprathyaparivāramarcayet |

yathā keśarāgnīsāsuravāyuṣumadhye dikṣu ca |
devyāstu tadaṅge vā ṣaḍaṅgamarcanyet ||

pūrvādi digniyamastu |

pūjyapūjakayormadhya prācītikirtyate budhaiḥ |
tadakṣiṇaṃ dakṣiṇaṃ syāduttaraṃ cottaraṃnmataṃ ||

pṛṣṭhastu paścimanproktaṃ sarvatraivanprapūjya ca |
hrāṁ akhilavāgrūpiṇyai hṛdayāye namaḥ ||

eka jaṭāyai namaḥ |

śirase svāheti krameṇa vāmānasollase |
gurukramandevaṃ layamagau bhaviṣyati ||

<p. 25b>

neṣṭamantramārgo vighanena tādṛk siddhigocaraḥ |
guruṇāṃ śiṣyabhūtānāṃ stricet santati kramaḥ ||

tatra mantrāśca vidyāśca niphalānātra saṃśayaḥ |
unaviṃśati puruṣānvāpī navasaptatrayoyi vā ||

na jñātvā guruvaṃśānāṃ śiṣya cet naṣṭa saṃtati |
svavaṃśādadhikaṃ jñeyaṃ guruvaṃśaṃ śubhāśubhaṃ ||

janakādadhikaṃ jñeyaṃ mantradasva maheśvaraḥ |
tasmād yatnena deveśi saṃchepācchṛṇu pārvatī ||

śṛṇutārāgunvakṣa dṛṣṭādaṣṭaphalapradān |

<p. 26a>

urddhvakeśo vyomakeśo nīlakeśo vṛṣadhvajaḥ |
divyaughā siddha dāhyate siddhoghān śṛṇu tatvataḥ ||

vaśiṣṭakurmanāthaśca mīnanātho maheśvaraḥ |
harinātho mānavaughān vakṣyāmi gurutā śṛṇu ||

tārāvatī bhānumatī jayāvidyā manoharī |
mukhānanda parānanda pārijātaḥ kuleśvarāḥ ||

virupākṣa bhairavī ca kathitantāriṇī kulaṃ |
siddhaughāmānavoghe ca divyaugha parameśvarī ||

akṣobhyaḥ sarvamūrddhanyaṃ strimūrtināgarūpadhṛk |
ānandanātha sabdāntā gurave sarva siddhidāḥ ||

<p. 26b>

striyopi gururūpāśca devyānā parikīrtitā |
athavā sarvaśāstreṣu gurava sarvasūcitāḥ ||

kulacūḍāmaṇyau devaḥ gurun śṛṇu maheśvaraḥ |
yeṣu yeṣu ca maṃtreṣu ye ye ṛṣigaṇā smṛtāḥ ||

te te pūjyā saparyādau saṃkṣepāṃ gaditaṃ mayā |
aśaktānāśca saṃkṣepāṅgurvarcanaṃ yathā bhavet ||

tatha tatraivoktaṃ ||

ājñātagurunāmnā vai guru tritayamarcayet |
catuṣṭayamvāsaṃvāco na ca karyā tataḥ paraṃ ||

atha prakārāntaraṃ 

<p. 27a>

yathā tadapyuktantārārṇave | parasādi guruṇāṃ nirṇayoḥ | yathā 

ādau sarvatra deveśaḥ mantradaḥ paramā guruḥ |
parāpara gurustvaṃ hi parameṣṭirahaṃ svataḥ ||

sarvamantreṣu vidyāṣu svayan prakṛtirūpiṇī |
guruparaguruṃ caiva parāpara guruntataḥ ||

parameṣṭi guruṃ caiva kathitā guravastataḥ | iti śrīguru nirṇayaḥ |

akṣobhyavajrapuṣpaṃ pratīcha hūṁ phaṭ svāhā |

taduktaṃ phetkāriṇyaṃ |

vajrapuṣpapratīcha hūṁ phaṭ svāhā | iti mantrataḥ |

<p. 27b>

etat mantre nāma sātraṃ bilva caiva na saṃśayaḥ |
anena manunā sarvān parivāra yathārcayet ||

oṃ śaṃpāṇḍuravajrapuṣpaṃ pratīcha hūṁ phaṭ svāhā |
oṃ padmanābhavajrapuṣpaṃ pratīcha hūṁ phaṭ svāhā |
oṃ amitābha vajra puṣpanpratīcha hūṁ phaṭ svāhā |
oṃ māmaka vajra puṣpaṃ pratīcha hūṃ phaṭ svāhā |
oṃ māmaka vajra puṣpaṃ pratīcha hūṁ phaṭ svāhā |
oṃ pāṇḍava vajra puṣpaṃ pratīcha hūṁ phaṭ svāhā |
oṃ tāre vajra puṣpaṃ pratīcha hūṁ phaṭ svāhā | iti |

pūrvādivāracatuṣṭaye |

<p. 28a>

oṃ padmāntaka vajra puṣpaṃ praticha hūṁ phaṭ svāhā |
oṃ yamāntaka vajra puṣpaṃ pratīcha hūṁ phaṭ svāhā |
oṃ vighnāntaka vajra puṣpaṃ pratīcha hūṁ phaṭ svāhā |
oṃ narāntaka vajra puṣpaṃ pratīcha hūṁ phaṭ svāhā |

taduktaṃ phetkāliye |

oṃ akṣobhya vajrapuṣpādau tāriṇīṃ mūrddhi pūjayet |
tathā vai locanaṃ śaṃkhaṃ pāṇḍaraṃ padmanābhakaṃ ||

amitābhaṃ yajet mantrī dikṣu pūrvādi catuṣṭaye |
nāmakaṃ māmakaścaiva pāṇḍarantarayā saha ||

<p. 28b>

brahmādiṣu catuḥkoṇe mantrai svai svai kramād yajet |
dvāre pūvāditaḥ padmāntakaścāpi yamāntakaṃ ||

vighnāntakaṃ samabhyarcya pūjayet narakāntakaṃ |

iti saṃpūghanityahomaṃ kuryāt | soma tujagāvallyāṃ |

nājaptaḥ siddhyate maṃtro nā hūṁ taśca balapradaḥ |
nā pūjyo prāpyate kāmyan tasmāntrittayamācaret ||

pūjāyā labhate pūjāṃ japāt siddhi na saṃśayaḥ |
vibhūtiścāgni kāryena sarvasiddhiśca vindati ||

nīlatantrepi |

<p. 29a>

nityahomaṃ pravakṣāmi sarvārthaṃ yena vindati |
saparyā samyagā sādya baliḥ pūrvaścaret vidhiḥ ||

tato japantarpaṇaśca caret sādhakamuttamaḥ |
valivaiśvādikañcāpi brāhmaṇasamupācaret ||

vidhivadagnimānīyaḥ kravyādebhyo namonamaḥ |
kravyādāṃśaṃ parityajya tatogni sādhayet sudhī ||

tatomūlaṃmuccārya kuṇḍe vā sthaṇḍilepi vā |
bhūmau vāsastare vahni vyāhṛti tṛtayena tuḥ ||

āhuti trayamutkṣipya ṣaḍaṃgahanaṃ tataḥ |
tato devī samāvāhya mūlamaṃtreṇa ṣoḍaśaḥ ||

<p. 29b>

hutvāstutvā visṛje bindu maṇḍalaṃ |

tataḥ svavāme trikoṇavṛttacaturasramaṃḍalaṃ kṛtvā puṣpai samabhyarca tatra 
vihita bali dravyabharitaṃ pātrannidhāya aṃguṣṭānāmikābhyāṃ spṛṣṭvā |

oṃ hrīṃ ekajaṭāyai mahāyakṣādhiyāyai upanīta valīṃ gṛhna 2 gṛhnāpaya 2 
mama śāntiṃ kuru 2 paravidyāmākṛṣya kruṭ 2 chiṃndha 2 hrī svāhā | iti trivāra 
paṭhitvā bali dadyāt | rahasya mālayā yathāśaktiṃ japet | nigadena upāṃśunā 
vāmānase vā yathā ||

<p. 30a>

śaṃkhya sahaśraśata aṣṭādhikaṃ japet | japalakṣaṇa vimalā tantre yathā |

manaḥ saharaṇaṃ śauca maunaṃ maṃtrānucintanaṃ |
avyagratvamanirdaśya jayāḥ saṃpatti hetaveḥ ||

mantramuccārayed vācā nigadaḥ sajayaḥ smṛtaḥ | 
śanairuccārayanmantramīṣadoṣṭaṃ pracārayet ||

kiñcichravayogyaṃ syādupāṃśuḥ syāchataguṇaḥ sahasau mānaso japaḥ |

japarahasyaṃ yathā |

mūlādhārasvadhisthāna maṇipūrakeṣu taḍitkoṭika tārāṃ bījavyāptiṃ vibhāvya 
tathaiva phatkārasya hṛdaye |

<p. 30b>

tathoktaṃ |

nārāṃ ṣaṭpadyāṃ | phatkāraṃ hṛdaye dhyāyet | taduktaṃ nīlatantre |

maṃtradhyānaṃ pravakṣyāmi japāt sarvajñatāṃ bhavet |
mantradhyānān maheśāni siddhyante mantrajātayaḥ ||

mūlacakrepahṛlleṣā sūryakoṭisamaprabhāṃ |
mūlādi brahmaradhrāntaṃ sarvāmvidyā vibhāvayet ||

sūryakoṭī pratīkāśā yogibhirduṣapūrvikāṃ |
athavā pūrṇacandrābhaṃ kūrcamūrddhni sudhā smṛtrāṃ ||

<p. 31a>

athavā sarvavidyānāṃ jihvāyān dīparūpiṇīṃ |

vibhāvya tatprabhāpaṭalai jihvāmapi dīparūpāmvibhāvyajeyet ||

taduktaṃ phetkārīye |

jihvāyāṃnesanādevamūkopi sukavirbhavediti ||

nitya pūjā japanirṇayastu ||

sahasraikaṃ japet mantraṃ śanaṃ dina jantu vā |
viṃśatyā vā japet mantraṃ mato nyūnaṃ na pūjyate ||

tataśca |

guhyātiguhyagoptītvaṃ gṛhānasmatkṛtaṃ japaṃ |
siddhirbhavatu me devi tvat praśādā tvayi sthite ||

ityārghyodakājjalakusumairdevyā vāmahaste tejo mayaṃ japaṃ samarpayeti |

<p. 31b>

viśeṣaphalakākṣābhiḥrayaṃ kramo niśāyāmā caraṇīyaḥ |

taduktaṃ phetkāriye |

balipūjādikaṃ yatnāṃ niśāyāṃ kriyate sadā |
tattadakṣayatāṃ yāti tārādevyāḥ prasādataḥ ||

arddharātrātparaṃ yacca muhurtadvayameva ca |
sāmāhārātriruddiṣṭānisā sāpi prakīrtitā ||

māyātantre | candracūḍāmaṇau ca |

rātrau prayatanaścaiva rātrau ca śakti pūjanaṃ |
na karoti kathaṃ deva sādhakaḥ kauliko bhavet ||

<p. 32a>

tataḥ pradakṣiṇīṃ kṛtvat stutvā sāṣṭāṅga pātena praṇamet |

yathāstuti |

oṃ ghorarūpe mahārāve sarvaśatrukṣayaṃkari |
bhakebhyo varade devi trāhimāṃ śaraṇāgataṃḥ ||

surāsurārcite devi siddhagandharva sevite |
jāḍyapāpahare devi trāhimāṃ śaraṇāgataṃ ||

jaṭājūṭa samāyukte lolajihvānukāriṇī |
drutapuṣṭikare devi trāhi māṃ || 3 ||

saumyarūpe kroḍharūpe candarūpe namostute |
sṛṣṭirūpe namastubhyāṃ trāhi māṃ || 4 ||

<p. 32b>

jaḍānāṃ jaḍatā haṃsi bhaktānāṃ bhaktavatsale |
mūḍhatāṃ hara me devi trāhi māṃ || 5 ||

hūṁ hūṁkāra maye devi bali homa priye namaḥ |
ugratāre namastubhyaṃ trāhi māṃ || 6 ||

buddhin dehi yaśo dehi kavitvan dehi dehi me |
durbuddhiṃ hara me devi trāhi māṃ śaraṇa || 7 ||

indrādi diviṣadvṛndavaṃdite karuṇā mayi |
tāre tārādhi nāthasya trāhi māṃ śaraṇāgataṃ || 

aṣṭamyāṃ ca caturdaśyāṃ navamyāṃ yaḥ paṭhet naraḥ |
ṣaṇmāsai siddhi māpnoti nātra kāryāvicāraṇā ||

<p. 33a>

mokṣārthi labhate mokṣaṃ dhanārthi dhanamāpnuyāt |
vidyārthī labhate vidyā tarkavyākaraṇādikaṃ ||

idaṃ stotraṃ paṭhed yastu satataṃ labhate naraḥ |
tasya śatruḥ kṣayaṃ yāti mahāprajñā ca jāyate ||

pīḍāyāmapi saṅgrāme jāpyadāne tathā bhaye |
ya idaṃ paṭhati stotraṃ subhantasya na saṃśayaḥ ||

evaṃ stutvā daṇḍavat praṇamya yoni mudrāṃ pradarśayet |
ātmasamayā padbhyāṃ karābhyāṃ jānubhyāṃ surasā śirasā dṛśā ||

<p. 33b>

manasā vacasā vāpi praṇāmoṣṭāṅga duritaḥ |
viśeṣa namaskārastu śaṃketa taṃtre ||

tatrikoṇa kārātārāyā prakirtitā |
ityatra trikoṇākāraḥ sarvatranamiḥ śaktairudiritāḥ ||

arddhacandramaheśasya pṛṣṭato nāti dīritaḥ |
vedyavidyādhanaṃ datvā samyak yajñasya yatphalaṃ ||

tatphalaṃ samavāpnoti sakṛtkṛtvā pradakṣiṇāṃ |

vārāhitantre |

pradakṣiṇatrayaṃ kuryāt deṣakrasamudāhṛtaḥ |
kulamudrāmiti go balivardanyā yenoktaṃ ||

<p. 34a>

ākṛti devatāmiti devyañgai nikṣipya | ātmasamarpaṇaṃ kṛtvā kṣamasvameti 
suṣumnnāvartmaṇā svahṛdi samānīya | punaḥ prāṇāyāmaṃ kṛtvā 
tanmanasātmāmanvibhāvyaḥ | tato aiśānyānnirmālya vāsinyai namaḥ ||

ityabhyarcya śeṣanirmālya śirasi dhṛtvā naive jātaṃ svīkṛttyasiddhi 
saṃkalpaḥ | sumukhī bhūtvā yathā sukhamviharediti |

[iti śaṃkarācāryaviracitāyāntārahasyavṛrttau nityapūjānirṇayaḥ prathamaḥ 
paṭalaḥ] || 1 ||


<p. 34b>

atha dīkṣāvidhirlikhyate |

taduktaṃ mahogratārākalpe |

kalpe dṛṣṭā tu tārā vai yo gṛhnāti narottamaḥ |
samvatsara sahaśraistuḥ niḥkṛtirnaiva jāyate ||

guromukhātmahāvidyā gṛhnīyāt pāpa nāśinīṃ |
tataḥ gurulakṣaṇaṃ ya kalpate ||

oṃ nīlavāgdeyai | mātarnīlasarasvatī praṇamatāṃ saubhāgya saṃpatprade 
pratyālīḍhapadasthite śava hṛdi smerānanāṃbho ruhe |

<p. 35a>

pulleṃdīvara locane trinayane kartrī kapālotpale khaḍgaścādadhatītvameva 
śaraṇaṃ tvāmīśvarīmāśraye || 1 ||

vācāmiśvari bhakta kalpalatike sarvārthasiddhiśvarī gadyaprākṛta 
padyajātacaraṇe sānnidhya siddhi prade |
nīlendivaralocane trayayute kāruṇya vārānnidhe saubhāgyāmṛtavarṣiṇī na 
kṛpadyāsiñcantimasmādṛśaṃ || 2 ||

kharve kharve sahaśra purita tano sarvāṅgaveśo jvale 
vyāghratvakyarivītasundarakaṭī vyābaddhajūṭāṅkite |

<p. 35b>

sadyaḥ kṛttagaladrajaḥ parimilanmuṇḍatrayīmūrddhaje graṃthi śreṇi 
nṛmuṇḍadāmalaline bhīme bhayaṃ nāśayaḥ || 3 ||

māyācāṅgavikārarūpa paramanīnvaddhacūḍātmike hūṁ phaṭ kāramayītvameva 
śaraṇamantrātmikamādṛśaḥ |
mūrtistejananīstridhāmaghaṭitāsthūlā hi sūkṣmāparāvedānāmapi gocaraṃ 
kathamapi prāptānnatāt prāpayaḥ || 4 ||

tvatpādāmbujasairayāsukṛtino gachanti sā pūjyatāṃ tasyaṃ śrīparameśvara 
hariharabrahmādi sāmyānmakaṃ |

<p. 36a>

saṃsārāṃbudhimajjanatpaṭutanūndevendramukhyāmurānmātastvatpada sevitodi 
mukhān kinnadhīḥ sevate || 5 ||

mātastvatpadapaṅkajadvayarajomudrāṅkakoṭīriṇaste devāsurasaṃgare vijayino 
niḥsaṅgasaṅgāṅgatāḥ |
sauvohaṃ bhuvane rasena mahasāspardhā vahannaśanai svantulyāntirata yathā 
suviravinyaśaṃ vrajantī svayaṃ || 6 ||

tvaṃ nāmasmaraṇāt parāyaṇa parādraṣṭunna śakrastute bhūta pretapiśāca 
rākṣasagaṇāyakṣāśca nāgādhipāḥ |

<p. 36b>

daityādānavapuṃgavāñca khacarāvyāghrādikā jantavo ḍākinyaḥ 
kupitāntakāśca manujāmānakṣaṇaṃ bhūtale || 7 ||

lakṣmī siddhi gaṇāśca pādukamukhāsiddhāstathā cāriṇāṃ naghaścāpi raṇāṃ 
gaṇe gajaghaṭī staṃbhastathā mohanaṃ |
mātastvatpadasevayā khalu nṛṇāṃ sidhyaṃtite te guṇāḥ 
krāntakāttamanobhavaśca bhavati kṣudrohi vācaspati || 8 ||

ugratārāṣṭakamidaṃ bhakti mānya paṭhet naraḥ |
prātamadhyāhnakāle ca sāyaṃ ca ninaśuciḥ ||

<p. 37a>

labhate kavitāṃ divyāṃ sarvaṃ śāstrārtha vidbhavet |
lakṣmīmanasvarānprāpya bhuktābhogānyathepsitān ||

kīrtiśāntiśca vairujyaṃ sarveṣāṃ priyatāṃ bhavet |
vikhyātaścaiva lokeṣu prāpyaṃte muktimāpnuyāt ||

iti nīlatantre |

tasmāt sarva prayatnena kulīnaṃ gurumāśrayet |
kulīnaḥ sarvavidyānāmadhikārī bhaved dhruvam ||

dīkṣā prabhuḥ sa evātmā sarvamantrasya nāparaḥ |
śraivopi sarvavidyānāmupadeṣṭā na śaṃśayaḥ ||

<p. 37b>

viṣṇuviṣṇumanasthānāṃ saurasauravidāṃsatāṃ |
gaṇapatyastu deveśi gaṇādīkṣapravartakaṃḥ ||

śaivaḥ śakopi sarvatra dīkṣā svāmi na saṃśayaḥ ||

sthāna nīyamo matsyasūkte |

goṣṭe śivālaye śūnye śmaśāne ca nadī taṭe |
goṣṭe ce grahaṇaṃ kṛtvā pūjaye siddhi vāścakaḥ ||

evaṃ siddhi labhaitmaṃtrī nānyathā nāmavāpnuyāt |
kṛṣṇapakṣasya cāṣṭamyaṃ śubhe lagne śubhe kṣaṇe ||

pūrvabhādrapadāyuktā mitratārādi saṃyute |
athavā cānurādhāyāṃ revatyaṃ nāpraśasyate ||

<p. 38a>

jānīyāchobhanaṃ kālaṃ mantrasya grahaṇanprati |

taduktaṃ nīlatantre |

rohiṇīśravaṇāddrāvadhaniṣṭācottarātrayaṃ |
puṣpaḥ śatabhiṣā caiva dīkṣā nakṣatramucyate ||

iṣe caiva viśeṣeṇa kārtikerāviśeṣataḥ |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ homa bilvapatreṇa kārayet ||

athavāṣṭādaśaṃ kuryādaṣṭāviṃsatimeva vā |
pāyasaṃ kṛsarandadyāt modakaṃ khaṇḍaśarkarā ||

baliṃ dadyāchāgalaśca godhāmāṃsamanuttamaṃ |
raṃbhāpuṣpaṃ śālamatsyaṃ juhūyācca prayatnataḥ ||

<p. 38b>

yavakṣīraṃ tato dadyāt śālpannaṃ madhunā yutaṃ |
nārikera jalandadyāt kāṃśyasya tadanaṃtaraṃ ||

śarkarāsaṃratan dadyāt matsyaṇḍiṃ ghanavartitaṃ |
pāyasaṃ kṛśaraṃ māṃsaṃ mādhiḥtamvaṭakantathā ||

baliṃ dadyā ca mahiṣaṃ pakṣiṇamvanya jātikaṃ |
pānaṃ nānāvidhaṃ deyaṃ svarṇādyābharaṇāni ca ||

kauśeyaṃ caiva kāryā saṃśūkṣmavāsāṃsi meva ca |
gobhūhiraṇyavastrādyaiḥ stoṣayed gurumātmanaḥ ||

<p. 39a>

sarvasvandakṣiṇāṃ dadyāt gāśca dadyāt payasvinī |
bhūmiṃ vṛttikarīn dadyāt putrapautrārtha dāyinīṃ ||

guruve dakṣiṇān dadyānsuvarṇāmvā sasānvitaṃ |
gurusaṃtoṣamātreṇa siddhirbhavatu sāsvatī ||

anyathā naiva siddhi syādabhicārāya kalpate |
viprebhyo bhojanan dadyād bahumāna puraḥsara ||

iti viśeṣaḥ |

atra virodhi sāmānyamapi kartavyamiti |

[iti tārārahasyavṛttau dīkṣāvidhiṃ nāma dvitīyapaṭalaḥ] || 2 ||


evaṃ sadgurorāhita dīkṣyāstataḥ |

śuddhaye puraścaraṇamārabhet |

<p. 39b>

gāndharvatantre |

suvāsinīṅkumārīntu bhojayed vahu yatnataḥ |
ārādhyābharaṇan dadyād yathā tuṣyeta devatā ||

iti nīlatantre |

evaṃ kṛtvā haviṣyāśī japalakṣanmananyadhiḥ |
tataḥ prayogaṃ sarveṣām vaśyādīnāśca kārayet ||

vīratantrepi |

svechācāraṣaro mantrī puraścaraṇa siddhaye |
rahasyamālāmādāya lakṣamekaṃ sadā japet ||

phetkāriṇī |

jaḍopi śūdra syād bhāranāvasa tatparāḥ |
labhate śrīmatāmvāṇī mantrasya lakṣajāpata ||

<p. 40a>

śrīmatāṃ vyāsa vaśiṣṭādīnāṃ kāṃm vidyāt prāpya krayo bhāratādīn pracakrire 
| ityutvāt |

kecintra bhāvana śaktānāt tattadācāra sahitānāṃścaturguṇaṃ japamācareti |

taduktamekavīrātantre |

bhāvanārahitānāntu kṣudrāṇāṃ kṣudra cetasāṃ |
caturguṇa japaḥ proktaḥ siddhaye nānyathā bhavet ||

evaṃnmahācīna kramāśaktānāṃ brāhmaṇāṃdināṃmapi caturguṇavidhānena 
japaḥ kāryaḥ |

jaḍopi yadi sudra syād bhāvanāvasa tatparaḥ |

ityādi śravaṇāt |

<p. 40b>

tattadācāra niratāḥ sarvaṃ varṇādvijātayaḥ |
tadanuṣṭāna niratāḥ sarve varṇā pṛthak pṛthak ||

iti atra siddhi vidyāyāścaturguṇa yugamevā |

pariśramo nāsti |

tadukta phetkārīye ||

viśeṣataḥ kaliyuge matprasādād bhaviṣyati |

mantracūḍāmaṇau |

siddhimantra tayānātra yugasevā pariśramo nāsti |

taduktaṃ phetkālīye |

viśeṣataḥ kaliyuge matpraśādāt bhaviṣyati |

tantracūḍāmaṇyau |

<p. 41a>

siddhimantra tayānātra yugaśevā pariśramaḥ |
naktabhojī havikṣāsi japed vidyān divā śuci ||

tatkṛtvā siddhimāpnoti japecca manasā sthiraṃ |
mantrakāle ca jāpe ca bhāryā yatnena varjayed viṣṇukalpañca varjayet tulasīdala |

varjayen mālatī puṣpaṃ varjayedanya pūjana |
hastaprakṣālanaṃ kṣaucamācāntantu sadā bhavet ||

devīnāñca tathā puṣpaṃ pṛthak pātreṣu sthāpayet |
ekībhāvaṃ na kartavyaṃ yaditchet siddhimātmanaḥ ||

<p. 41b>

naivedyādi phale stoyaijjānīyādeṣa evabhāk |
havirnānā vidhairgaṃdhaiḥ pāyase modakādibhiḥ ||

evaṃ krame niyūñjīta dadhikṣīrantathaiva ca |

rahasyamālā yathā |

akasmādīhitāsiddhirmahāsaṃkhākhyamālayā paṃcāśatmaṇibhinnānānirmitā 
sarvakāmadā iti |

mahāśaṃkha iti nṛlalāṭāsthibhiḥ |

kāntenāracitāmālā tayā prajaptogratāraika jaṭānīla sarasvatī maṃtraḥ śīghraprado 
bhavati |
nṛlalāṭāsthya bhāve tu ghaṭanāsautkarṣyanimittandehāntarasyāpyasthi grāhyā |

<p. 42a>

śivadīkṣāntargana ṭīkā |

taduktaṃ śāmravīsaṃhitāyaṃ |

syūtasūtrantitīhotra āvṛttiddhitaya punaḥ |
divāniśākarau proktau tasmāt tejaptayī śubhāḥ ||

idṛśyākṣantra(?)jāghaṃstu kurute japamuttamaṃ |
apamṛtyukavibhyāsamucyate nātra śaṃśayaḥ ||

gopanīye prayatnena yadicche siddhimātmanaḥ |

karamālānirṇayo yathā | taduktahahaṃsa parameśvare |

parvadvayamanāmāyāḥ parivartena vai kramāt |
parvatrayaṃ madhyamāyāntarjanyekaṃ samāharet ||

<p. 42b>

śāktamālā samākhyātā sarvamantra padīpikā |

taduktaṃ nīlatantre |

ekaikanmaṇimādāya brahmagraṃthi vinirdiśet |
anulome vilomābhyāṃ mātṛkāntaritāṃ japet ||

tena sarvaguṇopetā japaṃ te sarvasiddhi bhāk |

taduktaṃ me kavirātantre |

kullukāṃ ca tato natvā mālā pūjā vidhāya ca |
hṛhīyādakṣiṇe nātha na ca vāmena saṃspṛśet ||

nābhihṛd śiradeśe tu kullukāṃ paricintayet |
yadi sutra kṛtāmālā devyā prīti karī sadā ||

<p. 43a>

akārādi kṣakārāntāścākṣamālā prakīrtitā |

athavā mahāśaṃkhā bhāvena paścāśanmaṇimālayā sphaṭikī mālāyā vā japet 
|

taduktaṃ tārārṇave mahāśaṃkhapya śaktaścet sphāṭikī mālayā japet |

athavāramayogyānaṃ rahasyātirahasya likhyate |

taduktaṃ viśuddheśvara mahātantre |

kṛpayā śaṃkareṇoktā pārvatye rakṣamālikāṃ |
mālāvidhāna paramaṃ śṛṇu pārvati tatvataḥ ||

yena vijñānamātreṇa mantrāḥ sidhyanti tatkṣaṇāt |

asulomena mantramāntravibhedanaḥ |

<p. 43b>

mantreṇāntaritānāntu varyonāntaritanmanuḥ |
kuryāt mantramayī mālāṃ sarvamantrārtha bodhinī ||

varamarṇan meru rūpaṃ laṃghayetta kadācana |
meruśiraśca sarveṣāṃ yathā deve tathā hariḥ ||

tasmāntu sthira kāryena karmakuryād daharniśaṃ |
etat paraṃ rahasyānāṃ mayoktaṃ te yaśasvinī ||

tvayā guptataraṃ kāryan nākṣayaṃ yasya kasyacit |

tataḥ siddhaya gurubhakti bhāvāt paricaratiṃ vidhemaṅgākṛtya uttarābhimukhaḥ 
śirasi kullukāṃ kṣiptā yathā saṃkhyaṃ japet |

taduktaṃ |

<p. 44a>

gurucaraṇa saroja sarvadā bhakti bhāvāt paricarati vidheyo vāsya sarvāṅganā syāt |

anudina manumenanmānayanmānavau sau bhavati jagati vādi dvaita siddhānta hantā | 
matsyasūkte |

na jānāti ca yo mūḍha kullukāntariṇiṃ japet |
yāvajjivantu japtavyanna siddhyaṃti kadācanaḥ ||

mahāmaṃtraṃ parityajya pūjayed yastu tāriṇīṃ |
paścatvaṃ jāyate tasya avaśyamvātulo bhavet ||

evaṃ pūrvoktāsyānādimanudheyaṃ |

evaṃ muktena japtātadaśāṃśena homaṃ teṇābhiṣeka brāhmaṇa bhojana 
gurudakṣiṇāśca kramenācaret |

<p. 44b>

taduktaṃ |

lakṣamekaṃ japet mantraṃ haviṣyāśī jitendriyaḥ |
tattasthāna yathā tattadāsanaṃ saṃsthito sudhiṃ ||

pūrvokta pūjanaṃ kṛtvā viprārādhana tatparaḥ |
anaṃtaran daśāṃśena kramāddhomādikaścaret ||

rātrau baliṃ sadādeya sarvasiddhimabhīpsubhiḥ |

puraścaraṇahomoṅgastu |

vidheyaṃ nīlotpale sājyena bilvapatreṇa vā vidheyaḥ |

taduktaṃ siddha sārasvate |

<p. 45a>

evaṃ japaṃ yathā kṛtvā daśāṃśamasitotpavaiḥ |
ājyāktai juhuyānmantrī tarddaśāṃśena tarpaṇaṃ ||

kālāgurudravopetairvimalairgāndhavāribhiḥ |
tadaśāṃśaṃ brāhmaṇāntu bhojanaṃ samupācaret ||

ityevaṃ siddhimaṃtreṇa sarvakarmāṇi kārayet |

matsyasūktepi |

akṣatamvityapaśca daśāṃśaṃ juhuyā tataḥ iti |

ke valiṃ tilājyatiti guravaḥ | gurave dakṣiṇāśca dadyād yathā |

ajñātvā kullukāndevīmatraptā guru pādukāṃ |
na datvā dakṣiṇaṃ samyagakṛtvā krama pūjanaṃ ||

<p. 45b>

yosmiṃ taṃtre pravartaṃte tatapīḍadyase dhruvaṃ |

iti matsyasūktavacanā |

atra tu sarvajñeśvaravedānta sāṃkhyakāra yogaśāstre sāmūhaniḥ snehāsthi 
sparśe mahāmantra prabhāvāt |

prāyaścitta prakāśanā praśaṃgāt |

kvāpiśavoparitāmbulaścarvan japaśca pradarśitaḥ |
vīrasādhanādau śavopari prativihitaḥ ||

tatra snānamātramapi prāyaścittanna prakāśitamācāryena |

<p. 46a>

mahācīna bauddhasya vyapadeśa bauddhasya vyavahāraḥ spṛptā 
spṛṣṭitvanmantraraviruddhācārotra mantra prabhān |

āropahāryapavargā pradāyakamiti | mantrāṇāmbahunācāreṇavāsamanasmṛti 
virodhaḥ || te mantra vana doṣaḥ |

tadāhaṃkuccikādau |

yasmin mantreya ācārastatra dharmastu tādṛśaḥ |
kṛtārthastena jāyate svargo vā mokṣameva vā ||

bhrāntiratra na kartavyo siddhi hāni prajāyateḥ |
viśuddhi cittotra bhavet siddhisyodapavargadā ||

nanu somamābhicaraṇa japeditiṃ nyāyādabhicāryasiddhiḥ |

<p. 46b>

pāpa prasaṅgasya kathanna syāt |

nanūparapāya praśaktasya siddhirna bhavati sa ūpa padyate |

pāpamaṣyasiddhirna bhavati | sadupapadyate | pāpamanuṣyasya tasyāśamravāḥ | ata 
eva pāpaṃ na bhavediti |

anena viddhinā kutrāpyatra ukta vyavahāra darśanāt | sādhaka śarīraṃ nikaluṣaṃ 
lakṣate vyavahāra vidheraniṣṭāsiddhi sūcanācceti |

[iti tārārahasya vṛttau puraścaraṇa nirṇayostṛtīyaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 3 ||


atha naimittikā sthāna kramo yathā | taduktaṃ svatantratantre |

<p. 47a>

nityanaimittikaṃ kāmyaṃ sāpekṣaṃ pūrvapūrvataḥ |
anyathā ced bhavedittha kuryādāyatparaṃ parāṃḥ ||

nīlatantre |

nityācāra rato maṃtrī kuryāt naimittikārcanaṃ |
naimittikārcane siddhe kuryāt kāmyamakhaṇḍitaṃ ||

matsyasūkte |

aṣṭamyaṃ ca caturdaśyāṃ pūjayecca prayatnataḥ |
yadyat prārthayate maṃtrī tattadāpnoti nityaśaḥ ||

labhate maṃjulāṃ vāṇintathāṣṭamyāṃ mahā yajet |
aṣṭamyāṃ pūjayed devyā sarvakāmaphalaprada ||

<p. 47b>

ramāpuṣpabījapuraṃ sugaṃdhiparipūritaṃ |
miśrīkṛtabaliṃ dadyādaṣṭamyāñca viśeṣata ||

svarṇamālā tathā devyai dadyāṅgaṃdhairviśeṣataḥ |
phalakṣīrentathāraghāṅgovikaṃ śarkarānvitā ||

tasmāt sarva prayatnena saṃpatye pūjayechivāṃ |
dānaścākṣarya siddhāntandadyā devyai prayatnataḥ ||

nīlatantre |

aṣṭamyāśca caturdaśyāṃ pūjayecca yathāvidhiṃ |
ājñāsiddhimavāpnoti javāpuṣpaṃ ca varvarāṃ ||

candanaścārkakusumaṃ dadyāt svetā parājitāṃ |
śvetā yā dviguṇaṃ puṇyaṃ dadyāt kṛṣṇāparājitā ||

<p. 48a>

bandhūkāmālayā tuṣye yathā chāga pradānavat |
arghyandadyāt prayatnena nityapūjāsu sarvadā ||

aṣṭottaraśataṃ jāpyaṃ yāvajjīvati saṃkhyayā |
yastu saṃpūjayate durgā mahāṣṭamyān prayatnataḥ ||

trijanmanārjitaṃ pāpan tatkṣaṇādeva nāśayet |

durgāmiti tāriṇī | prakaraṇānukṛtatvāt |

ye jānanti mahāmāyāṃ jñātvā tatvena bhairava |
ājñāsiddhi mavāpyante dhruvaṃ yāti śivālayaṃ ||

tāriṇī yatra pīṭhe tu śīlā rūpeṇa tiṣṭati |
yatra yatnena gaṃtavyaṃ phalaṃ saśyāna vidyate ||

<p. 48b>

lakṣatrayaṃ japen maṃtran tāriṇī yatra tiṣṭati |
nispṛśaḥ sthiracittena siddhirbhavati tatkṣaṇāt ||

saṃkhyākṛtānmūrtikāśca akṣataśca tathaiva ca |
madhunāpāyasañcaiva kṣīraṃ sājyaśca śarkarā ||

baliṃ dadyācca godhā vai āsanaśca praśasyate |
rambhāpuṣpaṃ śālamatsyaṃ juhūyānmantravittamaḥ ||

sarvasiddhimanuprāpya ante mokṣamavāpnuyāt |
sākṣatam bilvapatraśca juhumācca sahaśrakaṃ ||

<p. 49a>

labhate maṃjulāmvāṇiṃ mahāṣṭamyāṃśca sādhakaḥ |
kullukāśca na jānanti mahāmaṃtraṃ japet naraḥ ||

paścatvaṃ jāyate tasya athavā vitulo bhavet |
tāriṇīścaṇḍikāyāśca mantraḥ kulluka varjitaḥ ||

matimānyo dvijātīnātrāyāste yaḥ kadācanaḥ |
kullukāśca śire dhṛtvā sarvayajñaphalaṃ bhavet ||

so sau pūjā sadāvyarthā sa sayajñastathaiva ca |
tārāmaṃtraśca kullukaṃ akṣaranmatramuttamaḥ ||

mantra cūḍāmaṇau |

kujavāre kulāṣṭamyaścaturdaśyā viśeṣataḥ |
yoginī pūjanantatra pradhānaṃ kūlapūjanaṃ ||

<p. 49b>

yathā viṣṇu tithau viṣṇuḥ pūjito vāṃchita pradaṃ |
yathākulatithau śaktiḥ pūjitā varadāyinīti ||

matsyasūkte |

aṣṭamyāṃśca caturdaśyāṃ pūjayecca viśeṣataḥ |
śaṃkhasthi tanno yaḥ pūrṇaṃ javāpuṣpaṃśca varvarāṃ ||

candanaścārka kusumaṃ śuklā caivāparājitā |
arghādānamviśeṣeṇa nitya pūjā kramaḥ smṛtaḥ ||

aṣṭottara śataṃ jāpyaṃ yāvajjīvati śaṃkhyayā |
sahaśramvā jape deve nitya pūjā vidhau śṛṇuḥ ||

<p. 50a>

mahāmāyā sadā pūjā pūjane kullakā parā |
stotramaṃtraranādīnāmanuṣṭāne ca sarvadā ||

anuṣṭānat tātuṣyāḥ sarvanta nisphalaṃ bhavet |
mahāvidyāśca san dhyāyā vāsudevaṃśca yorcayet ||

prāpnoti tatphalaṃ sarva harisāyujyatāmvrajet |
vāsudevo haro brahmā nāriṇī prakaṭiḥ sadāḥ ||

ekamūrtiḥ sadā cintya ekamūrti sadā sthitāḥ |
svargāmokṣa pradā devi jayavidyā pradāyinīṃ ||

dhanavidyā yaśo lakṣmīrāyurārogyavarddhanī |
tasmā prapūjayed devi gaṃdhapuṣpaiśca dhūpakaiḥ ||

<p. 50b>

naivedyairvividhairbhaktyā pūjayet tāriṇīṃ sadā |

atha naimitika viśaṣārcanaṃ | māyātaṃtre |

āṣāḍe śayanaṃ kuryāt siṃhe ca parivartata |
āśvine pūjaye devī paśumpāyasa modakaiḥ ||

rātrau pavitreṇa carajāpate surasundarī | devāprabodhayat |
svargepi na kadācanā śuklāṣṭamyāṃ ṣaḍāṣṭamyāṃ mahāṣṭamyāṃ yugasya ca 
|

māsaṃ meṣasya ca ratārātrau prapūjayet suddhī |

atha pīṭhārcanaṃ |

<p. 51a>

pīṭhānāṃ paramaṃ pīṭha kāmarūpa mahāphalaṃ |
tatra yatkriyate pūjā sakṛdvāpi maheśvaraḥ ||

vihāya sarvapīṭhāni tasya dehe vasāmyahaṃ |
tasmācchata guṇaṃ proktaṃ kāmākṣā yoni maṇḍalaṃ ||

teṣāṃ phalaṃ mahādevaṃ kathamvaktuśca śakyate |
yatra koṭiguṇaṃ sārddhaṃ ardhe vasati tāriṇī ||

yatpīṭhaṃ brahmaṇe proktaṃ guptaṃ sarvasukhāvahaṃ |
yato devāṃśca devīśca munayaścaiva bhāvajāḥ ||

sarvaprāvidbhavattyatra tena guptaṃ sadā kuruḥ |
dvividhaścaiva yatpīṭhaṃ durāyaṃ sādhakottamaiḥ ||

<p. 51b>

guptaṃ sarvatra deveśa labhyate kulasundarī |

tatra cūḍāmaṇau |

ekaścet kulaśāstrajñaḥ pūjāhastatra bhairavaḥ |
sarvatra ca surāpūjāḥ sadyo brahma śivādayaḥ ||

ekāced yuvatī tatra pūjitā cāvalokitā |
sarvā eva parādevyaḥ pūjitaḥ kula bhairavaḥ ||

ādau cānte ca madhye ca lakṣa mūrtau viśeṣataḥ |
na pūjayaṃti cet kāntāṃ tadā vighnairvilupyateḥ ||

pūrvājitaṃ phalaṃ nāsti kākavyāpara pūjaneḥ |
puraścaraṇa kāle ca yadī syāt pīṭha darśanaṃ ||

<p. 52a>

tadā tatra pīṭha pūjā manasāpi na hīyate |
devi kūṭe mahābhogāṃ udriyāne ca bhairavī ||

yoganidrā kāmarūpe mahiṣāsuramarddinī |
kātyāyanīṃ kāmagirau kāmākṣāṃ kāmadāyinīṃ ||

jālaḍhara tu pūrṇeśī pūrṇe śaile ca caṃḍikāṃ |
kāmarūpe tadā deva pūjyādi kūcaravāsinī ||

athavā kāmarūpasya darśanaṃ yadi bhāgyataḥ |
tadā bhagādi devīmāpūjā tatra vidhīyate ||

kulācāre kulāṣṭamyāṃ caturdaśyāmviśeṣataḥ |
yoginī pūjanantatra pradhānaṃ kula pūjanaṃ ||

<p. 52b>

yathā viṣṇu tithau viṣṇu pūjito vāṃchita pradaḥ |
tathā kulatithau śakti pūjitā varadāyinī ||

matsyasūkteḥ |

dvādaśyāṃ pūjayed viṣṇuścaturddaśyāmumāpatiṃ |
aṣṭamyāṃ pūjaye śakti sarvasiddhimabhīpsubhiḥ ||

atha śivāvali | mantracūḍāmaṇau |

bilvamūle prāntare vā śmaśāne vāpi sādhakaḥ |
māṃsapradānannaivedyaṃ saṃdhyākāle nivedayet ||

kālikālīti vaktavye mantrotha paśurūpiṇī |
paśurūpā samāyāti parivāra gaṇaiḥ sahaḥ ||

<p. 53a> 

muktāreti padaiśānyān mukhayuktolpa sundarī |
tadaiva maṅgalaṃ tasya nānyathā kula dūṣaṇaṃ ||

avaśyaṃ mantra dānena niyatantoṣayachivāṃ |
nitya śrāddhaṃ tathā sandhyā vadanaṃ pitṛtarpaṇaṃ ||

tathaivaṃ kulasevyānāṃ nityanākūla pūjaneḥ |
paśurupāṃ śivān devīṃ yorcayaṃti nitārcane ||

śivāravi na taśyāśu sarvannasyati niścitaṃ |
japa pūjā vidhānāni yat kiṃcit sukṛtāni ca ||

gṛhitvā śāpamāpādya śivāroditi nirjane |
ekayā bhujyate devi śivāyā tatra vai baliṃ || 

<p. 53b>

tatraiva sarva devānāṃ prīti paramadurlabhā |
paśubhaktirnare śakti pakṣiśaktistathaiva ca ||

pūjitānirguṇaṅkarma saguṇaṃ sādhayed yataḥ |
tena sarva prayatnena kartavyāṃ pūjanaṃ mahat ||

rājādi bhayamāpanne deśāntara bhayāntare |
śubhāśubhāni karmāṇi vicintya vali māharet ||

gṛhna devi mahābhāge śive kāmāgni rūpiṇī |
śubhāśubhaphalaṃ vyaktiṃ bruhi gṛhna baliṃ tathā ||

<p. 54a>

evamuccārya dātavyo baliṃ kulajana priye |
yadi na bhujyate vatsa tadā naiva śubhaṃ bhavet ||

śubhaṃ yadi bhavet tatra bhujyate tada śeṣata |
evaṃ jñātvā maheśāna śānti svastyayanaṃ care ||

iti śivāvaliḥ || athoktācāra niyamaḥ | nīlatantre |

prātarutthāyamaṃtrajña kulavṛkṣa praṇamya ca |
śiraḥ padme gurundhyātvā tat sudhā plāvitāṃ smaret ||

mānasairupacārairstāṃ mālādhyaniyatāśayaḥ |
mūlādi brahmarandhrāntaṃ mūlavidyāṃ vibhāvayet ||

<p. 54b>

sūryakoṭipratikāśāṃ sudhā prāvita vigrahā |

kulavṛkṣanirṇaya rudrayāmaloktaḥ |

pādādyādāṃdaśokokadanamadirayā keśaraḥ karṇikāraśca 
tovikṣahasātpātilakanaruṇame prīṇayānaśca gītyā |

salāyātkārṇikāraḥ kulavakanaruvaliṅgānānsindhūvāraḥ kādamvā 
kāminīnānmadayati niyataṃ yarśanāccamyaśākhī |

tathā ca śruti |

daśakulavṛkṣānāmarupaplavaḥ | atha samayācāra |

śrīdevyuvāca |

<p. 55a>

śriṇu putra rahasyaṃ me samayācāra lakṣaṇaṃ |
yena hīnā na sidhyanti mantrākoṭi sahaśraśaḥ ||

mānuṣāṃ kulaśākhāṇāṃ kulācārānusāriṇāṃ |
siddhāḥ syurnāsti saṃdeho vaiṣṇavācāra tatparaḥ ||

paranindā sahiṣṇu syādupakārarataḥ sadā |
sarve vipine caiva nirjine śūnyamaṇḍale ||

catuṣpathe jalamadhye yatra devākṛti bhavet |
kṣaṇaṃ dhyātvā manuṃ japtvā natvā gacched yathā vidhiḥ ||

tathā |

gṛdhramvīkṣa mahākālīnnamaskuryād yathākṣitaṃ |
kṣemaṃkarī tathā vīkṣa jaṃbukīyamadutikāṃ ||

<p. 55b>

kṛśādarī mahāmuṇḍe ajakeśī valī priye |
kulācāra prasannāsya namaste śaṃkara priye ||

tathā ca smaśānaśca śavandṛṣṭvā pradakṣiṇamanuvraje |
praṇamyānena maṃtrena maṃtrī mantra phalaṃ labhet ||

ghoradraṣṭe koṭalākṣī kiṭiśabda praśādhinī |
ghanaghore ravāsphāre namaste citi vāsini ||

rakta vastrāṃ rakta puṣpāṃ vilokya tripurāmvikāṃ |
praṇamyo daṇḍavad bhūmau ddhimanmantramudīrayet ||

baṃdhūkapuṣpasaṃkāṃśe tripure bhayanāśinī |

<p. 56a>

bhāgyodaya samutpanne namaste varavarṇinī ||

kṛṣṇavarṇentathā puṣpaṃ rājaputrakaṃ |
hastyeśca rathaśāstrāṇi phalakāmvīra pauruṣān ||

mahiṣakulanādhaśca smṛtvā mahiṣamarddinī |
praṇamyadaṇḍavadbhūmau durgāmvā jaya maṃgalam ||

praṇamya jagatonmādyā sarva ca vighnainna lipyate |
jaya devī jagadhātrī tripurāghe tridevate ||

bhaktebhyo varade devī mahiṣaghni namostute |
madyabhāśuṃ samālokya matsyanmāṃsa svaratriyaṃ |

<p. 56b>

dṛṣṭvā ca bhairavīn devīn praṇamya vimṛṣenmanuḥ |
ghoravighnavināśāya kulācāra samṛddhaye ||

namāmi varade devi muṇḍamālā vibhūṣite |
raktamālā samākīrṇamvarade tvān namāmyahaṃ ||

eteṣāṃndarśanādeva yadi naivanprakurvate |
śaktimantraṃ puraskṛtya tasya siddhirna jāyateḥ ||

iti naimittikavidhiḥ |

iti śrītārārahasyavṛttau naimittakavidhi caturvidha caturthodhyāyaḥ || 4 ||


atha kāmyānuccānuvidhi liṣyate | matsyasūkte |

<p. 57a>

homatarpaṇa pūjā ca bhāvanā japameva hi |
yantrasya dhāraṇañcaiva māraṇoccaṭano tathā ||

etāni kāmyakarmāṇi prayogo nyasamarcaret |

taduccaret | somatujavalyāṃ |

śāntikaṃ śiśire jñeyaṃ hemante pauṣṭikantathā |
ākarṣaṇamvasante ca grīṣme vidveṣaṇaṃ smṛtaṃ ||

prāvṛtyuccāṭanaṃ kuryācharatkāleṣu cetāni kurute sādhakaḥ sadā |
arddharātraṃ śaratkālo hemantañca prabhātakaḥ ||

pūrvāhna ca vasaṃtasyānmadhyāhno grīṣma eva ca |
pravṛṭarupoparāhnaḥ syāt pradoṣaḥ śiśiraḥ smṛtaḥ ||

<p. 57b>

atrapākulikhitadivarātri homastveka jaṭāpakṣe |

nīlasarasvatī pakṣe | kevalandi | vaivahomañca tantrattoktatvāt | ata evamadvayaṃ 
likhitaṃ | athavā |

uṣāyogo ca hemante prabhāte śiśirā game |
praharārddhe vasaṃte ca grīsmanmadhya dināntare ||

tūryayāme ca varṣākhye śaradasyaṃ gate ravau |

taduktaṃ phetkāriṇītantre vidyākāmena hotavyantilājya madhu saṃyutaṃ ||

tilamadhusaṃyuktamityāseya |

<p. 58a>

siddhisārasvate |

bandhukpuṣpahomena dāśavat kure nṛpān |
sarpillavaṇahomena samākarṣati sundarī ||

vakulaprasavai homāt saubhāgya labhate naraḥ |
mallikā jāti punnāga kadamvaiḥ puṣṭimāpnuyāt ||

rājapuṣpaprasūnasya homāt saṃpadamāpnuyāt |
durvā tilājya homena dīrghamāyuravāpnuyāt ||

saṃpūjyamūlamaṃtreṇa bilvapatrai ghṛtānvitaiḥ |
sahaśra pratyahaṃ kṛtvā prāpnoti paramāṃ gatiṃ ||

<p. 58b>

ghṛtāktamālatī puṣpa homaddūta kavīrbhavet |
tasya homasya sarvasya niyamo yuta saṃkṣakaḥ ||

iti homaprakaraṇaṃ | matsyasūkta tarpaṇaṃ |

madhunātarpaṇandevyāḥ sarvakāmaprapūrakaṃ |
mantrasiddhikaraṃ sākṣān māyā pātaka nāśanaṃ ||

tathaiva japa prakāraṃ ca |

haviṣyāśīnmukteśo japyādayuta sādaraṃ |
gadya padya mayī vānī tasya sarvavidhā bhavet ||

dhyāna prakārāntara |

uccātayati piṃgākṣī mantrā sayati kekalā |
vidrāvayati muktāsyā sandrāvayati ghūrṇitā ||

<p. 59a>

vikṣobhayati saṃkṣubdhā saṃghātayati sandharā |
prakṣobhayati saṃkṣubdhā vipraruddhā virodhayet ||

atra sarvasya kartavyaṃ bhāvanāni vicintanaṃ |
atroccaṭanādiṣu sarvadā sarvatraiva yato japediti ||

taduktaṃ siddha sārasvate |

śatābhijapamātreṇa rocanā tilakannaraḥ |
kṛtvā paśyati maṃtrīta kuryād dāśavad daśa ||

phetkāriṇī tantrepi |

puṣkariṇī ye jale aṅgāḍhe yaṣṭikaṣṭatamāgrahe |
daṇḍanānīya tannūrṇatilakannena kārayet ||

<p. 59b>

tenaiva madhu ghṛtena padmanī padma pātrake |
likhet mutrāvalī madhye mūlamantre vidarbhitaṃ ||

tatkaṇṭe catusre tu nikṣipya juhuyādapi |
sahasrakṣīra nīlāktaṃ padmānāṃ lohitānvitāṃ ||

asyārtha |

namo grahe niśākare sūrye vā nikṣipyeti |
kuṇḍamadhyadvādaśāṅgulodho bhāge nikṣipyetyarthaḥ ||

mūlamaṃtra vidarbhitamiti maṃtrastu hṛllekhā |
rephamadhya sa sadruta kavitva siddhi kuru 2 ityākhyā sahitaṃ likhet |

<p. 60a>

tataḥ prayogāntaraṃ | padmāvatī mantreṇa balin dadyāt | yathā |

oṃ padme padme mahāpadme padmāvatī māya svāheti maṃtreṇāyathā 
naimittikapaṭloktavad dadyāt | 

phetkāriṇīye |

praṇavaṃ pūrvamuddhṛtya padme yugmantathaiva ca |
mahāpadma padaṃ bruryāt padmāvatī padantataḥ ||

māhe svāheti yathā pūrvavacca baliṃ haret |
evaṃ yaḥ kurute karma tasmādruta kavi dhruvaṃ ||

atha sakala siddhaye vakṣamāṇa vali mantreṇa nitya pūjokta vali maṃtreṇa vā rātrau 
catuḥpaṭhe valin dadyāt |

<p. 60b>

phetkāriṇyaṃ |

upacāraviśeṣeṇa rājapatnī vasaṃ nayet |
rājānaṃ japamātreṇa balinā sakalaṃ jagat ||

asyārtha | upacāra viśeṣeṇati | matsyasūkte |

rumrājāti bījapūra sugaṃdhiparimiśritaṃ |
miśrīkṛtya baliṃ dadyādaṣṭamyāṃśca viśeṣataḥ ||

rājānājapamātreṇeti pūjādi vihite naiveti yāvat |
mantra sahita yoga pallavādi prayogeṇa rājā vaśyo bhavati ||

valināsakalaṃ jagadi |

<p. 61a>

matsyosūktokte naimittikapaṭalānumānena boddhavyāṃ |

nīlatantre |

prayogavalimantroya prayogāt sodhayed yadi |
arddharātre tato nityam vali dadyā catuḥpaṭhe ||

parasainyagrahāriṣṭa rogāsoka śanivāraṇaḥ |
praṇavaṃ pūrve muccārya ugratāratataparaṃ ||

vikaṭa draṣṭe parapakṣe mohaye yugmamuccaret |
khādaya paramartha tathā dvayandvayamvadet ||

yemāṃ hi situ mudyatā ninditumudyatasyatā yogini cakraistānāhāra hūṃ phaṭ 
svāhā ||

<p. 61b>

paravidyāmākarṣayacchedaya kapāle gṛhna 2 svāheti tanmanusvaya 
valimantreṇānena ca valiṃ dadyathā ruci |

tatraiva chāgādi dānaṃ |

sarakṣaṇapaśu devyagre sasthāpyantrarghodakena sanprokṣāstreṇa 
saṃlakṣakavacenāvaguṇṭhyo dhenumudrāyā amṛtikṛtya karṇe dhṛtvā 
maṃtraṃ paṭhet | gandhapuṣpākṣatādyaiḥ saṃpūjya | paśupāśāya vidmahe 
viśvakarmāya dhīmahi tanno jīva pracodayāt |

iti paśujāgaḥ |

<p. 62a>

atha khaḍga |

hrīṁ kālikāli vajrerilohadaṇḍāyai namaḥ | iti sajūpya khaḍgaṃ pūjayet ||

hūṁ vāgeśvarī brahmaṇāṃbhyāṃ namaḥ | hūṁ lakṣmī nārāyaṇābhyāṃ 
namaḥ ||

hūṁ umāmaheśvarābhyāṃ namaḥ | ityenena maṃtreṇa śivaśākta brahmaviṣṇu 
yuktāya khaḍgā namaḥ || iti dhyātvā saṃpūjya |

oṃ khaḍgāya khalunāśāya śaktikāryāya tatparaḥ |
paśuchedyastvayā śīghraṃ khaḍganāthaṃ namostute ||

tato mantreṇa durvākṣatānvita pānīyaṃ gṛhītvā dīrghāyustvanivṛtti paramapada 
gamana pūrvakaśāsvata samāvachinna

<p. 62b>

harṣabījaya kāmaḥ śrīnīlaśarasvatyai imaṃ papaśuntubhyamahaṃ sanpradade |

devyājñān prārthya paśu nivedayet | yathokta vidhānena tutyamastuyārpitaṃ || 
tatachinne |

dakṣiṇe pati me siddhirvāmabhāge ca ninditaṃ |
denyamadhye ca patitaṃ devi chadaṃ smared vadhaḥ ||

tataḥ kuṇḍāntikaṃ datvā āhutī daśapañcabhiḥ |
tenaiva duḥkṛtandoṣamvaliṃ lakṣaṃ salakṣaṇaṃ ||

tato rudhiramāsabhaktānvita vaṭuka yoginī kṣetrapālagaṇeśādīnā 
valimantrairvaliṃ havet |

<p. 63a>

hūṁ vāṁ vaṭukabhairavāya namaḥ | gaṃdhākṣata kusumaiḥ saṃpūjya | nai(##-)
hrāṁ yāṁ yoginībhyo namaḥ | gaṃdhākṣata kusumaiḥ saṃpūjya || iśāne |
hrāṁ kṣetrapālāya namaḥ | gaṃdhākṣata kusumaiḥ saṃpūjya || nai(-)ṛtya |
hrāṁ yāṁ yoginībhyo namaḥ | gaṃdhākṣata kusumaiḥ saṃpūjya || āgneyai |
hūṁ gaṇeśāya namaḥ | gaṃdhapuṣpaiḥ saṃpūjya || vali dadyāt ||
ani grahānprapāyā | taduktamvīratantre |

śmaśānāṅgāramādāya maṃgale vāsare niśi |

<p. 63b>

kṛṣṇavastreṇa samveṣṭā vadhnīyād rakta tantunā ||

śatābhimaṃtritantarcā niḥkṣipet paraveśmani |
saptāhāccāntare teṣānmuccātanamidaṃ mahat ||

phetkārīye |

narāsthinī likhenmantran kṣārayuktaṃ haridrayā |
sahasraṃ parisaṃjapya niśāyāṃ ravi vāsare ||

nikṣipyate yasya gehe mṛtyasya trimāsataḥ |
kṣetre tu śasya hāniḥ syājjavahānisturaṃgame ||

dhanahānirddhanāgāre grāmamadhye tu tatkṣaṇāt |
dveṣa dveṣa tayornāsti tasya dveṣo mahān bhavet ||

<p. 64a>

likhet maṃtramiti |

mantralikhitvā hṛlleṣā repha madhye amuka māraya (2) ityādi | sādhya 
sahitaminyartha | athavā sādhya likhitvā tadante mantra likhet | sahasra parimitaṃ japet 
| amukaṃ māraya (2) ityanta mantrajāpaḥ | dveṣye tu | amukāmukayo vidveṣaṃ kuru (2) 
ityarthānta mantramuccārya sahasraṃ japet | atha śākādyai dhāraṇāyantra likhyate | 

phetkāriṇīye |

<p. 64b>

yoni yugmaṃ likhenmantraṃ mūlaṃ hemaśalākayā |
klīṁ vamantrān dīrghavarṇān ṣaṭkoṇe vilikhet tataḥ ||

aṣṭapatre aṣṭavarṇān tadvahi bhūpura dvayaṃ |
aṣṭavajaṃ bhūpuraśca vilikhe sādhakottamaḥ ||

suvarṇapaṭṭaropye vā bhūrye vāpyatha suvrataḥ |
vilikhe hemā lekhinyā gaṃdhāṣṭaka samanvitaṃ ||

durvākāṇena vā lekhya kuśamūlena vā punaḥ |

ekavīrākalpe | 

veṣṭitaṃ pītavastreṇa tantunā pariveṣṭitaṃ ||

vadhnīyāt pītavastreṇa śiśunāṅkaṇṭha bhūṣaṇaṃ |
strīṇāmvāmakare caiva anyathāndakṣiṇe bhuje ||

<p. 65a>

vandhyā tu labhate putraṃ nirddhano dhanavān bhavet |
imāṃ rakṣāṃ purā vadhnyā jñānārthaṅgautamādibhiḥ ||

kīttyartha pārthivaiścānye saṃgrāme jayakāṃkṣibhiḥ |

asyārtha |

yoni yugme ṣaṭkoṇe tanmadhye hemaśalākayā bhūjapatrādau 
kuṅkumagorocanācandanasīvidhāya paṃktirūpeṇe mūlamantra likhitvā tasya 
hṛllekhā rephamadhye amukasya rakṣāṃ kuru (2) amukīnāṃ śataputranmutpādaya 
(2) yasyājñāna siddhiṃ kuru (2) ityādi sādhyasatamvilikhya ṣaṭkoṇe

<p. 65b>

klīṁva bhinnavarṇān ṛ ṝ ḷ ḹ rahitān | taduktaṃ |

svarānāṃmadhāmaṃ yastu taccatuṣkaṃ napusakaṃ |

dīrghavarṇān | a ī ū ai au aḥ | ityaika likhet | 

aṣṭavarṇe tvaṣṭavarṇānyathā | aiṁ hrīṁ oṃ ai hrī phaṭ svāhā ||

taduktaṃ nīlatantre |

vāgbhava kuladevīśca tārakaṃ vāgbhavaṃ tathā |
hṛllekhāṃ aṣṭamantrānte vahnijāyyavadhirmanuḥ ||

aṣṭākṣaro manuṃ prokto maṃtrāṇāśāra iritaḥ |

anyatra nānā tantra jāmale proktā kālikā prayogā

<p. 66a>

atra prayojyā atra prayogā kālikā vidyāktā atrāpi kāryāḥ | ete prayogāstatrāpi 
kāryā | taduktaṃ phetkārīye |

kālikāmantrayantroktān prayogāni phacācaret |
antrokta samyak tantrāpi prayogānapi cācaret ||

matsyasūkte |

kālikāmantratantroktān sarasvatyāṃ samācaret |
sarasvatyāṃntu yo proktā te kalpāntu samācaret ||

yathākālī tathā tārā na bheda paramārthataḥ |

atha śiśusaṃskāro |

dakṣiṇapāṇinā madhunā lājātyānnāḍi

<p. 66b>

chedānprākavāratrayaṃ sarmārye hemaśalākayānyadurvayā vā yajñadāru 
śikhayā bālakasya jihvāyāṃ oṣṭhe vā likhet |

tallikhanantu naimittika saṃskārānantaraṃ ekādaśāhātu kecit |
etadādau tu devatāṃ saṃpūjya mantraṃ likhediti guravaḥ ||

mahogratārā kalpe tu prathamaṃ liṣitaṃ | paścaddevatā pūjayet ||

yadi pītādurustho bhavati tadā mātulo vāpi tṛvyo vā likhet |

matsyasūkte |

athavā madhulājātyaṃ jihāyāṃmbālakasya tu |
nāḍīchedādyathā pūravedyastu śalākayā ||

<p. 67a>

mūlamantra likhet mantrī jihvāyām vāpi oṣṭake |
vākyoccāraṇamātreṇa vāgmī druta kavitva karaṇaṃ bhavet ||

mahogratārākalpe |

janmasaṃskārānnāma putrayāte praśaśyate |
jihvāyāṃ tu likhet maṃtraṃ yajñadā kuruśena vā ||

vāratrayatrantu mārya dakṣiṇaiva pāṇinā |
mantramuccāryavrutyeddhaṃ paṃkti kuryāntu śobhanaṃ ||

ādau śaṃskāraḥ kartavyastadapte vilikhetmanaṃ |
gaṃdhacandanapuṣpaiśca tadantai pūjayechivāṃ ||

<p 67b>

urttarābhimukho bhūtvā sthāpayet pīṭhamuttamaṃ |
pūjayet tāriṇīṃ devīnnānā bhakṣaiśca śobhanaiḥ ||

kavirvāgmī bhave putraḥ satyavādi jitendriyaḥ |
pitureva likhenmantraṃ kadācana ||

mātuḥ kroḍe tu saṃsthāpyadabhānāstīrya yatnataḥ |
śānti kuryād bālakasya brāhmaṇaiḥ sahasaṃyavaḥ ||

athārvasaṃhitāyāṃ śrutiḥ |

oṃ namaṃ putraṅkāmayata kāmajānāṃ ihaiveti devetyaḥ pūṣṇāti sarvamidan 
majajanaṃ |

<p. 68a>

śivaḥ śānti tārāyai keśavetyatārāyai rudretya tārāyai śivāya śivadyasase 
maṃtrānte sarvarupāyai tārakāyai anirudra śarasvatyai svāhāyai mantra dvayena 
śāṃti kuryāt |

tatastasya mātṛkarṇai śānti stotra paṭhet | mahānīlatantre |

tasya mātuḥ karṇeṣu tata stotraṃ samācaret |
oṃ namo bhagavatyai akaṇḍavāgvādinyai ||

oṃ mātardevi namastestu brahmarūpe dhare naghe |
kṛpayā hara me vighnanmatrasiddhin prayaccha me || 1 ||

māheśī varade devi paramānandarūpiṇī |
kṛpayāḥ mantrasiddhiṃ || 2 ||

<p. 68b>

kaumārī sarvavidyeśe kumāri krīḍate vare |
kṛpayā mantrasiddhi || 3 ||

viṣṇurūpa dhare devī vinatāsutavāhiṇī |
kṛpayā mantrasiddhiṃ || 4 ||

vārāhī varade devi daṣṭroddhatavasundhare |
kṛpayā mantrasiddhi || 5 ||

śakrarūpadhare devi śakrādi surapūjite |
kṛpayā mantrasiddhi || 6 ||

cāmuṇḍe muṇḍamālā śrak carcite vighnanāśinī |
kṛpayā mantrasiddhiṃ || 7 ||

mahālakṣmī mahāmohe kṣobhasantāpanāśinī |
kṛpayā mantrasiddhiṃ || 8 ||

<p. 69a>

iti mātṛmaye devimiti mātṛvahiskṛte | 
eke vahutare devi viśvarūpe namostute || 9 ||

etat stotraṃ paṭhed yastu karmāraṃbheṣu saṃyataḥ |
vidagyāmvā savālokya tasya vighnanna jāyate || 10 ||

kulīnasya dānake vā kathitāstava putrakā |
dīkṣākāle nitya jāpa samaye nāccayed yadi ||

tasya pūjā phalaṃ vatsa nīyate yakṣarākṣasau |

[iti tārārahasyavṛttau kāmyānuṣṭānanirṇayaḥ sātādiprayogavidhiḥ pañcamaḥ 
paṭalaḥ] || 5 ||


<p. 69b>

upacāraviśeṣeṇa rājapatnī vasannayet |
rājānāṃ japamātreṇa valināsakalaṃ jagat ||

iti asyārtha | japadhyāna |

valipradānapūjā kṛtvāṃ atvāṃ abhiṣṭadravyahoma na bhūpālapatnī ātmīyaṃ 
sthānamānayet | kimanyāmanadhiṣṭitāṃ striyāṃ | 
japamātreṇa rājānamahipatiṃ valinā sakalā pṛthivīmiti ||

ayamāśayaḥ |

upacāra viśeṣeṇa rājapatnyāṃ yākṛṣṭimāṃ carediti | rājānamiti 
mantramuccāryasusvakṛtaye vasamānayeti rājānāmvātvā bhavanti |

<p. 70a>

japamātreṇa pūjārahītena kevalajapamātreṇetyarthaḥ | valineti |

pūrvokta matsyasūktokta valimātreṇa vā nilatantroktena vā valimantreṇa vali dadyāt 
|

upaccārastu matsyasūktoktaḥ sakṛtāṃ | 
matsyamāṃsaṃ surāmāṣamodanamadhu ca trayaṃ ||

pāyasetha saṃkulya valiṃ devyai prakalpayet |
valindadyāstu godhā vai āsavañjaprasasyate ||

iti vallyupacāraḥ | ākṛtopacārastathaiva |

<p. 70b>

raṃbhāpuṣpaṃ sālamatsyaṃ juhuyāt mantra vittamaḥ |
ante vajrayān matsyaṃ puṣpañcāpi ghṛtaplutaṃ ||

iti sarvāsiddhimavāpnoti matte mokṣamavāpnuyāt |
sa ghṛtambilvapatraṃ ca juhuyācca saṃhasrakaṃ ||

labhate mañjulāmvāṇinmahāṣṭamyāñca sādhakaḥ |

tatraivaranyupacāra viśeṣaḥ |

rambhājātī vijapūraṃ sugaṃdhi paripūritaṃ |
miśrikṛtya valin dadyādaṣṭamyāñca viśeṣataḥ ||

kāmyānuṣṭāna paddhati |

atha māhācinabhāvanādhīnāsiddhiyaścāsmintatte sarvā pratipāditāḥ sanprati 
tadyathā taduktaṃ |

<p. 71a>

tārārṇave |

śrīdevyuvāca |

mahācīna kramandeva bhūci tanna prakāśitaṃ |
kathayasva tadedānīṃ yadi premosti mānprati ||

śrībhavānuvāca |

mahācīna kramandevi sarvatantreṣu gopitāṃ |
na vaktavyaṃ tribhuvane śuddha bhāvena bhāvinī ||

kecid devā narāḥ kiñci dānavāyakṣarākṣasā |
nāgalokā kinnarāśca gandharvāpsara sāṅgaṇā ||

ye vā paśumṛgāḥ pakṣāye kecijjagatāṅgatā |
ete jadratarāḥ sarve paraspara svarātmikāḥ ||

<p. 71b>

kukalpanāratāḥ sarve kumārgā darśanotsukāḥ |
eteṣāṃ kopi vijñānamānandambrahmavitsukhaṃ ||

na jānāmi mahādeva kathanut kathayāmi te |
nityamukta svabhāvoyastasmai tadanumīritaṃ ||

kṣamasva deviccārvaṅgī na vaktavyaṃ tvayā naghe |

śrīdevyuvāca ||

namaste śiva rūpāya namaste guru rūpiṇe |
namaste varadasvāmitkaruṇā nidhaye namaḥ ||

nānyadevaratā ye ca tvatpādāmbuja kākṣiṇaḥ |
teṣāmevādhikaphalaṃmabhaktāṇāṃ vyavasthitaṃ ||

<p. 72a>

siṃhavyāghrādayo ye ca ye ca vighnānta kāriṇaḥ |
ripavañca yathā sarpā ye cānyamupajantavaḥ ||

te sarve vilaṭī yānti pataṅgā iva pāvakāḥ |
dehandīpa śikhākāra dṛśyate duṣṭa jaṃtubhiḥ ||

kevalanprema bhāvena tvayaiva cintayā prabho |
kiyaśakaṃ dānavārākṣasāmartyāye cānyadevatāgaṇāḥ ||

rājānāñca tathā cānye sarve tatpāda vartinaḥ |
ājñāṃ bhajanti gandharvāḥ ke punarnara kiṃkarāḥ ||

yatra yatra bhaved vāñchāt tatra siddhiṃ karesthitā |
sadātaṃgāpanīvāṃṇī tu jāteti suniścaye ||

<p. 72b>

duṣṭabhāvaṃ parityajya kimanyad bahujalpitaiḥ |
mokṣārthī labhate mokṣa dhanārthi dhanamāpnuyāt ||

ante ca jāyate gaurī loke śiva ivāparaḥ |
siddhā bhavaṃ tu madbhaktāḥ kathayasva mamāgataḥ ||

navaktavyamabhaktāya parabhaktāya pāpine |

śrībhavānuvāca |

mahācīna kramandevi vividha kathitantuvi |

taduktamvīratantre |

snānādi mānasaṃ śaucanmānasaḥ pravaro japaḥ |
pūjananmānasaṃ divyan mānasaṃ kalpanādika ||

<p. 73a>

sarva eva śubhaḥ kālo nāśubho vidyate kvacit |
na viśeṣo divārātrau na sandhyāyānmahāniśi ||

vastrādyamāsanaṃ saucaṃ dahasparśādi vāriṇaḥ |
śuddhinna carcaye tatra nirvikalpanmanañcaret ||

nātraśuddherapekṣāsti na cāmedhyāti dūṣaṇaṃ |
ya evaṃ cintayen mantrī sarvaṃ kāmārtha siddhayet ||

ye ye yatra bhaved vāñchā tat tat siddhi karesthitāḥ |
gadyapadyamayī vāṇī sabhayāṃ tasya jāyate ||

<p. 73b>

tasya darśanamātreṇa vādino niḥprabhā matā |
rājānopi hi dāśatvaṃ bhajante kiṃ pare janāḥ ||

sarvathā pūjayed devīmasnātaḥ kṛta bhojanaḥ |
mahāniśyaśucau deśe valimantreṇa dāpayet ||

strī dvecco naiva kartavyo viśeṣāt pūjanaṃ striyaḥ |
japasthāne mahāśaṃkhaṃ niveśyorddhaṃ japaścaret ||

striyaṃ gachatspṛśan paśyan yatra kutrāpya cūḍake |
tāmbulamanyān bhakṣāśca bhakṣitavyānyathārucīn ||

māṃsamatsyādadhikṣodrān bhakṣatavyān yathārucit |
bhuktādyaśeṣabhakṣāñca bhuktābhaikṣañcarejjayaṃ ||

<p. 74a>

dikkālaniyamo nāvasthityādi niyamo na ca |
japakālopi naivāsti valipūjā kramādikaṃ ||

svechābhakṣotra niyamo mahāmantrasya sādhane |
nādharmo vidyate śatru kiñcidharmo mahānnavet ||

svechānovragaditaprajaye hṛṣṭamānasaḥ |
kṛtārthasanyamānastu santuṣṭo nijamānasaṃ ||

iti mahācīnakramaṃḥ | atha rahasyānantaraṃ |

gāndharvatantre |

pṛthvī ṛtumatīvikṣasahasraṃ yadi nityasaḥ |
udāradhīḥ susiddhāntaḥ kṛtaḥ kṣititalaṃ nyaset ||

<p. 74b>

nitya sa iti unapañcāśaddinaṃ | pṛthvīṃ ṛtumatīmityādi 
sarvaṅgurumukhādavagantavyaṃ ||

parvate hastamāropya nirbhayo yatamānasaḥ |
kavitāṃ labhate sopi amṛtañca sa gachati ||

nīlatantrepi |

padmandṛṣṭvā ca candravimbaḥ khaṃjanaṃ śikharaṃ tathā |
cāmaraṃ ravibimbaṃ ca nīlapuṣpaṃ sarovaraṃ ||

triśūtravīkṣya japtvā tu śattaśaśuddhabhāvataḥ |
atha prasādasumukha locana suhāsyakaṃ sujanaṃ svayameva ca ||

<p. 75a>

labhate ca yathā saṃkhya śṛṇu pārvati sādaraṃ |
mahācīna kramandevī dhyātvā tatra prapūjyataḥ ||

tadrumodbhavapuṣpena pūjayed bhaktibhāvataḥ |
sa bhavet kuladevasya kulakramagataḥ śuciḥ ||

brahmatarormahāpadme devī dhyātvā yathā vidhi |
tatsudhāsārasāreṇa tarpaye mātṛkānane ||

sa bhave sādhaka śreṣṭo mātṛṇāśca priyo bhavet |
mahācīna kramalatāveṣṭitaḥ sādhakottamaḥ ||

rātrau yadi japenmatraṃ saiva kalpalatā bhavet |
tithi krameṇa saṃkhyābhirveṣṭito yadi ||

<p. 75b>

tadā mānena siddhiḥ syāt sahasra japamānasaḥ |
aṣṭamyāṃśca caturdaśyāṃ dviguṇaṃ yadi dṛścate ||

tadaiva mahatī siddhi devānāmapi durllabhā |
mahācīna krame japtaṃ likhitvā kuṅkumena ca ||

tatpārśve sādhyamāliṣya tāḍaye dṛṣṭi dṛṣṭibhiḥ |
tatra gacchati kāmārtā yatra yatropagachati ||

mahācinadrubharasainoktaṃ piṇḍavidhāya ca |
yatrāmnā dīyate devasovirānmṛtyumarhati ||

mahānīttakramanmūla majjābhirvilvapatrakaiḥ |
sahasran devi matyarca śmaśāne sādhakottamaḥ ||

<p. 76a>

tatra rājyamavāpnoti yadimanaḥ palāyate |
tasyā ṣoḍaśāṃśena kalānārhanti te śavā ||

śavāsanādhika phalaṃ latāgeha praveśane |
evaṃ bhūtaḥ sadādevi sādhako bhuvi durlabhaḥ ||

yayā kadāciddighnā(?)vāyaḥ ko vā tu vidṛśyate |
tattatprakāśanād devi mṛtyurbhavati nānyathā ||

etat sādhaka nindāmvā etat tatrasya vā punaḥ |
mahābhūta gaṇaiḥ sārddhantasya sarvaṃ harāmyahaṃ ||

yoginī cakra sahitaiḥ svayantadvadhakāriṇī |

<p. 76b>

atha sārasvata prayogaḥ | taduktaṃ phetkārīye |

jihvāyāṃ nyasanādevamūkopi sukavirbhavet |

asyārtha |

jihvābudhyāmukhe hastamāropye japediti kecit |
mano saṃskāre madhunā lājābhyāṃ likhanādi kecit ||

vastu tastu |

tejo rūpāṃ vidyāṃ jihvāyāṃ bhāvayediti sanyasanārthaḥ |

vīratantre |

jihvāyāṃ bhāvayed yastu tāriṇīṃ dīparūpiṇīṃ |
bṛhaspati samastasya kavitā śukla nirjitā ||

nīlatantre |

<p. 77a>

brāhme muhurte utthāya kṛtāvaśya susaṃyataḥ |
jihvāyāṃ bhāvayan vidyā tejorūpāñjapet sudhīḥ ||

amṛtaspandinī tasya vāṇī sarvavidhānavit |

ekavīrātantre |

prātavidyāmvibhāvyai ca jihvāyāndīparūpiṇīṃ |
mātṛkā sahitāmvidyāntrirāvṛtyāñjaliṃ pibet ||

jalapāna vidhānena mūkopi sukavirbhavet |
ajatra bhāvanānyāsān sādhakaḥ sukṛtī sudhī ||

kavirvāgmī tathā yogī bhuktibhāgī na saṃśayaḥ |
anyatrāpi śarvāccaturvidha pāṇḍityamupajāyate ||

atha rahasyāntaraṃ |

<p. 77b>

vīratantre |

kulayuvatiṣu yonau mantravarṇānvilikhya nikhilanigama mantrān luptadoṣādi 
duṣṭān |

vidita kulakulāntavārjyavatmāvidhijño manupuṭitapaṭīyān sādhayet sāṃta cetāḥ |

kulapaṭamanusaṃdhyoyāsitāyāṃ subhūmau tava nijanijanoyastarpyayet tirthatoyeḥ |

rudhiratarasu puṣpairgandhamālyānulepairacita yuvati vedāstaddhiyā dhyāyate saḥ | 
paricarati samastairnyāsipuraiḥ samastaistavaparijanajālaiḥ yogicakraiḥ prapūjā |

<p. 78a>

suvimarlajñātvā hrī ghṛṇāvarjitoṣa svayamapi ravityajñaḥ kṣobhakṛd 
yoginīnāṃ | paśuripu kulacakraṃ sasyaśanmadhya sākhaṃ suragurusuranāthaṃ 
śāpabhraṣṭaḥ svareṇaḥ | kulapatināthaṃ tadvayaṃ yojayitvā manupuṭita 
vimṛgyaṃ yojayantadvihiyaḥ | janani tava kalānāṃ ko vidāṃ kāmarūpaḥ kumati 
rahita cittaḥ saṃlikhet tāntri dhāre | vigata bhaya viṣādadhānta jālaḥ 
sudhāśyustava caraṇanitāntaḥ saṃsmaraṃ vai viśuddhaḥ |

<p. 78b>

parikalitakapustadvanmatirdeva pūjyaḥ paricaratiti sajño mokṣaparyādhipaḥ saḥ |

atha mantrā siddhyarthandū na mahārahasyaṃ |

viśuddhe svara māhātantre |

śrīdevyuvāca |

śṛṇu devi parijñānaṃ sarvajñānottamottamaṃ |
yena vijñāna mātreṇa kṣipra vidyā prasīdati ||

mūlakande tayā śānti bhujaṃgākālarūpiṇī |
tadā sāvattavātoya prāṇa ityucyate budhaiḥ ||

klinnā vā vyuktamadhurā kujantī satatotthitā |
gachaṃti brahmaraṃdhrena bhaviṣyanti svaketane ||

<p. 79a>

yātāyāta krameṇaiva tatra kuryātmanolayaṃ |
tena mantra śikhāyātā sarvasiddhi pradīpikā ||

tamaḥ pūrṇe gṛhe yad yadyat kiñcit pravibhāṣite |
śikhāhīnāstathā mantrā na sidhyati kadācana ||

śikhopadeśāḥ sarvaivaḥ gopitā parameśvari |
vinānena siddhiḥ syād varṣakoṭi śatairapi ||

tasmāt turyāpi girije gopanīya prayatnataḥ |

atha rahasyāntaraṃ | nīlataṃtre |

luptānidrāpitāmattā vidrāvaṇaratāḥ parāḥ |
samadoṣajālena granthitā purasundari ||

<p. 79b>

niśicārandivācāraṃ sandhyācārañca pallavaṃ |
darbhitambījasaṃyogaṃ bhāvanaṃ yogameva ca ||

jñātvā pravardhayed vīra gurupatnaiva kāraṇaṃ |

niśicāramityādi |

niśicāramvāmanāsāyāmvāyorudayaḥ |
tathaiva dakṣiṇanādyāṃ udayo divā ca ||

sandhyācāraṃ ubhayanāḍī pravāhaḥ |

taduktamviṣṇu saṃhitāyāṃ |

svāpakāle tu mantrāṇāṃ japonarthaṃ phalapradaḥ |

tatraivoktaṃ | svāpakālo dakṣiṇāvahata | prabodho dakṣiṇāvahaḥ |

<p. 80a>

agre yasya mano saumya mantrasyai tadviparyayaḥ |
bubodhaḥ kālajānīyā ubhayorubhayorapi ||

karmaṇo vahni tārānmaviyanprāyāḥ samīratāḥ |
āgneyamapi saumyāśca bhūjiṣṭhetvamitākṣarāḥ ||

taduktaṃ | svatantre |

tadātmikā smṛtā vidyā mantrā devi pradātmikā |

evamvāmantra āgneryā |

vidyāsaumyāḥ vāme vahed yathā vāyudīrghānāmudayastadā |
dakṣiṇasyāṃ yadā vāyustadā hrasva phalapradāḥ ||

ubhayastho yadā vāyustadā sarva phala pradāḥ ||

<p. 80b>

iti vijñāna bhaṭṭa caraṇāḥ |

evamvāma bhāge bīje ubhayantu bīja saṃyogāt sarvavidyā phalāptayestu | evan 
dakṣiṇabhāge sarve mantrāḥ | rahasyānye tu |

dīrghayogādvidyā japasatvaraṃ phalapradaḥ | evaṃ hrasva sayogādakṣiṇa gaṇāḥ || 
pallavaṃ yathā | 

taduktaṃ svaratantrarāje |

ādāyoga bhavedante pallava saṃpuṭo dvayoḥ |

ekāntaritagranthena vidarbho antarī kṛtaḥ || asyārtha |

ādayoga ityādinā ślokena mantreṣu madhya karma yojana prakāramupa viṃśati ||

<p. 81a>

taduktaṃ bhavati |

mantravidyayorādyasādhana karmaṇāṃ yojane yogasaṃjñāmantravidyayorante 
pūrvoktayojanāt pallava iti saṃjñā | mantra vidyayorādyantaśca pūrvokta yojanā 
saṃpūṭeti saṃjñā | maṃtra vidyayoguktānāñca ekaikākṣarato anyonya yojanā 
granthana iti saṃjñā | mantra vidyayoḥ prāguktānāśca anyonyakṣaradvaya yojanā 
vidarbha iti saṃjñā | sa ca trividhaḥ |

<p. 81b>

mantrākṣara dvayāntare syādhyākṣarantare sādhyākṣaramekaṃ japedi ekaprakāraḥ 
|

sādhyākṣarāṇādvayāntare maṃtrādīnāmekākṣaraṃ yojayedityaparaḥ |
mantrādīnamakṣara dvayonantare sādhyādīnāmakṣara dvayaṃ ||

yojayedeṣanye | evantrividhamiti | bījasaṃyogo yathā | taduktamvimalatantre |

praṇavo mātṛkā devi hṛllekhādyanmṛtadvayaṃ |
amṛtabhṛyaṃ yogātaduṣṭamaṃtropi siddhyati ||

bhāva saṃyoga iti nirṇaya prakāreṇa bodhavyamiti | kulacūḍāmaṇau |

<p. 82a>

niyamaḥ puruṣo jñeyo na yoṣitsu kathaścana |
yadvātadvāyena tena sarvadā sarvadopi ca ||

yoṣitāndhyāna yogena siddhayaḥ syūrna saṃśayaḥ |
yathā yaskānta mātreṇaṃ gūḍhamiddhaśilocayaḥ ||

svayameva bahīryāti yathā vāsauratejasā |
sūryakāntaṃ puṭaṃ rautiyathā vācendra rasmibhiḥ ||

candrakāntandrāvāyati yathā varṣā suvāridaiḥ |
jalakāti tathā plābhūrasapūrṇāpracakṣate ||

kṣudhārtakṣīrapānena yathā tṛpto hi jāyate |
kulapuṣpa pradānena yathāśakti pratuṣpati ||

<p. 82b>

gurusevaika mātreṇa maṃtrasiddhiryathā bhavet |
mahāpadmaṃ vanadhyānā yathā siddhāñcaro bhavet ||

tripurādhyānamātreṇa bhuktimukti yathā bhavet |
mahādurgā prasādena yathā siddhiśvaro bhavet ||

gaṃgāsmaraṇa mātreṇa nipāpo jāyate yathā |
yakākarṣaṇamātreṇa śiva eva prajāyate ||

yoṣicinmanamātreṇa yathaivamvaradāyinī |
tasmāt sarva prayatnena dīkṣayet nijakaulikīmiti ||

<p. 83a>

[iti śrītārārahasyavṛttau bhavanirṇayaḥ ṣaṣṭapaṭalaḥ] || 6 ||


atha kumārīkalpaḥ |

rudrayāmale uktaṃ |

kathayāmi na sandehaḥ kumāryā pūjanaṃ śubhaṃ |
yasyā pūjanamātreṇa trailokya pūjanaṃ bhavet ||

kumārī pūjanāśe hantritā mūrti vyavasthitāḥ | parāvaivatīyā ca parā parā ||

yatra kālena kiñcit syād devāsura mahoragāḥ |
tilokyanta tvayāhañca tathā jātā kumārikā ||

ādyā ṣṛṣṭikarī yā tu pratyakṣā sā tu tannidhā |
umākanyā tu sā jātā sṛṣṭirūpo bhavāntare ||

<p. 83b>

ekavarṣā bhaveccaṇḍī dvivarṣā tu sarasvatī |
trivarṣā ca tridhāmūrtiścaturvarṣā ca kālikā ||

subhagāpañca varṣā tu ṣaṭvarṣāṃ tu umā bhavat |
saptavarṣā mālinī ca aṣṭavarṣā tu kubjikā ||

navabhiḥ kālasaṃkarṣaṇī daśabhiścāparājitā |
ekādaśe tu rudrāṇī dvādaśābde tu bhairavī ||

trayodaśe mahālakṣmī dvisaptapīṭha nāyikā |
kṣetrajñā pañcadaśabhi ṣoḍase carcikā matā ||

evaṃ krameṇa pūjye tayāvat puṣpaṃ na vidyate |
prati pradādi pūrṇaṃttamvṛddhi bhedena pūjayet ||

<p. 84a>

mahāparveṣu sarveṣu viśeṣā ca pavitrakā |
mahānavamyān deveśi kumārī suprapūjayet ||

piṅgalāṃ pūjayed yastu ṣoḍaśaiścaiva bhaktimān |
pūjayet kulavidyānānmekayā nava bhairavī ||

evanpraṇavayogena caitanya tatva (*) rcayet |

aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ hūṁ | aiṁ hrāṁ śrīṁ hrāṁ hūṁ ete pañcapraṇavāḥ | 
idaścaitanya bījākṣarau ||

ekandvābhyāṃ tribhiścaiva saptāṣṭa navadhā punaḥ |
nityakrameṇa deveśi pūjayed vipramuttamaṃ ||

<p. 84b>

ghnanti vighnān pūjayitvā tathā śatrunmahotkaṭaṃ |
vyādhayaḥ sarvavidyānidurnnimittanināśayet ||

grahayakṣāḥ kṣayaṃ yānti bhūtavetāla pannagā |
asurāguhyakā pretā yoginī guhya ḍākinī ||

mahābhayāni durbhikṣaṃ mutpātāni kuleśvaraḥ |
duḥsvapnamapamṛtyuñca anye ye ye samudbhavā ||

kumārī pūjanā devi na tasya prabhavanti hi |
animādīni siddhānighnātāla guṭikāṃjanaṃ ||

<p. 85a>

uchiṣṭaṃ divya vetālo bhavet kumārikārcanāt |
aiṁkāreṇa jalān deyaṃ hrīṃkāre pādaśau vanaṃ ||

śrīkāreṇorgha dadyā kurcabījena candanaṃ |
śaktibījenupuṣpādi ṣaṣṭhe dhūpañca dāpayet ||

aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ hrauṁ imāṃ kulakumārike hṛdayāye namaḥ |
heṁ reṁ hraiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ aiṁ svāhāśilase svāhā ||

oṃ hrīṃ seṁ śikhāyai vaṣaṭ |
aiṁ kulavāgīśvara vāgīśvarī kuvacāya hūṁ ||

hrīṁ phaṭ svāhā aiṁ siddha jaya astrāya phaṭ |
aiṁ hrīṁ siddhajayāya pūrvaktrāye namaḥ ||

<p. 85b>

e aiṁ jaye jaya uttarāya vaktuya namaḥ |
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ kubjiko paścimavaktrāya namaḥ ||

aiṁ phraiṁ kālike dakṣiṇa vaktrāya namaḥ |
vāgbhavena purakṣobhaṃ māyābīja guṇāṣṭakaṃ ||

śriyo bīje śriyolābhaṃ hrīṁ bījaṃ alisaṃkṣayaṃ |
bhairavena tu bījena khagatvamamarādibhiḥ ||

kumārīkā hyahaṃ nātha sadātvañca kumārikā |
aṣṭottara śataṃ vāpi ekākanyān prapūjayet ||

ṣṭajitāpratipūjyante nirdahannyapamānitā |
kumārī yoginī sākṣāt kumārī sarvadevatā ||

<p. 86a>

bhūrbhuvāmūrtipādekā kumārītrikapūjitāḥ |
asurāduṣṭanāgāśca ete duṣṭa grahā api ||

bhūtā vetāla gandharvā ḍākinī yakṣarākṣasāḥ |
hṛdaye devatā sarvā bhūrbhuvaścaiva bhairavāḥ ||

pṛthivyādīni bhūtāni brahmāṇḍaṃ sa carācaraṃ |
brahmāviṣṇuśca rudraśca īśvaraśca sadāśivaḥ ||

te tuṣṭāḥ sarvatuṣṭāśca yastu kanyāṃ prapūjayet |
kālāgni śivaparyantat tathā gauryādi saṃsthitāḥ ||

saptadvīpāḥ samudrāśca bhuvanāni caturdaśaḥ |
vidhiyukta kumārīti bhojayeccaika bhairavīṃ ||

<p. 86b>

pādyamargha tathā dhūpaṃ kuṃkumaṃ candanaṃ śubhaṃ |
bhakti bhāvena saṃpūja sarvantasmaidivedayet ||

pradakṣiṇa trayaṃ kṛtvā ādi madhye śubhaścaret |
paścācca dakṣiṇādeyāratataṃ svarṇamauktikaṃ ||

vivāhayet svayaṅkanyāṃ brahmahatyām vinaśyati |
śovadhamvanitādyaṃ taṃ sarvapāpan praṇaśyati ||

mātā ca pitarau caiva śrābharaṃ caiva sarvataḥ |
ye tu yastu punaḥ sarve kanyādānan prakalpayet |

<p. 87a>

bhukti mukti phalantasya saubhāgyaṃ sarva samvadaḥ |
rudraloke vasen nityan trinetro bhagavān hariḥ ||

ṣaṣṭikoṭi sahasrāṇi asvamedha phalaṃ labhet |
etatphalaṃ labhet satyaḥ kaṃnyāstu vivāhayet ||

bālukā sāgaraṃ jñeyaṃ tāvadabdaṃ nareśvaruḥ |
ekaikaṃ kulamuddhṛtya martyaloke ca secciraṃ ||

tāvad bhujaṃti te bhogā yāvad bhūmi divaukasaḥ |
kanyādānaṃ mahādānaṃ sarvadānottamottamaṃ ||

saubhāgyanna vinaśyanti kṣipraṃ saubhāgya vartate |
rājadvāre labhet pūjāṃ rājamānya svayamvaraḥ ||

saṣāśca kumārīśca pūjayecca prayatnataḥ |

<p. 87b>

mahadbhaye samutpanne hyatpāte hyati dāruṇe |

koṣṭake sā rase ye vā droṇa kākeṣyulukike |
gṛdhre vakeṣu cārāve yajñāte śānti karmaṇi |

mahāpūjā prakartavyā kumārī bhojayed vidhiḥ |
nātaḥ parataraṃ śāntiṃ nṛṇāṃ kalpāna kṛtparaṃ |

mahābhaye mahotpāte kanyācaikāśca pūjayet |
tatkṣaṇāllabhate saukhyam satya satyañca bhairavaḥ ||

[iti śrītārārahasyavṛttau kumārītatvanirṇayaḥ saptamaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 7 ||


<p. 88a>

śrībhairava uvāca |

mahācīna kramaṃ deva sucitanna prakāśitaṃ |
kathayasva mahādeva sarvasiddhi pradaṃ bhavet ||

brahmaviṣṇumaheśānāṃ dikpālaścaiva bhāviniḥ |
bhairavānāñca sarveṣāṃ gandharvāśca yogināṃ ||

sikhasiddhi pradandevi sarveṣāṃ mālayan mahat |
nānyasiddhi pradandevi vīrasādhana varjitaṃ ||

mahābalo mahābuddhirmahāsāhasikaṃ śuciḥ |
mahāsvachodayāvañca sarvabhūtahiterataḥ ||

teṣāṃ kṛte maheśāni kathitamvīra sādhanaṃ |
aṣṭamyāṃścaturdaśyāṃ pakṣayorubhayorapi ||

<p. 88b>

kṛṣṇāpakṣe viśeṣeṇa sādhayedana pāhitaṃ |
bhaumavāretamiśrāyāṃ me yāte ca bhāvini ||

tadbhaktyābhyantare samyak pūjopakaraṇāmbitaṃ |
āmiṣāṃnaṃ guḍacchāgaṃ surāpiṣṭaka pāyasaṃ ||

nānāphalañca naivedyaṃ sva sva kalpokta sādhanaṃ |
citā sthānaṃ samānīya bahubhiḥ śastra pāṇibhiḥ ||

samāna guṇasampatyai sādhako vitabhiḥ svayaṃ |

citālakaraṇaṃ yathā |

asaṃskṛtā grāhyā na tu saṃskārasaṃskṛtā |
cāṇḍālādiṣṭa saṃprāptā kevalaṃ śīghra siddhidā ||

<p. 89a>

vīratantrepi |

śavamvāpi samānītvā badhyā gatvā yathāsukhaṃ |
snātvā rakṣāsuvadhvā vai devatā dhyāna tatparaḥ ||

bhītaścet sādhakastatra caturdaśi ca sādhakaḥ |
nocetsvayaṃ kevalosaubhairavaḥ parikīrtitā ||

vastrālaṅkārabhūṣādyairbhūṣitaṃ pūrvasanmukhaṃ |
astrāntamūlamantreṇa prokṣaṇaṃ yogabhūmiṣuḥ ||

gurupādarajo dhyātvā gaṇeśamvaṭukantathā |
yogini mātṛkāścaiva vāyuḥ pādapuraḥsaraṃ ||

<p. 89b>

ye cātra saṃsthitādevā rākṣasāñca bhayānakāḥ |
piśācāyakṣāsiddhaśca gandharvāpsarasāṃ gaṇāḥ ||

yogiṇyo mātarobhūtāḥ savāñca khacarastriyaḥ |
siddhidāste bhavantatra tathā ca mama rakṣakāḥ ||

praṇamya manunānena puṣpāñjali trayaṃ kṣipet |
śmaśānādhipati pañcād bhairavaṃ kālabhairavaṃ ||

mahākālaṃ yajet paścāt pūrvādika catuṣṭaye |
pādyādibhiñca mantrajño baliṃ pañcānnivedayet ||

<p. 90a>

kūrcabījaṃ tataḥ paścāt śmaśānādhipatiṃ paraṃ |
imanmantre sāmiṣānnamvaliṃ gṛhna tataḥ paraṃ ||

gṛhnāpaya padandvandvamvighnanivāraṇan tataḥ |
kuru siddhistu me bhānnan prayacha svāhayā yutaṃ ||

prāṇavādyena manunā prathamo baliṃ rucyateḥ |
māyānte bhairava paścāt śmaśānādhipa tatparaṃ ||

prayacheti dvidhāproktā bhāyānaka mata paraṃ |
pūrvavat manumuddhṛtya dakṣiṇe balimāharet ||

hūṃ mantre ca mahākāla pañcān pūrvavadurddhare |
paścime kāla devāya praṇavādyena dāpayet ||

<p. 90b>

śabdānte kālaśabdañca bhairaveti tataḥ para |
śmaśānādhipati ityevaṃ pūrvavaccottare haret ||

citāmadhye tato dadyād bali traya manutrayaṃ |
kālarātrīrmahākāli kālike ghoraniḥsvane ||

gṛhāṇemambalimātardehi siddhimvala pradāṃ |
kālikā yai valin datvā bhūtanātha yadā cayet ||

śabdente bhūtanāthāya śmaśānādhipati ityapi |
praṇavādyena manunā dāpayed valimuttamaṃ ||

huṃ śabdānte sarvagaṇanāthānte cādhipāya ca |
śmaśānamamuke datvā pūrvavacca samuddharet ||

<p. 91a>

tārāntoya valiṃ datvā pañcagavyena sundari |
aṃbhasā prokṣaṇaṃ kṛtvā pītavastre likhet tataḥ ||

bhūrje vāpyathavā patre tatra pīṭha manu nyaset |
pīṭamāstīrya tasmin vai vaddhavīrā sanantataḥ ||

viradeveviśirakṣādikṣu prakalpayet |
kurcayugmaṃndvayan devi māyā yugmā tadaṃtaraṃ ||

kālike ghoradraṃṣṭre ca pracaṇḍe caṇḍanāyike |
dānavāndārayetyugrārahaneti dvitayaṃ tataḥ ||

śavatanu mahāvighne chedayeti punaścaret |

<p. 91b>

dvirastra carmaśastrānto vīrakarma manusmṛtaḥ |
anena mantritaṃ loṣṭraṃ daśaṃ dvikṣusamāstaret ||

tanmadhye bhairavo devo na vighnaiḥ paribhūyate |
yadi pramāde deveśi sādhako bhayavihvalaḥ ||

tatra testaiḥ suhṛdvargau rakṣito nābhibhūyate |
tasmin mahādīpe vighnaiśca paribhūyate ||

arkaistu śita (* * * * *) (?) 
nnirmitavartirmitavartikā | pradīpaṃ tatra sa sthāpya astranta prapūjayet |

hete tasmin mahādīpe vighnaiśca paribhūyate |
tadadhaścāstra mantreṇa likhanena kuladīpikāṃ ||

<p. 92a>

tatatkulavidhinā bhūtaṃ śudhyādikañcaret |
ṣoḍhāmvā tāramvāpi vinyaset pūjayet tataḥ ||

mantrādhyānacaro bhūtvā japenmaṃtraṃ mananyadhī |
ekākṣaraṃ yadi bhaved diksahasraṃ tato japet ||

dvyakṣaraścāṣṭasāhasraṃ tryakṣaraṃ tvayutārddhakaṃ |
tataḥ paraṃ tu mantrajño gaḥjāntaśca sahasrakaṃ ||

niśāyāṃ japamāranya udayānta samārabhet |
japādau tu valin datvā paścādapi valiṃ haret ||

<p. 92b>

japānte japamadhye vādedadehiti bhāravate |
tadā cāpi valin dadyān mahiṣamvāpi chāgala ||

na dikṣu vikṣaṇaṃ kiñcit nivavaṃdhu samāgamaḥ |

jalāndraṣṭināmapi |

pakṣikīṭapiśācānāyadyadvā manasasthitaṃ |
tatpūrvaṃ svapnavaddhyātvā bhayaṃ sarvatra varjayet ||

samāpyasādhandevi dakṣiṇāmvibhavāvadhiḥ |
guruve guru patnyai cat putrāya vadāpayet ||

samyak siddhyaika mantrasya nāsāddhyaṃmvidyatai kvacit |
vahumantravataḥ pusakvā kathā rudra ecasaḥ ||

<p. 93a>

etat sarvatra deveśi guru pūjā garīyasī |
udayen mantra mantraṇāṃ bhāṣayaśca sadāśivaḥ ||

anya deva saparyāmvā anya devasya kīrtanaṃ |
guru devamvinā devi tadagre narakaṃ vrajet ||

śavārūḍho yadi bhavetad viśyeva ihocyate |
śunyāgāre bilvamule nadītīre ca tu paṭhe ||

urddhandvivarṣāda cūḍaṃ pañca vā taruṇaṃ yadi |
saptamāṣṭamamāsīya garbhajaṃ yadi vāśavaṃ ||

cāṇḍālaścāpi bhūtamvā śīghra siddhiphalapradaṃ |
ānīya srāpayadādaunyāsajālaṃ samācaret ||

<p. 93b>

pīṭhe mantre samālikhya gandha puṣpādibhistataḥ |
abhyarcā sādhapuṣpādibhistataḥ ||

abhyārcā sādhananyatvā rakṣamātmani kārayet |
tataḥ śavāsye vidhivarddavatāpyā anantataḥ ||

tato japtvā sarvamantre sarvasiddhiśvaro bhavet |
tāramantran mṛtasyaivaṃ namonte mantramuccaret ||

śavasnāpaṃ na mantroyaṃ savāsana manuttamaḥ |
mantrennetuvaneśīsyā phaḍaṃnto mantra iritaḥ ||

<p. 94a>

mahānīlaḥ kraman devi sarvasiddhiśvaro bhavet |
na kasyacit pravaktavya mantra pravarameva ca ||

sarveṣāṃ jīva hīnānāṃ jantūnāṃ vīrasādhane |
prokṣaṇaṃ gomayaṃ tyaktā sādhanamvīrasādhane ||

mahāśavāḥ praśastāsyu pradhani sādhane priye |
brāhmaṇastu striyaṃ tyaktā sādhayed vīrasādhanaṃ ||

kṣudrāprayogāḥ ka (*) ṇān prasastāḥ sarvasiddhaye |
śmaśāne tu puraścaryā kathitān devi durllabhā ||

atha bhairavatantrepi savalakṣaṇamāhaveḥ |
yatuktaṃ bhāva sarvaśve sarvatantrepi gopitaṃ ||

<p. 94b>

vīrasiddhi vidhānantuḥ devadevena śaṃbhunā |
yasya vijñāna mātreṇa mandabhāgyāpi siddhyati ||

ahorātreṇa kālena helayā sādhakottama |

maṃtra puraskṛyaṃ |

puraścaraṇasamyanto vīrasiddhiṃ samācaret |

taduktaṃ svachanda bhairavepi |

samyak pariśumoṇāpi naiva siddhiḥ samāhitā |
jāyate sādhakestatra vīrasādhana sādhayet ||

putradāradhanāpteha lokamohana varjitaḥ |
mantramvā sādhayiṣyāmi dehaṃ vā pātayāmyahaṃ ||

<p. 95a>

pratijñāmīdṛśaṃ kṛtvā vali dravyāni cintayet |
yasya mantrasya yadbhūte tadbhūtā śeṣa sādhakaḥ ||

atha śava lakṣaṇaṃ |

yathā yaṣṭiprakhyatyastre bhinna sukabhicaṃpayomṛtaṃ |
savamānīya kartavyaṃ nāhare svachayāmṛtaṃ ||

strīvaśyapatitā spṛśyāṃmayavarjahatantaraṃ |
avyaktaliṅgaṃ kuṣṭinaṃ pretavaṃśa vahet ||

na dubhikṣamṛtaṃ vṛddhannaparyūṣitameva ca |
strījanañce dṛśaṃ rūpaṃ sarvathā parivarjayet ||

iti śava lakṣaṇaṃ |

<p. 95b>

śūnyāgāramaraṇyamvā nītvāddhatyavibhūṣayet |
sasthāpya savayo yaṃ purupiṇaṃ ||

matsyasūkte |

tataḥ śavaṃ kṣārayitvā snāpayecca prayatnataḥ |
yadi bhaktākukantriṣṭadbhairavācca bhayet ||

elālavaṅga karpūra jātī khadirasāṅgakaiḥ |
tāmbulaśca mukhe kṣiptvā savaṅkuryādadhomukhaṃ ||

snāpayitvā ca tatpṛṣṭe candanena vilepayet |
bāhumūlāntakadyantañcaturasaṃvidhāya ca ||

<p. 96a>

madhe padmañcatudvāra dalāṣṭaka samanvitaṃ |
tataḥścaineyamajinaṃ kamvalāntarita nyaset ||

pūjādravyansamanti dhaudūre cottara sādhakaḥ |
masthāpya śavamapyarcya tatraśvāṃrohanamviśet ||

kuśānpadataledatthāśava keśān pramārya ca |
dṛḍhanti vadhya juṭikāntacca deva svarūpiṇī ||

tasyāndeveṃ susaṃspṛśya paṭhed rakṣāya sanmukhe |
śave bhavecca deveśi mūkamiṣṭa siddhiṃ śavakṛtāmvare ||

paṭṭasūtreṇa rajjakena caraṇau baddhaye dṛḍhaṃ |
oṃ bhīmabhīrubhayābhāvalocana bhāvuket ||

<p. 96b>

trāhi mān devadeveśa śavānāmadhiyodhipa |
iti pādatale tasya trikoṇantu samullikhet ||

tenotpāttunnaśaknoti śavastu niścalo bhavet |
upaviśya punastatra bāhuniḥsāyapādayoḥ ||

hastayoḥ kuśamāstīryaḥ pādaustatra nidhāpayet |
oṣṭo saṃpūṭakau kṛtvā sthiracittasthirendriyaḥ ||

sadādevaṃ hṛdi dhyātvā maunī japamathācaret |
calāsano bhayannāsti bhaye jāte vadet tataḥ ||

yatprārthase balitvena dātavya kuñjarādikaṃ |
dināntare taddāsyāmi svanāma kathayasva me ||

<p. 97a>

ityuktāsaṃskṛto bhaktyā nirbhayastu punarjape |
tataśca madhuraṃ vākyam vaktavyaṃ lilayā naraḥ ||

tata satyaṅkārayitvā ca varan prārthaya sādhakaḥ |
yadi satyanna karoti varamvā na prayachati ||

tadā punarjapeddhīmān yekāgra yatamānasaḥ |
satye kṛte varaṃ labdhvā satye jentu japādikaṃ ||

phalaṃ jātamiti jñātvā juṭikān mocayet tataḥ |
śavaṃ prakṣālya saṃsthāpya mocayet pādabandhanaṃ ||

<p. 97b>

pādarajumocayitvā pūjādravyaṃ jale kṣipet |
śavaṃ jale vā garte vā nikṣipyasnānamācaret ||

tatastu svagṛṅgatvā valiṃ dadyād dināntare |

agnimārātrau |

yajamāno gṛhnantu mayā dattamimamvali |
atha yathārcitā nara kuñjara śūkarān ||

datvādiṣṭa mayākena kartavyaṃ samupoṣaṇaṃ |
parehni nityamācārya paṃcagavyaṃ pivet tataḥ ||

brāhmaṇan bhojaye tatra pañcaviṃśati śaṃkhyakān |
pañcapañcavihinānvā krameṇaiva daśāvadhi ||

<p. 98a>

tatra snātvā ca bhuktā ca nivase uttamasthalaṃ |
yadi na syād vipra bhojyāntadā nisphalatāmvrajet ||

tenayeti dhanattasyāt tavādevaḥ prakupyati |
trirātramvāpi ṣaḍātraṃ navārātraṃ pragopayet ||

strīśaryā yadi śabde vai tadā vyādhi vinirdiśet |
gītaṃ śrutvā ca vidhironiścakṣurnṛtyadarśanāt ||

yadi vakti dine vākyantamāsyan mūkatā bhavet |
pañcadaśadinaṃ yāvat dehe devasya saṃsthitiḥ ||

mesvī kuryāṅgandhapuṣpaṃ vadiṣīti padā yadā |

<p. 98b>

tadā vastramparityajya gṛhnīyād vaśanāntaram |
go brāhmaṇānānnindāṃñca na kuryā tu kadācanaḥ ||

devagobrāhmaṇādīñca pratyahaṃ saspṛśet suciḥ |
prātarnitya kriyānte ca bilvapatrodakaṃ pibet ||

tataḥ snātvā tu gaṃgāyāṃ prāpte ṣoḍasavāsare |
svahāntamantramuccārya tarpaṇānte mama padam ||

evaṃ śatatrayādvūrddha devān vai tarpayejjalaiḥ |
snānatarpanaśūnyasya na syādevasya tarpaṇaṃ ||

<p. 99a>

ityenena vidhānena siddhiṃ prāpnoti sādhakaḥ |
iha bhuktā varān bhogānante yāti hareḥ padaṃ ||

matsyasūkte |

athavānya prakāreṇa puraścaraṇamiṣyate |
kuje vā śanivāre vā śavamuṇḍaṃ samāhṛtaṃ ||

pañcagavyena saṃsnāpya candanena vilepya ca |
nikṣipya bhūmau hastārddha mānatakānane vane ||

tatra tahivaśe rātrau sahasraṃ yadi mānavaḥ |
ekākī prajapen mantra sa bhavet kalpayādayaḥ ||

athavānya prakāreṇa puraścaraṇamucyate |
śavamānīyatadvārite naiva pari khanyate ||

<p. 99b>

tad dinānte dinaṃ yāvat tāvaddaṣṭottaraṃ śataṃ |
śabhavet sarvasiddhīśo nātrakāryā vicāraṇā ||

athavānya prakāreṇa puraścaraṇamiṣyate |
aṣṭamyāñca caturdaśyāṃ pakṣayorubhayorapi ||

sūryodayāt samārabhya yāvat sūryostamānnaraṃ |
tāvat japtvā nirātaṃkaḥ sarvasiddhiśvaro bhavet ||

athavānya prakāreṇa puraścaraṇamiṣyate |
candrasūrye grahe caiva grāsāvadhi vimuktataḥ ||

<p. 100a>

yāvat saṃkhyanmanuñjaptā tāvadhomādikañcaret |
sūryagrahaṇa kārāddhinānyakāla praśasyate ||

tatra yadyat kṛtaṃ sarvamanantaṃ paladaṃ bhavet |
athavānya prakāreṇa puraścaraṇamiṣyate ||

śaratkāle caturthyādi navamyāntaṃ viśeṣataḥ |
bhaktitaḥ pūjayitvā tu rātrau tāvat sahastakaṃ ||

japedekākī vijane kevalanti mirālaye |
aṣṭamyādi navamyātaṃmupavāsa paro bhavet ||

anyatra guruvākyasya laṃghanaṃ naiva kārayet |
athānyañca prakāreṇa puraścaraṇamiṣyati ||

<p. 100b>

aṣṭamī sandhi velāyāmaṣṭottara latā gṛhe |
praviśya mantrī vidhivat tāsamattyarcya yatnataḥ ||

pūrvokta kalpamāsādya pūjādika samācaret |
kevalaṃ kāmadevosau japedaṣṭottaraṃ śataṃ ||

tāsāñca patramūle tu ulkā saṃgṛhyamastake |
kundā kṛti latā gātre likhitvā mantrameva ca ||

prapūjya tatra saṃskāraṃ datvā tasyai nivedya ca |
kiṃcijjayaṃnmanunnītvā devatā bhāva tatparaḥ ||

tāñca pūjya namaskṛtya svayaṃ japtāsusaṃyataḥ |

<p. 101a>

prātaḥ strībhyo balin datvā mantra siddhirna saṃśayaḥ ||

athavānya prakāreṇa purañcaraṇamiṣyate |
gurumānīyasaṃsthāpya devavat pūjanaṃ vibho ||

vastrālaṃkāra hemādyai guru saṃtoṣayet svayaṃ |
tatpatnī devi bhāvena pūjayecca viśeṣataḥ ||

pūjayitvā manujaptā svayaṃ siddheśvaro bhavet |
athavā svasasnāre guropādan prapūjya ca ||

kevalaṃ devatā bhāvo japtā siddhīśvaro bhavet |

gurudhyānaṃ | yathā |

<p. 101b>

sahaśradala paṃkaje sakala śītarasmi prabhaṃ varābhaya karāmbujāṃ |

vimala gandha puṣpāmbaram | prasannavadane kṣaṇaṃ ||

sakala devatā rūpiṇa smare chirasi haṃsagaṃ tadabhidhāna pūrvaṃ guruṃ gurave 
dakṣiṇāṃ dadyā | yathā vibhavavistaraiḥ |

guroranujñā mātreṇa duṣṭamantropi siddhyati |
guruṃ vilaṃghya śāstrosminnādhikāraḥ surairapi ||

evañca mantratañcāṇānprayogaṃ kriyate yadi |
guruvaktamvinā devi siddhi hāni prajāyate ||

<p. 102a>

tasmānmantrañca śiddhyebhyopi na darśayet |
anyathā pretarājasya bhavana yāti niścayaṃ ||

[iti tārārahasyavṛttau vīrādi sādhananirṇayo nāmāṣṭama paṭalaḥ] || 8 ||


atha mantrodhāraḥ | matsyasūkte |

atha bhedān pravakṣāmi tāriṇyāḥ sarvasiddhidān |
teṣāmvijñānamātreṇa jīvanmuktañca sādhakaḥ ||

tatrādau sanpradāya śuddhārthaṃ yathādhunāmādyāṃ pañcākṣarī vṛṇomi | 
yathā |

māyābījaṃ samuddhṛtya takāra vahni saṃsthitaṃ |
māyābindvīśvarayutaṃndvitīyam bījamuttamaṃ ||

<p. 102b>

kurcabījaṃ tṛtīyantu phaṭ kārantadanantaraṃ |
saṃpūrṇasiddhimantraṃ ca rasmi pañcakasaṃyutaṃ ||

rasmipañcakasiddhyanti eka jaṭā prakṣerasmi pañcakaṃ varṇa pañcakamityarthaḥ 
| nīlasarasvatī pakṣe tu rasmi pañcakanpraṇavamityarthaḥ | tathā phetkārīyepi |

akṣaro'sai mahāmantraḥ phatkārāno hṛdisthitaḥ pañcarasmi samāyuktopya 
jñāne dhanadāhakaḥ |

tasyochāra mahamvakṣe mama sarvajña kāraṇaṃ |
prathamaṃ saparaṃ datvā caturthasvarasaṃyutaṃ ||

<p. 103a>

rephārūḍhaṃ sphuraddiptamindubindu vibhūṣitaṃ |
takārañca tato dadyā caturthasvarabhūṣataṃ ||

dīrghokārasamāyuktaṃ haṃkāreścaiva yojayet |
phaṭkārañca tato dadyāt saṃpūrṇasiddha mantrakaṃ ||

līlayāvāk prabhāvena tena nīlasarasvatī |
tārakatvāt sadārāsukhamukti pradāyinī ||

ugrāpantāriṇī yasmādugratārā prakīrtitāḥ |
vitāvaika jaṭācaisā mahamuktiṃ karī matā ||

tārāstra rahitā arṇā mahānīlasarasvatī |
kullukeyaṃ samākhyātā kecindichantitāstrikāḥ ||

<p. 103b>

nīlatantre |

tārādyāpañcavarṇeyaṃ śrīmannilasarasvatī |
sarvabhāva mayī śuddhā sarvāmnāyairnamaskṛtā ||

śrībijodyā yadā vidyā tadā śrīsarvato mukhīḥ |
eṣaiva hi mahāvidyā mayādyā sakaleṣṭadā ||

vāgbhavādyā mahāvidyā vāgrūpā sarvavāgbhayī |
ekā krama gatā prāptā mata bhedā janmayī ||

ekavīrākalpe |

lajjābījamvadhūbījaṃ kurcabījaṃ yathā hi phaṭ |
evaṃ pañcākṣarī vidyā pañcabhūta prakāśinī ||

<p. 104a>

vidhūbījaṃ madhyabījaṃ taṃkāraṃ kevalaṃ yathā |

yathā kavi kalpalatādaustanaṃstanamiti | tathā bhagavatācāryenoktaṃ | madhye 
ṣoḍaśāhanite śuddhiṃ kevalantakāraṃ | viśeṣatastu atra madhyamabīje 
guptākāmṛta bījamasti | ati guptatvāmnoddhataṃ | tena sa ca matuḥ madhyabījamiti 
| siddhau jñeyamiti | śivadīkṣāṭīkākāraḥ | taduktaṃ tārārṇave | vaśiṣṭārādhitā 
cogrānatvaśīghra phalāyataḥ | atastenābhimunimāśāyodatta surārūṇaḥ ||

<p. 104b>

tataḥ prabhiti vidyevyaṃ phaladātrī na kasyacit |

śaktibījaṃ trayāt tantu bījo pariniyojitantataḥ prabhiti vidyeyamvadhūrīva yaśasvinī 
|

phalinī sarvavidyānāṃ jayinīṃ jayakāṃkṣanī ||

vipatkṣayakarī vidyā amṛtatva pradāyinī mantrasya jñānamātreṇa vijayī bhuvi 
jāyate | etat tu kevalameka jaṭānīla sarasvatī | api vidyayorekārtha tvāt ||

taṃtracūḍāmaṇīvapi |

anuttarasamuddhṛtya mayottaramata paraṃ |

<p. 105a>

prapañcamasamāyuktāḥ pañcarañcin prakīrtitaḥ ||

jīvanīmathamāpaścādekākṣī tadanantaraṃ |
ugradarpantataḥ paścādastraṃ devi prakāśitaṃ ||

ekavīrākalpe |

vilikhet kūṭasaṃyuktaṃ raudrantraiguṇyameva ca |
vidhiviṣṇumaheśānāṃ svaśaktyā kramayogatāḥ ||

eṣāmatā mahāvidyā sarvasiddhi pradāmatā |
sarvamaṃtra mayīvidyā sarvatantreṣu gopitā ||

siddhidābhajatāmāśu saṃpradāya vidhānataḥ |
dhyānārcana prayogāśca tāriṇyaḥ pūrvavaccaret ||

<p. 105b>

athānyāṃ sampravakṣāmi tārāṃ bhuvaṇatāriṇī |
smaraṇāt paramantrāṇāṃ bhayāmāsuvibhāśaye ||

praṇavaṃ pūrvamuddhṛtya hṛllekhā pūrvamuccaret |
gagaṇaṃ śeṣasaṃyuktaṃ bindunādavibhūṣite ||

kūrcabījañca hṛdayaṃ tārāyai ca samuddharet |
māhāpadaṃ samuddhṛtya tārāyai ca tataparam ||

sakalaṃ duṣṭarāṃstāra tārayeti tathā punaḥ |
tārayugmaṃ vahnijāyā maṃtrauyaṃ surapādapaḥ ||

<p. 106a>

gadyapadya mayī vāṇī kathāyāmabhidhāyaṇī |
caturlakṣajapenāsyāt siddhamoṣṭau bhavaṃti hi ||

dhyānapūjādikaṃ sarva pūrvavat samupācaret |

mantrarāje |

jarāpachamaṃnitārāṃ vakṣenyā śṛṇu tatvataḥ |
yasyāsmaraṇamātreṇa bhayamāśurvināśayet ||

praṇavaṃ pūrvamūddhṛtya tāre tāre ture tathā |
tanta svāheti mantroyaṃ daśākṣara udāhṛtaḥ ||

dhyānaṃ vakṣe śṛṇu prājñe samastā patnirākṛtaṃ |
yasmāt sarvatra toyeṣu bādhā na bhavati smṛtaṃ ||

<p. 106b>

śyāmavarṇāṃ trinayanāṃ dvibhujāmvara paṅkaje |
dadhānāṃ bahuvarṇābhiḥ sarvavarṇābhirāvṛtāṃ ||

śaktibhiḥ smeravadanāṃ smaramauktika bhūṣaṇāṃ |
racanapādukayornyasta pādāmbuja yugaṃ smaret ||

varṇalakṣāṃ japed vidyā niyamena yathā vaśī |
daśāṃśaṃ juhuyāmantro ghṛtāktau rakta puṣpakaiḥ ||

iti siddhāmahāvidyāṃ dadyāt sarvamanorathān |

mātṛkārṇave |

vidyāntaraṃ pravakṣāmi śṛṇuṣvāvahitā priye |
vāgbhavaṃ kuladevīñca tārakaṃ vāgbhavaṃ tathā ||

<p. 107a>

hṛllekhācāstramantrānte vahnijāyāvadhirmanuḥ |
aṣṭākṣaro manuḥ prokto vedamāturamuttamaḥ ||

pañcāṅganyāsamantrasya pañcabījaiḥ prakalpayet |
astraśeṣākṣarairnyasya kṛtakṛtyo bhavennaraḥ ||

dhyāna pūjādikaṃ sarvaṃ pūrvavat samumācaret |
kālikā siddhi vidyāsān mahākālī parāmatā ||

pasyāstotre mahāvidyā vijñeyā sādhakottamaiḥ |
kullukā tāriṇī proktā yadā parama sādhakaḥ ||

praṇavaṃ pūrvamuccārya padme yugmaṃ tathaiva ca |
mahāpadme padaṃ vrūyāt padmāvati padaṃ tataḥ ||

<p. 107b>

māye svāheti mantroyaṃ proktaḥ saptadaśākṣaraḥ |
pūjā pūrvādivatkuryāt pāṭha arddharātre catuḥpathe ||

japamasyā callakṣasyādutakavirbhavet |
bījamantrāvitantrāsyu tāriṇyāḥ sarvasiddhidāḥ ||

ete bhedāmahogrāyāḥ puruṣārtha pravartakāḥ |
āyuḥ śrīkāṃti kavitā vidyāsaubhāgyadāyaka ||

ante nirāmayaṃ brahma jīvanmukti pradāyakaḥ |

atha svachanda saṃgrahe |

śivabījaṃ maheśāni śaktibījaṃ tataḥ paraṃ |
bindusargāsamāyuktaṃ vedādyantadadhaḥ kramāt |

<p. 108a>

māyātrīḥ sarvabījena haṃsabījamataḥ paraṃ |
eṣa tvaṣṭākṣarī vidyā kathitā tu vidurllabhā ||

ājñāsiddhimavāpnoti trailokyaṃ vaśamānayet |
vaśamāyānti sahayā vedavidyā caturdaśaḥ ||

haṃsabhāvā mahāvidyā tava snehān prakāśitā |
kavitā māvahet puṃsāṃ dhanārthī dhanamāpnuyāt ||

mokṣārthi labhate mokṣaṃ nātra kāryā vicāraṇā |
ugra tārā mahāvidyā kathyate mama pauruṣaṃ ||

paṃcākṣarī ca vidyāyāṃ haṃsādyantā mahodayā |
kevalaṃ tatprayatnena tava snehān prakīrtitān ||

<p. 108b>

anayo japapūjādin pañcākṣaravadācaret |
jīvakhaṇḍa mahāvidyā tritārādyā pṛthak pṛthak ||

trailokya kavitāsiddhidāyanmuttamadāyinī |
ṣaḍdīrghayā māyayā ca ṣaḍaṃgaśamupācaret ||

pūjāpūrvavadurdiṣṭā prayogā ayitat sadā |

aikavīrākalpepi |

śivaḥ śaktistathā māyā phaṭkārānta udāhṛtaḥ |

sārddhapañcākṣaro mantro jñānadīpaḥ kavitvadatārāmāyā śiva 
bhaktiphaṭkārāntā parātmṛtā |

<p. 109a>

etayo kalpamudita mahogrāphalamuttamaṃ |

atha mahānīlasarasvatī dyathā | taduktaṃ siddha sārasvate |

vāgmāyā kamalā bījaṃ iśo bhṛgu nisevitaḥ |
caturdaśenduḥ saṃyuktaṃ pañcādbhṛgu mahesvarau ||

caturdaśavisargā padadvandva ca vāk padaṃ |
vādinīti pataṃ vrūyāt nīpadatṛtayatnataḥ ||

nīlasarasvatī padaṃ tridhāvṛttiśca vāgmanoḥ |
kāhi śabdadvayaṃ pañcākastūrīmagnivallabhā ||

catustriṃśad varṇayukto nīlasārasvato manuḥ |
ṣaṭkauśikoyaṃ viśeyā ṣaḍbhirmantrairyataḥ kṛtaḥ ||

<p. 109b>

ṛṣichando devatānāṃ vidhānaṃ śṛṇu pārvati |
gaṅgā pravāhanāmarṣi matsyarupī janārdanaḥ ||

atiśayavāk kavitāchando devi sarasvatī |
sarvavāgīśvarya mayī samaspṛbhīṣṭadāyinī ||

aiṁ bīja kīlakaṃ jñeyaṃ hmai śaktiḥ samīritā |
nīlovarṇāstra vijñeya tvarimā kavitā dhruvaṃ ||

mundrantu prativādīndramukhamudrā samīritāḥ |

hṛllekhayā ṣaḍaṃgāni | kuryāt ṣaḍdīrgha yuktayā |

<p. 110a>

dhyāna |

nīlāṃśu kāmani mayāñca kareṣu vīṇāṃ mudrāñca pātramatha pūrṇa 
sudhāndadhānāṃ |

udyaccaturmukhavahatkavitā pravāhaṃ |
nīlāṃ bhajāmi hṛdayeṣu sarasvatī tāṃ ||

atha mātṛkodhyānāntaraṃ yathā |

nīlāṃbhodharasāvatā trinayanā bāhusphurat vallakīṃ mudrā pātra karāṃ 
caturmukha vahadvāgbhaṅgikallolinī |

nīlachāyamavāla paṃkti racanā divye vimāne sthitā |
protuṅgastanabhāra bhaṅgura tanurnīlāśivāprātuvaḥ ||

<p. 110b>

lakṣamātraṃ japed vidyān daśāṃśaṃ samitotpalaiḥ |
nidrāyāśca mahāvidyā bījāḍhyāṃ parikalpayet ||

dhyānapūjāpuraścaryā sarva nīlāsamaṃ bhajet |

[iti śrītārārahasyavṛttau maṃtrauddhāranirṇayo nāma navamaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 9 ||


athedāni tārāstava nirṇayo liṣyate | atha vidyāmahātmāṃ | taduktaṃ tārārahasye |

athātaḥ sampravakṣāmi tārārahasya muttamaṃ |
yenā tuṣṭita mātreṇa siddhiyoṣṭau bhayaṃti hi ||

<p. 111a>

yasyā smaraṇamātreṇa pākyavitrāyate dhruvaṃ |
yajñānādamadatvañca labhetyuktiñcaturvidhaḥ ||

kālikulārṇavepi |

ye paṭhanti parāmvidyān niyame rahasi sthitaḥ |
devāḥ sarve namasyanti kiṃ punarmānuṣādayaḥ ||

vṛhaspati samovāgmī dhanedhanapatirbhavet |
kāmatulyañca nārīṇāṃ ripuṇāṃ samayopamaḥ ||

tasya pādāmbuja dvaṃ dvaṃ rājāṃ kirīṭa bhūṣaṇaṃ |
tasya bhūtimvilokaivaṃ kuveropi tiraskṛtaḥ ||

<p. 111b>

ya evaṃ pūjayed devī niyame pitṛkānane |
tasyaivājñākarasthāñca siddhayoṣṭau bhavanti hi ||

tasyaiva jananī dhanyāpi tātasya surottamaḥ |
satpradāya vidāmvantaya evamveti tatpataḥ ||

yasya vijñāna mātreṇa kulakoṭiṃ samuddharet |
nandanti pitaraḥ sarve gāthāgāpatti sarvadā ||

api na sa kule kaścit kulajñāni bhaviṣyati |
sa dhaṃnya sa capi jñāni kavi sa ca paṃḍitaḥ ||

sakulīna sa ca mukhī sa vaśī sa ca dhīka |
brāhmaṇa saṃyamī sopi agnihotrī sa dīkṣataḥ ||

<p. 112a>

satīrthasaripīthānān sunivāsīṃ sarvadāḥ |
samo mayā jīvavratī sa saṃnyāsī sa pūjitaḥ ||

sa dharmātmā sa yogī ca sa mukta sa ca brahmavit |
sa vai brahmaḥ sa saivañca sasaura sa ca mānayaḥ ||

sa ca vijñāna mātreṇa ya enāmvetti tatvataḥ |
api cettvat samānā samatsamaḥ puruṣosti cet ||

aniruddha sarasvatyāḥ samo mantrosti vai sadā |
yoga sandhāraṇaṃ samyak dhyānamasyāna saṃśayaḥ ||

mahāpāpe mahotpāte mahāgrahapivāraṇe |
mahāśoke mahāmāye mahāyadi nivāraṇe ||

<p. 112b>

mahāmohe mahāsaurya mahādāridya saṃkaṭe |
mahāraṇye mahāśūnye mahājñāne mahāhṛde ||

samasta kleśasampāte smaranādeva nāśayet |
asyojñānaṃ jñānāmeva dhyānamasyātma darśanaṃ ||

tasmādasyāmayāvidyā nāsti tantre na saṃśayaḥ |

phetkārīye |

jihvayānyasanā deva mūkopi sukavirbhavet |
jñānamātreṇa mantrasya jayāt sarvajñatānnayet ||

<p. 113a>

avyāhatāmatī śāstrai vijagho vākyaterapi |
bhāvamāva sampanne bhaved yogī mahākaviḥ ||

jatropi yadi śūdrasyāḥ bhāvano vasa tatparaḥ |
labhate śrīmatāṃ vāṇīnmantraṃsyalakṣa jāyate ||

nāradīya tantre |

suvimala nakhadanta pādau mudita manāḥ paradūṣaṇe maunī |
harihara kamalodbhavāṃghrī bhakto bhavati cirāya sarasvatīṃ nivāsa ||

kṛta sukṛta sahasro nekajanma pratānai yati bhavati manuṣvo 
gurvadhīnañcirāyuḥ |
kathamapi manumenanprāpya śiṣyāya kasmai nijakulatilakāya jeṣṭa putrāya dadyāt 
||

<p. 113b>

manurvimṛṣya dātavyo jeṣṭāya hi vinīyate |
putrāya kimanyathā kasmai vigotrāya svapauruṣaṃ ||

madhunā tridinā darvāku jihvāyāṃ nyasanān manuṃ ||
vinā pāṭhena mūrkhopi paṃḍita sobhi jāyate ||

gurucaraṇasarvadā bhaktī bhāvāt paricarati | vidheyovāsya sarvātmanānuṃ ||
manumanu dinamevanmānavosau bhavati jagati vādadvetasiddhānta hantā |

<p. 114a>

sarvadā gopayedenānmanaso bhāvimeva ca |
tena vīryavatī vidyā nirvīryā syāt prakāśitā ||

utpādaka brahma dātrau garīyān brahmadarpitā |
tasmāt manye satataṃ pituraṣyadhikaṃ guruḥ ||

na kadāpi bhavati mūrkhomanumenamvetti yo manujaḥ |
trijagati bhavati vikhyāto vidhyāyanmanoyūjāṃ ||

yasminmanumenaṃ tatra tulābhasyāntritayaṃ |
niyatavyaṃ tatpayamapi sadasatkarmaṇorubhayoḥ ||

vidyā brāhmaṇamityāha sevadhistu hi kevalaṃ |
amukāya māṃsādātṛ tadāsyā vīryavattamāṃ ||

114b>

yameva tu sucindintiyataṃ brahma vādinaṃ |
tasmai māṃ vrūhi viprāya nāmipāyaṃ pramādine ||

athāsthāna dvitīyañca na kiṃcid vighna kāraṇaṃ |
kṣipra prasādā jagatā sadā nīlasarasvatī ||

nīlasārasvataumantra kacitā vighnavighna kāriṇī |

kaliyuge manprasādāt bhaviṣyati ||

alpajñamapi vidvāṃsanmārayiṣyanti vāgminaḥ |
vṛhaspati vadācāryaṃ paśya mantra samudbhutaṃ ||

<p. 115a>

mantrasya jñāna mātreṇa anubhāva dvayaṃ bhavet |
tatkāri kavitāyaraivana hi vyabhā ||

siddhimantro yadā mantrī vāliśasmāpi mūrddhanī |
karandatvādi satyādi sopi ślokān karotyutaḥ ||

vidyāmvodasavāpnoti kīrtimāyu sutān bahun |
nivāsaḥ śrīsarasvatyo yatra sārasvato manuḥ ||

[iti śrītārārahasyavṛttau mantramahātmyanirṇayo nāmaḥ daśamaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 10 
||


athāto bhāva nirṇayaḥ |

bhāvanā ca samāpanna iti yatsucitattadvivacya kathyate |

<p. 115b>

taduktaṃ bhāvacūḍāmaṇau |

śrībhairava uvāca |

samayācārasaṃketameva ca bhāṣitantu mahādevi kathayasvānukampayā |

sarvamantreṣu vidyāsu bhāvasaṃketameva ca |
tathāpi śaktimantreṣu viśeṣo sarvasiddhidaṃ ||

rahasyāvihimantrāṇāṃ yadi bhāvo na vidyate |

śrīdevyuvāca |

bhāvastuti vidho devi divyavīra paśukramān |
guruvastrividhācātra tathaiva mantra devatāḥ ||

<p. 116a>

śaktimantre mahādeva viśeṣāt sarvasiddhidaṃ |
ādyabhāvo mahādeva śreyāt sarvasamṛddhidaḥ ||

dvitīyomadhyamañcaiva tṛtīyaḥ sarvaninditaḥ |
bahujāyāt tathā homān kāyakleśādi vistaraiḥ ||

na bhāvena vimāne ca taṃtra maṃtrā phalapradā |
kimvīrasādhanaillakṣaiḥ kimvā kṛṣṭikulākulaiḥ ||

kiṃ pīṭha pūjane naiva kiṃ kanyābhojanādibhiḥ |
suyoṣit prītidānena pareṣāñca tathaiva ca ||

kiṃ jitendriya bhāvena kiṃ kulācāra karmaṇā |
yadi bhāva viśuddhātmā na syāt kula parāyaṇaḥ ||

<p. 116b>

bhāvena labhate yuktaṃ bhāvena kuladharmanaṃ |
bhāvena gotravṛddhisyā bhāvena kulaśobhavaṃ ||

kanyā savistareṇaiva kiṃ bhūtaśuddhi vistareḥ |
kintathā pūjane naiva yadi bhāva na jāyate ||

kena vā pūjate vidyāmapi kena na pūjate |
phala bhāvañca devena bhāvān bhāvān prajāyate ||

etad rahasya kathane saṃkino mama mānasaṃ |
trilokī matsarī prāya sarvatra tatsamāgamaḥ ||

nāvīkṣmanījanandevaṃ kathantatkathayāmi te |

śrībhairava uvāca |

<p. 117a>

tvat praśādāt mahādevī vidyā svapna vibodhinī |
sarvamāyā prapañcānāṃ dīkṣādakṣāmameśvarī ||

vidyate devi sarveṣāṃ bhūtānāṃ svāpakāraṇaṃ |
karomi kathayatvaṃ māṃ yadi putratvamāgataḥ ||

śrīdevyuvāca |

prathamaṃ divya bhāvantu kathyate śṛṇu sādaraṃ |
yad varṇa devatā yadvat tat tejaḥ puṃsabhūṣitaṃ ||

tejomayaṃ jagatsarvaṃ vibhāvya mūrtikalpanaṃ |
tattatmūrtimayaimantrai svena svenaiva pāpuna ||

ātmāna tanmayaṃ dṛṣṭvā sarvabhāvan tathaiva ca |
tatsarva yoṣiti dhyātvā cittayed yata mānasaḥ ||

<p. 117b>

aśeṣakulasampannā nānā jāti samudbhavāḥ |
nānādeśodbhavā vāpi guṇalāvaṇyasaṃyutāḥ ||

dvitīyavatsarādūrddha yāvat syādaṣṭamādvikaṃ |
tāvat kumārī vijñeyo mantratantra phalapradā ||

kumārī pūjanāccaiva kumārī bhojanādapi |
ekadvitryādi bījānāṃ phalaṃ dānātrasaṃśayaḥ ||

tābhyaḥ puṣpaṃ phalamvāpi anulepādikantathā |
bālapriyañca naivedyaṃ datvā tadbhāva pūritaḥ ||

<p. 118a>

datvā tadagre ātmānam valibhāva viceṣṭitaḥ |
tābhiḥprāya kathālāpa krīḍākauṃbhūkalādikaṃ ||

yathā tathantat priya kṛtkṛtvā siddhisvarā bhavet |
tasmāt ṣoḍaśa paryantaṃ yuvatīti pravakṣate ||

na tatra bhāva prakāśaścetma bhāva paramātmanaḥ |
rakṣitavyā prayatnena akṣatā snāna kārayet ||

na viṣṇustu hariśaṃbhu na devīnāpi ṣoḍaśī |
na ca mṛttyuñjayo vāpi na nyāsānāpi bhāvanā ||

asya mṛtyuṃ kṣame deva prabhavaṃti na devatā |
sastrena śūlayogena nāgadaṣṭaviṣeṇa vā ||

<p. 118b>

raudreṇāti jvareṇaiva mahāvācyāthiva sādapi |
mṛyatte tena pāpena satyaṃ suvrataniścayaṃ ||

śrībhairava uvāca |

caturthāśramiṇāṃ devi mokṣadātvaṃ tadā kathaṃ |
kulabhāva virodhi tvāt saṃśayaṃ mama dūratāḥ ||

śrībhairavyuvāca |

mokṣadvārastu bahudhā yadyasti kula bhairavāḥ |
kevalaṃ kulayogena prasīdāmi na saṃśayaḥ ||

caturthā śamināṃ deva avadhūtā śramo mahān |
tatrāhaṃ kulayogena prasannāmokṣadāyinī ||

<p. 119a>

yadī na syāntathā vatsa śṛṇu tatkathayāmite |
jñānābhāve samutpanne saṃprāpte ca tadājñaya ||

tadā yogī vimukta syāt tāmaṃ pūjya kulāntare |
kuṇḍalī śakti ca vare tadā yogaṃ samabhyaset ||

nirddhanda nirahaṃkāraḥ śuddhanāḍī gaṇovratī |
mṛddhāsane samāsīna khagasaṃyamaneratāḥ ||

merudaṇḍa bahiḥ pārśve candrasūryātmake śive |
madhye suṣumnā saṃdiṣṭā tanmadhye citra rūpiṇī ||

<p. 119b>

tayaivagrasthitaṃ padmaṃ mūlādi varṇa pañcakaṃ |
kuṇḍalyākārarūpena ḍākinyādyupalakṣitaṃ ||

mūladvāraṃ samāsādya sthitānāga svarūpiṇī |
vāyunābhidyate muktiṃ dṛḍhaṃ vidrāvayet tataḥ ||

uchāsājarakāmasya śikhāyāni samujvarā |
praticakraṃ prakutrāsau jivātmānaṃ yarekule ||

niyojayati tadyogādamṛtaṃ kṣarate citaṃ |
vyomaprodbhidyamānānta gato candradivākarau ||

adhovaktraṃ mahāpadmaṃ kroḍīkṛtya suṣumnayā |
vyāhṛtyanāsikāmadhye gata citrattaraṃ gatā ||

<p. 120a>

urddhabhitvā tu liṃgasthaṃ dṛḍhaṃ tatpuskarāntare |
bahirud gamanākāṃkṣā kāriṇī mokṣadāyinī ||

jīvenādṛṣṭa saṃbandhyā sthitā paramasaṃvidhau |
etad bhedaṃ vijānāti bhitvā yāti paraṃ padaṃ ||

adṛṣṭadhātu bījosau bahiryāti dine dine |
dineśāṅgulimānena tadarddhaṃ copavāsataḥ ||

dviguṇaṃ ratikālesyā triguṇaṃ yadi daivataḥ |
nunaṃ vā tadadhaḥ prāṇaḥ śarīraṃ parimuñcati ||

śarīrasaṃgatāṃ nītvān mūlaṃ vā vaṭukesvaraḥ |
kumbhayitvā hyadho vāyu kuṇḍalī mukhavartmani ||

<p. 120b>

yojayitvā tato bījaṃ nitvānādāvasānakaṃ |
gamāgamaṃ kārayitvā siddhye bhavati nāpuraḥ ||

pīyate khādyate yantu tatsarvaṃ kuṇḍalīmukheḥ |
hutvā siddhimavāpnoti na ca bandhena bādhyate ||

bhikṣā kāryā nayā svārthaṃ kuṇḍalīnmā kṛte punaḥ |
re mādaddehi me bhikṣaṃ kuṇḍalī tarpayāmyahaṃ ||

avadhūtā śrame sthitvā bhairavānanda tatparaḥ |
bhairavohaṃ na cānyasmin devo matparata kvacit ||

<p. 121a>

tantramantrārjanaṃ sarva mayi jānaṃ na cānyathā |
śivohaṃ bhairavānando mattohaṃ kulanāyakaḥ ||

rakta candanavigdhāgoraktakaupīna bhūṣitaḥ |
raktamālyāṃmvaradharo hetu yukta sadā bhavet ||

eva bhikṣāṃ vrajan bhikṣuḥ bhairavācāra tatparaḥ |
kṣīyatena ca pāpena badhyatena ca jantunāḥ ||

yatra deśe svayaṃ māti sa deśaḥ kṣitināyakaḥ |
atra nindā parāṃ ye tu spanti tatkṣaṇā prabhoḥ ||

<p. 121b>

tasmād yastāt pūjitavyo nātiraskāra eva ca |
yatrechāvartate tasya tatkārya priyamapriyaṃ ||

tathānya devadeveśanovācāleti vistaraṃ |
pūjayantī mahādevī kulāṅgadṛṣṭi mātrataḥ ||

puṣpaṃ gandhaśca tāmbūla naivedyaṃ yatra yad bhavet |
manasā tatsamutsṛjya bāhyatotkula vāriṇā ||

ātmani tansamābāhya devīrūpa kuleśvaraḥ |
na pūjā nāpi sugamananiṣṭāna vratādikaṃ ||

<p. 122a>

pūrṇohaṃ bhairavaścāhaṃ nityānandohamavyayaḥ |
nirañjana svarupohaṃ nirākārastvahaṃ vibhuḥ ||

sarvaśāstrabhiyuktohaṃ sarvamantrānupāragaḥ |
tasmāt parataro devo na jāto na janiṣpati ||

ānandarūpavān buddhaḥ sarveṣāṃ priya kāraka |
suskaṃ durgandhamatsyādityājya divya vali priye ||

nānā sugaṃdhi saṃyuktaiḥ māsādi bhojanaṃ caret |
sugaṃdhāmalatailādyairnnānālaṃkāravistaraiḥ ||

snānaṃ kāryaṃ cāti śuddhaṃ sukṣmavāsobhidhārayet |
sugaṃdhipuṣpamālābhiḥ svarṇālaṃkārabhūṣitaiḥ ||

<p. 122b>

snigdhaṃ sumadhuraṃ deyaṃ kāmarupaṃ manoharaṃ |
kṛtārthaṃ maṃgalaṃ dehaṃ śuddhabhāṣaṇa tatparaṃ ||

nāmnāmadhumatīstatra jāyate nātra saṃśayaḥ |
madhumatyā phalaṃ devaḥ kathayāmi śṛṇuṣva me ||

sudhādhāra dharāvāṇī vakrāntasya prajāyate |
sarvajñaḥ savaśāstraṇāmadhipaḥ kulanāyakaḥ ||

candrasūryāvadhi puṃsāṃ bhunakti bahulaṃ sukhaṃ |
devakaṃnyāpsarobhistu divyai gāndharva cāraṇauḥ ||

nānāvilāsasannaddheḥ kulākulakalāvidaiḥ |

<p. 123a>

nṛttyairgītaiśca madhurai nānopāya rasāyanaiḥ ||

amṛtādyaiḥ pratikarairdeva bhāgyaisudurllabhaiḥ |
devakaṃnyā hasta gataiḥ rathamāruhya sotsukau ||

āyāmi sādhakākāṃkṣa hṛdayā parameśvarī |
yatre kāmaśvarā devo ciṃtā vasamupāgataḥ ||

tatraiva yānti satanaṃ devakanyā sahaśraśaḥ |
indrayogyāṃ purīkṛtvā vasanti sādhakaḥ sahaḥ ||

tatopagata pāpātmā bhutvā tu bahudhā sukhaṃ |
cirakālaṃ bhuvi sthitvā cānte muktimavāpnuyāt ||

<p. 123b>

brahmāṇḍagolasaṃbhedāttena jīvet samṛddhiyuk |
etat te kathitaṃ deva divya bhāva sukhī vahaḥ ||

na deyo yasya kasyāpi paśau gopya prayatnataḥ |
vīrabhāva mahādeva kathyate śṛṇu bhairavaḥ ||

nirdvandva manaso bhūtvā hṛdākāmakalā tanuḥ |
idaṃ vīrakulaṃ deva deva padya manoharaṃ ||

yadveśe vartate vīrastatphalaṃ vāpi bhairavaḥ |
na ca mārī bhayaṃ tatra na ca rājabhayādikaṃ ||

sumaṅgalaṃ sadā tatra dhana putra vivarddhanaṃ |
lakṣmī tatra mahādeva susthirā sarvadā bhavet ||

<p. 124a>

mantraṃ svapna prabodhinyā suvaśyaṃ vṛkṣamūlake |
yojanīya prayatnena na ca vighnaṃ prajāyate ||

yoginībhirna guptantat na ca pāpena lipyate |
yatra kutra kujevāre śmaśāne gamane kṛte ||

pūjāphala bhavet tatra yakṣa pūjāphalaṃ labhet |
pūjāphalaṃ bhavet tatra saptavāsarasaṃmitaṃ ||

caturdaśyāṃ gate tatra yakṣa pūjāphalaṃ labhet |
nagare nāryatasthānaṃ paśureva na saṃśayaḥ ||

<p. 124b>

nānyosyādadhiko deva iti cintā parāyaṇa |
mādrakavyaṃ bhuktā tu bhavet kula parāyaṇaḥ ||

sādhake kṣobhamāpanne mama kṣobha prajāyate |
tasmād yattādbhogayuto bhaved vīravarasudhī ||

bhogena sukhamāpnoti bhogena kulasādhanaṃ |
yadyad dadāti nidrāti yatkaroti yadarcati ||

tatsarvaṃ kularūpaṃ tu dhyātvaivaṃ viharet sudhīḥ |
ekākī nirjane deśe śmaśāne parvate vane ||

śūnye gṛhe nadītīre niḥśañke vicaret mudā |

<p. 125a>

vīrāṇāṃ japakālantu sarvakāle praśasyate ||

sarvadeśe sarvapīṭhe kartavyaṃ nānnaśaṃśayaḥ |
yadi vipro bhavechreṣṭaḥ kūladravya parāyaṇaḥ ||

taddhyānena vidhānena kartavyaṃ kulaśobhanaṃ |
aparāpuṣpagarbhe tu kulasthānamanoramaṃ ||

sarvadevasukhaṃ tantu mahākālakulātmakaṃ |
hayārikusume devī svayamasti sadāśivaḥ ||

tatsukhe laghumādāya puṣpamadhye tu candanaṃ |
raktakuṃkumarāgamvā kṛtvā tatra śivātmakaṃ ||

<p. 125b>

yojayechivaśaktyāstu aikyaṃ saṃbhāvaṇaṃ tadā |
kṣaṇaṃ vicintya tatraiva saṃcintya parameśvarī ||

yatrā parājitā puṣpaṃ javāpuṣpaṃ ca bhairavaḥ |
karavīrā raktaśukle droṇapuṣpaṃ ca vaṃdhukaṃ ||

kuṇḍaṃ ca mālatī puṣpaṃ yatra yatrāpatiṣṭati |
tatra devī vasennityaṃ tadyatre pūjanaṃ mama ||

datte caiva javāpuṣpaṃ paṭṭavastraṃ phalalabhet |
brahmahatyādikaṃ pāpaṃ kṣaṇaṃ naśyati niścitaṃ ||

aparāyāstu mahātmyaṃ vaktuṃ na hi maheśvariḥ |
vīrasādhana kāryaṃ tu kartavyaṃ vīrapūruṣaiḥ ||

<p. 126a>

divyairapi ca kartavyaṃ paśubhirna ca pāmaraiḥ |
paraṃ pāmara vīryaṃ tu na paśoriti niñcitaṃ ||

yadyattattatpurāproktaṃ saṃketaṃ mantrasādhanaṃ |
añjanaṃ guṭikāṭīñca kuryād vīro mahābalaḥ ||

divyo vīreṇa bhedesti yadbhedaṃ yantu kathyate |
śānto vinīto madhurā kalālāvanya saṃyutaḥ ||

divyantu devavat prāyo vīraścoddhata mānasaḥ |
vibhūtirbhūṣaṇairvāpi candanenāpi lepitaḥ ||

<p. 126b>

ākāro gopano vāpipyakovākula bhairavaḥ |
raktacandanadigdhāṃgo vaiṣṇavo vāpya vaiṣṇava ||

asaṃskṛtaṃ keśajālaṃ saṃskṛto vā kuleśvaraḥ |
apamāne ca pūjāyāṃ hṛṣṭapuṣṭaḥ sadā bhavet ||

devanindā paro vāpi tatpūjādi paropi vā |
pūjāratastatra hito kulālāya mate sthitaḥ ||

nijabhāvasamāyukto devavad vihareskṣitau |
svakulānte puraścaryā kāryārātrau na vā tathā ||

veda hīne dvīje deva yathā mantreṇa satkṛyāḥ |
viṣṇubhaktirvinā devi bhaktirna prabhaved yathā ||

<p. 127a>

śāktaṃ jñānaṃ vināmuktiryathā hāsyāya kalpate |
guruṃ vinā yathā mantre nādhikāra kathaṃcanaḥ ||

yatī hinā yathānārī sarvakarmā vinirjitā |
kulaṃ vinā tathā devī vīro vā mama sādhakaḥ ||

nādhikārīti kauleyastāsmādbhāvaparo bhavet |
avinītaṃ kulaṃ yasya sa kathaṃ mama pūjakaḥ ||

tasmād yatnāt tathā kāryaṃ yathā syād vinayāñcitaṃ |
bhāvābhāvāt kule śāstre nādhikāra kathaṃcana ||

tena bhāvaviśuddhastu sādhakaḥ kauliko bhavet |

<p. 127b>

śrīdevyuvāca |

paśubhāvaṃ pravakṣāmi śṛṇutvaṃ susamāhitaḥ |
yathāvidhi paśuddīkṣāṃ gṛhītvā bhāva tatparaḥ ||

prathamaṃ pūrva sevārthaṃ yatnataḥ śuddhimācaret |
namatsyaṃ bhojanaṃ kuryānnastriyaṃ manasā smaret ||

na paradravyalobhasyānta bhoge māna saṃcaret |
sindhutīre kānane vā parvate vā surālaye ||

bilvamūle vivikte vā puṇyakṣetre susobhane |
tasūdradarśanaṃ kāryaṃ kauṭilyaṃ yatnatastyajet ||

<p. 128a>

devatā śuddhabhāve tu dhyātavyā susamāhitaiḥ |
trisaṃdhyaṃ devapūjāsyā trisaṃdhyaṃ japamācaret ||

rātrau mālāñca yantraṃ ca spṛśe naiva kadācanaḥ |
na mantramuccared bhuktā maunī syāt sarva karmasu ||

sarvakāle striyaṃ naiva gache tu sādhakottamaḥ |
puṣpaṃ gandhañjalaṃ caiva svapamānīvapūjayet ||

maithunaṃ tatkathā lāpaṃ tadgoṣṭīḥ parivarjayet |
ṛtukālaṃ vinā gacche na ca gache tu sādarāt ||

<p. 128b>

purāṇa śravaṇe śraddhā vedavedārtha tatparaḥ |
na rātrau bhojanaṃ vidyā tāmbūlaṃ parameśvaraḥ ||

guruṇāyadyadādiṣṭa tatsarvayatnatañcaret |
api tatkusumaṃ caiva hetu tatra ca bhairavaḥ ||

spṛstvā striyaṃ trirātreṇa pañcagavyena śuddhyati |
raktaṃ vastraṃ na gṛhnīyād devī bhaktī parāyaṇa ||

viṣṇu mantrokta kalpādi tadanuṣṭānameva ca |
kāryāvīrakathālāpaṃ na kuryādeva niṃdanaṃ ||

nityaśrāddhagavāgrāsaṃ saṃdhyāvandanameva ca |
tīrthasnānapīṭhadaśagamanaṃ dharma tatparaḥ ||

<p. 129a>

paśustu vividho deva pūrveṇa saha bhairavaḥ |
asyādhikāra pūjāyā na gurutve kathaṃcana ||

pūrvasyanādhikārosti pūjādesagataugate |
pūrvastu sarvakālestu bahiḥ kārya svadeśataḥ ||

pūrvadarśanamātreṇa kuladarśana mācaret |
brahmahadyādikaṃ pāpaṃ varaṃ ca kathana prabhe ||

pūrvadarśana mātrantu satyaṃ satyaṃ varāmyahaṃ |
mamātmā sopi deveśa vibhurityapi suprabho ||

tathāpi tatra me śaṅkā jāyate tatpade pade |
varaṃ kulaṃ parityājyaṃ varasvakula hiṃsanaṃ ||

<p. 129b>

varaṃ svakulanindāsyā varaṃ svakula baṃdhanaṃ |
varaṃ svakulahānistu varaṃ svakulanindanaṃ ||

kāyena manasā vācā varaṃ svakula pātanaṃ |
na kūryācca pūrvasaṃgamamāṅgakṣayakāraṇāt ||

kulamātre dvayaṃ pāpa pariṣṭakulanāyakaḥ |
svakule vahati nindā paravyoma kuleśvaraḥ ||

tasmādapi ca tatpāpaṃ paśusaṃgāt prajāyateḥ |
sarvathā tatra bhāvau dvau na prakāso kathaṃcana ||

<p. 130a>

saṃbhāvaṃ ca vibhāvaṃ ca paśurdvedhā prakīrtitaḥ |
sa bhāvaḥ paśubhāvena janmaśraya vibhāvanāt ||

vīrabhāvedbhaved devo tato daiva prajāyate |
daivācca jāyate vīro vīrā deva prajāyate ||

daive vīrena saṃdehaḥ sāmyamityavidhīyate |
bhāvastu manaso dharmaḥ śabde sa hi kathaṃ bhavet ||

tasmāt bhāvo hi kartavyo diṅmātraṃ samudāhṛtaṃ |
yathekṣuguḍamādhuryaṃ daśaṇaijñayate vrahau ||

tathā bhāva vibhāvastra manaso paribhāvyate |
eka eva mahān bhāvo nānārtha bhajate prabho ||

<p. 130b>

upādhi bheda bhāvena bhāvabhedā nayiṣpati |
ānandaghanasaṃdoha prabhuḥ prakratirupadhṛk ||

rasarūpaḥ sa evātmā sa prabhuḥ paramomataḥ |
śrotavyaḥ sa ca mantavya vidhitavyaḥ sa eva saḥ ||

sākṣātkāryāṃ vade veṇa pratyakṣa parameśvareḥ |
bhāvaivahuvidhai deviḥ bhāvastatraiva nīyate ||

bhūktā vai vividhaṃ grāsaṃgavicaiko yathā rasaḥ |
duścādadyāsayogena nānārthaṃ labhate prabhoḥ ||

tṛṇena jāyate deva rasastasmāt parorasaḥ |
tasmādadhi tato havyaṃ tasmādapi rasodayaḥ ||

<p. 131a>

sa eva kāraṇaṃ tatra tatkāryaṃ na ca labhyate |
dṛśyate ca mahādeva na kārya na ca kīraṇaṃ ||

tathaivāyaṃ sa evātmā nānāvigraha yoniṣu |
jā ejjaniṣpate jātaḥ kālabhedādi bhāvyate ||

sa jāta samṛto yadvat samuktaḥ samukhī punaḥ |
sastrī pumānnapuṃsakaḥ savidyā vā samṛddha ca ||

nānābhyāsa samāyogī nānārtha bhajate prabhuḥ |
eka eva sa evātmā sarvarūpī sanālavaḥ ||

<p. 131b>

avyaktaṃ sa ca vyaktaṃ syāt prakṛtyā jñāyate dhruvaṃ |
tasmāt prakṛti yogena jñāyate nānyathā kvacit ||

vināghaṭatva yogena na pratyakṣo yathā ghaṭaḥ |
itarādbhidyamānopi tabhedamupagacchati ||

māṃ vinā puruṣe bhedā na ca vāti kathaṃcana |
na prayogairna ca jñānaiḥ śrutvā ca na guru krameḥ ||

prakṛtyā jñānatanātmā prakṛtyālupyate pumān |
prakṛtyādhisthitaṃ sarvaṃ prakṛtyāvaṃñcitaṃ jagat ||

prakṛtyābhedamāpnoti prakṛtyāsarvasaṃvasa |
navastu prakṛtiṃ naiva na pumān parameśvaraḥ ||

<p. 132a>

tayoḥ samarasaṃ jñānaṃ vastutatvaṃ maheśvaraḥ |
ubhayo samavāyastu vastu tastu paraṃ padaṃ ||

jñāyate smin svayaṃ prājñañcitsvarūpaṃ pumānasau |
nirvikāra sarva devaḥ pumānān gocaraḥ pumān ||

vyakto bhavati deveśa svayamātmāsvayaṃbhuvaḥ |
upāyaṃ santi bahudhā jñānaṃ brahma sanātana ||

tathāpi prakṛte yogān kṣiprapratyakṣatāṃ vrajet |
sāyāṃstrikākuleśe tu yathānāva pragṛhya sa ||

<p. 132b>

nānādeśaiḥ samuttirya samudraṃ viśate cirāt |
tattathaināvamāsthāyakṣaṇadyanti yathā prabho ||

viṣṇuśaktyā labhet brahma tatprabhāvādapi prabho |
vaijātyaṃ nāsti cet tatra kathaṃ tadvidhi kāraṇaṃ ||

tasmāt paraṃ parājātāste hi kāraṇatā gatāḥ |
na kāraṇāni te vastu sākṣāt prakṛtikāraṇa ||

strībhāvaḥ prakṛtiḥ jñeyaḥ prabhāvapurūṣottamaḥ |
vyakti bheda vibhāgena jñāyatāṃ bhairaveśvaraḥ ||

ghatatvaṃ punaretasya bhedakāraṇa me bahiḥ |
tathā jñapti vikārādvānyasyapyaṃ japtatāṃ gataḥ ||

<p. 133a>

sākṣātkāraṇamevaitat prakṛtyaivāpi ceśvaraḥ |
divyabhāvo virabhāvo yasya citte vyavasthitaḥ ||

jīvanmukta sa evātmā bhogārtha labhate mahiḥ |
devīputra sa evātmā bhairavaḥ parikīrtyate ||

bhāvatrayānāmadhye tu dvau bhāvo svapratiṣṭhitau |
na vaktavyau mahādeva kulasāraṃ kulottamaṃ ||

[iti śrītārārahasyavṛttau bhāvanirṇayo nāma ekādaśaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 11 ||


atha brāhme muhurte utthāya svaśaryāṃ sarvapāyavilopanāya śirasi

<p. 133b>

sahasradalakarṇikāyāvasthitaṃ śvetavarṇaṃ dvibhujaṃ varābhayaṃkaraṃ 
śvetamālyānulepanaṃ |

prakāśasvavāmasthitāyā vimalarūpiṇyā raktāśaktyā sahitaṃ |
vibhāvya mānasai rūpacārairārādhya aiṁ iti yathāśakti japtvā ||

akhaṇḍamaṇḍalākāraṃ vyāptaṃ yena carācaraṃ |
tatpadaṃ darśitaṃ yena tasmai śrīgurūve namaḥ ||

iti stutvā namaskṛtya mūlādi brahmarandhrāntamarūṇadivākarakoṭi pāṭalāṃ 
mūlavidyāṃ vibhāvya tat kriyāsamabhihāreṇa

<p. 134a>

śutraṃ sudhārayā santarpya yathāśakti mūlamaṃtraṃ japtā utthāyāvasyakaṃ 
vidhāya snānārthaṃ nadyādau gatvā devyāḥ pūjāyogyārthaṃ snānamahaṃ 
kariṣye | iti saṃkalpa |

yathānuṣṭānena snātvā maṃtra snānamārabhet |
yathāmūlavidyayā trinimajya japan utthāya mūla vidyayā ||

trivārajaptena udakena kalaśamuddhayaṃ jalinātmānaṃ trivāramabhiṣiṃcya 
mūlavidyayā trivārācamyadevarṣi pitṛtarpaṇaṃ |

<p. 134b>

vidhāya mūlavidyayānte śrīmadugratārāṃ eka jaṭāṃ nīlasarasvatī 
pañcaviṃśativāraṃ vā saptapañcavisativāraṃ vā tridhā vā saṃtarpya |

jalādutthāya dhautavāsasī paridhāya ācamya sūryārghaṃ datvā tāmrādi pātre 
candanākṣata kusuma śvetāparājitā puṣpāni nikṣipya |

udya vāditya maṇḍalavartinyai nityacaitanyodita |

yai śrīmadeka jaṭāyai svāhā | iti trīrarghyaṃ datvā | tanmadhye devīmvibhāvya |

bhagatyeka jaṭe vidmahe ekavīrāyai dhīmahi tannastāre pracodayāt |

<p. 135a>

ekavīrāyai vidmahe mahogrāyai dhīmahi tannā devī pracodayāt ||

ityetārāyā iti gāyatrī yathāśakti japtvā saṃhāra samudrayāmahṛdi samānīya 
tato yogasthānamāgamya ||

oṃ vajrodake huṃ phaṭ svāhā | iti jalāmantreṇa jalamadhisthāya | etajjalaṃ 
sarvasaparyārthaṃ vidhāya kiñcidanyajale kṣipet | tenaicāriṇā |

oṃ hrīṁ svāheti mantreṇa pādau prakṣālyaḥ kuśahasta

<p. 135b>

kulakulāt svarṇarajatamudrā rūpān yathā savye haste datvā | svarṇarajata mudrā 
kulakuśāsanāmikāyāṃ dhṛtvā |

oṃ hrīṁ viśuddhadharma gāyatrī sarva pāpāni śamapāleṣa vikalpātayana hūṁ 
phaṭ svāhā |

yathā vidhi ācamya tatra pīṭhaṃ vicintya | śmaśāna tatra saṃcintye tatra 
kalpadrumaṃ smaret | 

tanmūle maṇipīṭhaṃ ca nānāmaṇi vibhūṣitaṃ |
nānālaṃkārabhūṣādyairmunidevaiśca maṇḍitaṃ ||

<p. 136a>

śivābhirbahumāṃsāsthi modamānābhiraṃ tataḥ |
caturdikṣuśacāmuṇḍā citāṃgārāsthi bhūṣaṇā ||

tanmadhye bhāvayed devīṃ yathoktaṃ dhyāna yogataḥ |

dhyātvā |

oṃ maṇidharī vajriṇi sarvaśaṃkari huṁ phaṭ svāhā iti śikhābandhanaṃ |

oṃ rakṣa 2 huṁ phaṭ svāhā | lalābhiṣekena bhūmiṃ śodhayet | oṃ sarvavighnān 
sāraya hūṁ phaṭ svāheti | nārā ca sudrayā akṣata prakṣeyāt 
trividhavighnānutsārayat ||

oṃ pavitra vajrabhūme hūṁ phaṭ svāheti |

<p. 136b>

anena bhūmimabhimantra tataḥ komalakambalādi viṣṭarāsanādi yathā 
sāmānyāstīrya | tatra |

oṃ āḥ surekhe vajrarekhe huṁ phaṭ svāheti rakta gandhapuṣpābhyāṃ 
samabhyarcyā svastikādi kramenopaviśet | athānena mantreṇa bhūmau maṇḍalaṃ 
viciṃtya tatrāsane āsthāya tatopaviśet | kecit | āsanepi kecit |

oṃ maṇidhari vajrini mahāpratisare rakṣa (2) hūṁ phaṭ svāhā | iti |

<p. 137a>

vastrāntike rakṣāgraṃthi vaṃdhayet | oṃ āḥ hūṁ phaṭ svāheti vyāpakatayā 
kāyavākcitta śodhanaṃ | oṃ namaḥ puṣpaketurājahite tathā gatāya samyak 
saṃbuddhāya oṃ puṣpe puṣpe mahāpuṣpe supuṣpe bhūṣite | puṣpaṃ ca yāvakīrṇe 
hūṁ phaṭ svāhā iti puṣpādi mantramayaṃ kṛtvā svarṇādi pīṭhe raktacandana 
gorocana kuṃkumavajrapuṣpāghatulipte |

bhuṁ āṁ surekhe vajrarekhe huṁ phaṭ svāheti mantreṇa maṇḍalaṃ likhet |

<p. 137b>

yathā trikoṇāntargardbhitamaṣṭa dalapadmaṃ catudvārātmakaṃ |

tasya trikoṇāgre hrīṁ yāmye trīṁ uttare phaṭ paścime trikoṇāgre madhye hūṁ 
mama druta kavitva pāṇḍityaṃ kuru (2) ityādinā sādhye sahitaṃ likhet | etadyantra 
purato rakata candanaṃ gaṃbhāryādi pīṭhe nidhāyapīṭhamarcaye | yathā madhya 
uparyupari śmaśānāya namaḥ | kalpavṛkṣāya namaḥ | tanmūlamani pīṭhāya 
namaḥ | nānāmaṇibhyo namaḥ | nānālaṃkārebhyo namaḥ | 

<p. 138a>

munibhyo namaḥ | devebhyo namaḥ | bahumāṃsāsthimodamāna śivābhyo namaḥ | 
caturdikṣuśavebhyo namaḥ | muṇḍāya namaḥ | citāṅgārāya namaḥ | asthe namaḥ 
| tatoṣṭadaleṣu devāgrādi kramena | oṃ lakṣmai namaḥ | oṃ sarasvatyai namaḥ | oṃ 
ratyai namaḥ | oṃ prītyai namaḥ | oṃ kīrtyai namaḥ | oṃ śāntyai namaḥ | oṃ 
puṣṭau namaḥ | oṃ tuṣṭau namaḥ | 

madhye hmau mahāpretāsanāye namaḥ | ityabhyarcya | tadupari 

<p. 138b>

mūlena mūrti saṃkalpabhūtaśuddhiṃ kuryāt | yathā prāṇāyāma krameṇa 
hrīṁkāraṃ raktavarṇaṃ nābhau dhyātvā tadudbhūtena vāyunā bhasma protsārayet 
| tato hūṁkāraṃ śveta varṇaṃ śirasi vicintya tadudbhutena vāyunā tadasthi 
śmaśāna rūpaṃ plāvitaṃ kṛtvā samastaṃ śarīrarūpaṃ viśvaṃ plāvayet | 
ātmāraṃ vyayagataṃ arthaṃ nirmalaṃ tāriṇī mayaṃ dhyāyet |

tathā tasmin śmaśāna rūpe viśvavyāpake amṛtavāriṇi |

<p. 139a>

āḥkārodraktapuṣpaṃ dhyātvā tadupari ṭaṃkārāt śuklapadmaṃ vicintya tadupari 
nīla saṃnibhaṃ hūṁkāraṃ dhyātvā hūṁkāraṃ bīja bhūṣitāṃ kartṛkāṃ 
dhyāyet | kattaryuparigataṃ dhyāyet | ātmānaṃ tāriṇīyaṃ dhyātvā ||

pratyālīḍha padāghorāṃ muṇḍamālā vibhūṣitāṃ |
kharvāṃ lambodarī bhīmāṃ vyāghracarmavṛtāṃ paṭau ||

navayauvana sampannāṃ pañcamudrā vibhūṣitāṃ |
caturbhūjāṃ lalajjihvāṃ mahāmāṃvarapradāṃ ||

<p. 139b>

khaḍgakartī samāyuktā savyetara bhujadvayaṃ |
kapālolpalasaṃyuktāṃ savyapāṇi yugānvitāṃ ||

piṃgograika jaṭāṃ dhyāyet maulāvakṣot paśobhitāṃ |
evaṃ bhūtaśuddhi kṛtvā arghasthāpanamācaret ||

yathā svavāme trikoṇavṛtta caturasraṃ maṇḍalaṃ kṛtvā tatraṣṭādhāraṃ 
kapālādi pātraṃ nidhāya tatra mūlavidyayā vimalayayasāpūrya bilvapatra 
raktacandanavajrapuṣpākṣatāni niḥkṣipyārghyāgnīśāsuravāyuṣu madhye dikṣu ca 
dayāni | oṃ hrāṁ hṛdayāye namaḥ | oṃ hrīṁ śirase svāhā |

<p. 140a>

oṃ hūṁ śikhāya vaṣaṭ | oṃ hraiṁ kavacāya hūṁ | oṃ hrauṁ netratrayāya 
vauṣaṭ | oṃ hra astrāya phaṭ | ṣaḍaṃgāni ca vinyasya taddaśadhā mūlavidyāṃ 
japtā tejomayena tarjana sarvavidyā mayaṃ kṛtvā iti arghaṃ vidhāya 
prāṇāyāmādikaṃ kṛtvā | 

yathā mūlavidyayā daśavāraṃ japet vāme nāsāpūṭe vāyumāpurya tasyā eva 
ṣoḍasavāraṃ japet suṣumnāvatsnāstaṃ sapitvā etasyā evāṣṭapha japet 
dṛṣṭanāsāpuṭe vāyuṃ virecayet |

<p. 140b>

evaṃ yathāśakti prāṇāyāmaṃ kṛtvā huṣyādinā saṃnyaset |
yathā sirasi akṣobhya ṛṣaye namaḥ mukhe ||

vṛhati chandase namaḥ | hṛdi | eka jaṭā devatābhyo namaḥ | mūlādhāraṃ |
hrīṁ bījāya namaḥ | hṛdaye | phaṭ śaktāye namaḥ | śeṣākṣarānucārya 
sarvāṅgaṃ kīlakāya namaḥ | 

punastathaiva mamadruta kavitva pāṃḍitya siddhaye viniyogaḥ | karāṅgaṃ nyāsaṃ 
kuryāt | tathā |

<p. 141a>

hrīṁ ekajaṭāyai aṃguṣṭābhyāṃ namaḥ | aṃguṣṭayo hrīṁ tāriṇyai tarjanibhyāṃ 
namaḥ | tarjanyoḥ | hūṁ vajrodake madhye mābhyāṃ namaḥ | madhyamayoḥ | hrai 
ugrajaṭe anāmikābhyāṃ namaḥ | anāmikayoḥ | hrauṁ mahāparisare 
kaniṣṭikābhyāṃ namaḥ | kaniṣṭikayoḥ | hraḥ piṅgograika jaṭe karatala 
pṛṣṭābhyāṃ namaḥ | karatarapṛṣṭayoḥ | iti karaṃga nyāsaḥ | 

atha ṣaḍaṅgāni | 

hraiṁ ekajaṭāyai hṛdayāye namaḥ | iti tarjjanīmadhyamānāmikābhiḥ hṛdaye |

<p. 141b>

hrīṁ tāriṇyai śirase svāhā | tarjjanīmadhyamābhyāṃ | hūṁ vajrodake śikhāyai 
vaṣaṭ | ityadhoṅguṣṭayugmaśikhāyāṃ |  haṁ ugrajaṭe kavacāya huṁ | iti 
hastadvayābhyāṃ śira ādipādaparyantaṃ | hrauṃ mahāparisare netratrayāya 
vauṣaṭ | iti tarjanī madhyamānāmikābhiḥ | netratrayoḥ hraḥ piṅgograika 
vāgrupiṇyai kavacāya hūṁ | iti vyabhyaya hastābhyāṃ | śirasādi pādaparyantaṃ | 
hrauṁ rudravāgrūpiṇyai netratrayāya vauṣaṭ |

<p. 142a>

iti tarjanīnāmikābhiḥ netratraye | hraḥ sarvavāgrūpiṇyai astrāya phaṭ | iti 
tarjanimadhyamābhyāṃ urddhorddhatālatrayachotikābhirdaśadigbandhanaṃ kuryāt 
|

tadukta siddhasārasvate |

akhila cāgrūpiṇī procya hṛdayāya namo vadet | 
akhila vāgrūpiṇīpi śirase vahni vallabhā |
brahmavāgrūpṇī tyuktā śikhāyai vaṣadityapi |
viṣṇavāgrūpiṇī tyuktā kavacāya humuccaret |

<p. 142b>

rudravāgrūpiṇī tyuktā netratrayāya vauṣaḍiti |
sarvavāgrūpiṇī saktā astrāya phaḍiti smaret |
ṣaḍdīrghamācare māyābījānte nāti yojayet |

athavā tantracūḍāmaṇau |
bījānte ekajaṭāyai hṛdayaṃ parikīrtitaṃ |
tāriṇyai śirasi tadvadvṛjodake śikhāntathā |
ugrajaṭeka kavaca mahāparirase tathā |
piṅgograika jaṭe tadvannetrāste parikīrtite |
evaṃ pīṭhaṃ nyāsa varṇanyāsau saṃlikhitau tārārūpayuktatvāt |

<p. 143a>

taduktaṃ phetkāraṇīye |

aṃgaṃ nyāsakarau kuryādatreva kevalaṃ | atroktamācaredasminnyāsaṃ cāraya 
saṃgatā nyāsaṃ nānyastaṃtrokta mācaret | kālikā tantre varṇanyāsastu | 
kālikatantra tantroktaṃ mātṛkāvarṇamācaret | tadyathā |

varṇaṃ nyāsa pravakṣāmi yena devī mayo bhavet |

aṁ āṁ iṁ īṁ uṁ ūṁ ḷṁ ḹṁ eṁ aiṁ oṁ auṁ aṁ aḥṁ | iti svarabhāgaḥ ||

aṁ āṁ iṁ īṁ uṁ ūṁ ḷṁ ḹṁ vai hṛdayāye namaḥ | hṛdayāṃ nyaset |

<p. 143b>

eṁ aiṁ oṁ auṁ tāriṇyai śirase svāhā | nai(-)ṛte |
hraṁ vakrodake śikhāyai vaṣaṭ | vāyavyāṃ |
hraiṁ ugrajaṭe kavacāya huṁ | karṇikāyāṃ |
hrau mahāparisare netratrayāya vauṣaṭ | caturdikṣu |
hra piṅgograikajaṭe astrāya phaṭ |

atha devyāmaulau |

akṣobhya vajrapuṣpaṃ pratīcha hūṁ phaṭ svāhā |
iti saṃpūjya devyā vāyavyādīśaparyantaṃ ||

gururūpaśaktimarcayet |

uṁ urddhakeśānandanātha vajrapuṣpaṃ pratīcha hūṁ phaṭ svāhā |

<p. 144a>

oṃ vyomakeśānandanātha vajretyādi |
oṃ nīlakeśānandanāthā vajretyādi |
vṛṣadhvajānandanātha vajrapuṣpetyadi | ete divyaughā || 1 ||

oṃ vasiṣṭānandanātha vajretyādi |
oṃ harināthānandanātha vajretyādi |
oṃ jayāsu vajretyādi |
oṃ vijayādyasu vrajetyādi |
oṃ mahodarpasu vrajetyādi |
oṃ śākhānandanātha vrajetyādi |
oṃ parānandanātha vrajetyādi |
oṃ yanānandanātha vrajetyādi |
oṃ kulānandanātha vrajetyādi |

<p. 144b>

oṃ virūpākṣānandanātha vajrapuṣpaṃ pratīcha hūṁ phaṭ svāhā | ete 
mānavaughā |

etadaśaktau akṣobhya mātraṃ devīmau pūjayet |
athāto vāmā vartena pūrvadi daleṣu ||

oṃ vairocana vajrapuṣpaṃ pratīcha hūṁ phaṭ svāhā |
oṃ śaṃkhapāṇḍala vajrapuṣpaṃ pratīcha huṁ phaṭ svāhā ||

oṃ padmanābha vajra puṣpaṃ pratīcha huṁ phaṭ svāhā |
oṃ japuṣpamityādi | tato vāmāvartenāgnyādi digdale |

<p. 145a>

oṃ nānāmakeśvara vrajetyādi | oṃ yamātta vrajetyādi |
oṃ vighnāntaka vrajetyādi | oṃ naṃ narakāntaka vrajetyādi |

iti gandhādibhiratānyunardevīṃ gandhādibhiḥ saṃpūjyaṃ |
svavāme trikoṇe varta caturaśramaṇḍalaṃ kṛtvā ||

oṃ puṣpai samatyarcya |

tatra vihita valitraya bharitaṃ sādhāraṃ nidhāya tatvārāmikhābhyāṃ spṛṣṭvā |

oṃ jrī ekayaṭe mahādhiyate mayopanītaṃ valiṃ gṛhna (2) gṛhnāpaya (2) mama 
sāṃtiṃ kuru (2) paravidyāmākṛṣya trūta

<p. 145b>

chindhi (2) sarvajagadvaśamāraya hrīṁ svāhā |

iti japtā bali datvā rahasyamālayā |

nigadonoyaṃśunāmānasevanāyāśahaśraṃ śataṃ taddina javori sadyamūlaṃ 
japet |

tatra japa rahasyaṃ yathāmūlādhārasvādhisthānamaṇipūrakeṣu yathā saṃkhyaṃ 
bījatraya vyāptaṃ taḍitkoṭikaḍārāṃ parasparānūsyūtāvibhāvyorcārya sarvatejo 
viśuddhaṃ | phaṭkāraṃ viśrānti rūpaṃ dhyātvā caret |

<p. 146a>

japanīyamastu tadrutaṃ na vilamvitaṃ eva meva ca ato evaṃ yathāśakti japtā 
arghodaka kusumamādāya tejomayaṃ tajjapaṃ |

guhyātiguhyagopītvaṃ gṛhāṇāsmatkṛtaṃ janaṃ |
siddhirbhavatu me devī tvat praśādāt maheśvarī ||

iti devyā vāmahaste japaṃ samarpya tanyīkṛtaṃ taddibhāvya stutvā | aṣṭāṃga 
pātaṃ praṇamet |

tato māṃ madīya paradevatāyai samarpayet | oṃ tatsa viditvā samarpayet |

oṃ tatsa viditvā samarpaṇi kṛtvā yoni mudrāṃ pradarśya |

<p. 146b>

sarvāvaraṇadevatādeṅge vināpya saṃhāramudrayā paratejaḥ svahṛdaya 
samānīya prāṇāyāma ṣaḍaṃgau kṛtvā aiṁ śānyāṃ nirmāla vāsinye nama 
sarvaśeṣa niveṣayet pāṭha | śiṣṭebhyo dadyāt |

siṃhaṃ saptalye yathā sukhaṃ viharediti nityapūjā | puraścaryāyāmeva 
samabhyarcya ||

lakṣāṃ japtā taddaśāṃśena śitotpalena bilvapatreṇa vā catusare maṇḍape yathā 
vidhi prathama saṃskṛte sati agni hutvākvālāgurudra

<p. 147a>

vyopetairvimalairgandhavāribhistaddaśāṃśena tarpayet |

taddaśāṃśena vimalavāriṇā yathopadeśana 
svamūrddhanyabhisiṃcyataddaśāṃśena brāhmaṇāṃ kumārī vā uttamāṃ 
striyakṣīramāṃsādi ghṛtakhaṇḍādyaiḥ |

yathā vidhimaṃtarpa gurave dakṣiṇāṃ dadyāt |

[iti śrītārārahasyavṛttau dvādaśaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 12 ||


athāto homapaddhatiṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ |

atranaimittikādi nityādaumādikaṃ | home hastādya mama tuṣṭaunnataṃ sthaṃṇilaṃ 
bālukāditirviracya |

<p. 147b>

taduktaṃ japahomādi tvāt pūjāyāḥ mūrtilakṣaṇaṃ |

tatra sahaśrādi home śayyādi śodhite pañcahasta sapta hasta maṇḍape vā sarvato 
bhadra caturamukuṇḍaṃ kuryāt |

tanmaṇḍapakaraṇānnuvāstoḥ pūrvasyānmuttarasyāmaiśānyā vā |

taduktaṃ gaṇeśavimarṣiṇyāṃ | 

vāsto saṃgṛhya pūrvasyāmaiśānyāmuttarethavā |
diśisaṃkalpayet mantrī maṇḍalaṃ bhuvi bhāgataḥ ||

<p. 148a>

navahasta pramāṇamvā saptahastamathāpi vā |
pañcahasta pumānamvā caturasraṃ samanvitaṃ ||

nirmitantu caturdvāraṃ vedibhirdṛṣṭibhūṣaṇaṃ |
darbhanyālāpari vṛtantantunā pariveṣṭitaṃ ||

ekakuṇḍīpakṣe | pañcahastagṛhītameva prasastaṃ | taduktaṃ homanīrūpe |

eka kuṇḍīmatenāpi pañcahastaṃ gṛhaṃ bhavet |
tadekaṃ caturasyaṃ kuṇḍaṃ yasyottara bhāge śastaṃ ||

taduktaṃ gaṇeśavimarṣiṇyāṃ |

tathottare kuṇḍamekaṃ vedāsraṃ tu samuddharet |
lakṣahome tu tatkuryād gṛhamadhye tu mūdyaṇamiti ||

<p. 148b>

caturasraṃ ca sarveṣāṃ kecidichaṃti tāntrikā |

iti sāradātilake |

caturasre maheśāni sarvakarmārtha sādhayet |

kuśaśālodbhyā(?) ca |

saṃkṣipya catusra mātraṃ saṃkṣipya likhyati |
tatra gṛhādi kuṇḍakaraṇe hasta niyamo yathā ||

karturdakṣiṇa hastasya madhyasya dīrghamānena nāmāṅgulinirūpaṃ | 

kartuyajamānasya | taduktaṃ vijñānanītaśvare |

<p. 149a>

gṛhādi kuṇḍakaraṇe hastānāṃ niyamo yathā |
yajamānasya kartavyaṃ nānyasyaiva kadācanaḥ ||

athāṣṭabhirvairekāṅgulamiti | taduktaṃ nīteśvare |

yasyāṅguloyavastasyāṃ soyavāṣṭamudāhṛtaḥ |
tilastu matpañcamāṃsastilasabhāgameva ca ||

bhaventrihāyaṇīvālaṃ tasya ṣaṣṭo na vāpi ca sarvataiva hi yadṛṣṭaṃ 
maṅgulaimavyamā (*) lai |

madhya parvāyāmamānaṃ tacca viṃsati tatparaḥ |
āgamānupasaṃsmṛtyairvahniḥ svaskṛyate cayaiḥ ||

<p. 149b>

taistadaṅgulamānena kuṇḍānyapi vidhīyatāṃ |

tatra catumrakuṇḍo yathā |

prākyak sūtramānena tanmadhye lāṃchayet suddhī |
bhāgadvaye tanmadhya vidhā cottayāmyayoḥ ||

diśo matsya yugaṃ kuryāt tanmasyodarayoḥ pūnaḥ |
dakṣiṇottarayo sūtraṃ yathāmānaṃ nipātayet ||

tatsutrāgreṣu saṃsthāpyakosteṣu makalāllikhet |
koṇasthamakarāgrādi dikṣu sutrāṇi pātayet ||

<p. 150a>

evaṃ kṛte tanu koṣṭaṃ caturasraṃ prajāyate |
edadeva bhavet kuṇḍaṃ caturasraṃ sulakṣaṇaṃ ||

kuṇḍavistāramānañca āyāmaṃ tādṛśaṃ punaḥ ||

tanmānamavataṃ kuryāt tādṛgrupyañca mekhalā |
mekhalī bhṛyatāṃ cāpi dvitīyaṃ vaivameva vā ||

vedādādinayanochadavistāro hasta mātrake |
antarnavāṃgulo chadhā vismṛtā caturaṅgulo ||

kriyāsārepi pradhānamekhelocherayukta navāṅgulaṃ |
tadbāhyamekhaledvedhaṃ pañcāṅgulamiti smṛtaṃ ||

<p. 150b>

tavāhyamekhalo chedhamaṅgula dvitayaṃ kramāt |
catustridvyaṃtula vyāmo mekhalā triyastviti ||

sarvatraiva vidhaṃ kṣetraṃ kuṇḍānāmanurūpataḥ |
ekāṅgulaṃ tathā tyaktā kuṇḍāntarmekhalā bhavet ||

ekahaste tu kuṇḍe tu anya kuṇḍe tu varddhayet |
arddhāṅgula tu kuṇḍe tu kuṇḍaṃ kuryā ca mantravit ||

sātvikā mekhalā pūrvā dvitīyā rājasi smṛtā |
tṛtīyā tāmasī proktā mekhalānāntu nirṇayaḥ ||

<p. 151a>

atha yoni nirṇayaḥ |

prathame mekhalā yoni mekhale hoturagrataḥ |
kuryāṅgajoṣṭanarṇāntu kuṇḍavitsarva lakṣaṇaḥ ||

yoni ṣaḍaṃgulāyāmacaraṃgulavismṛtā |
unnatodvyaṅgulāḥ proktā kuṇḍe hastamite budhaiḥ ||

nābhi kuṇḍodare kuryāt sudhīraṣṭadalājvravat |
tattatkuṇḍānupāyamvā nābhiṃ tatra vicakṣaṇaḥ ||

netra vedāṅgulo chedavistārānābhiratra vaiḥ |
muṣṭiratnimite kuṇḍamātrantu caturaṅgulaṃ ||

<p. 151b>

dvihastādviṣu kuṇḍeṣu yoni saṃmbaddhayet kramāt |
ekaikāṅgulamānena tathā nābhiṃ ca varddhayet ||

kuṇḍahastādbahiḥstvānaṃ sthalamityavidhīyate |
caturasrasya lāyāmāmātmanmadhye sarandhikāṃ ||

sthūlamūlā ca sūkṣmāgrātrārāsyotta manoharā |
vāhyastha mekhalā vādyasthāna mālabhya kārayet ||

taduktaṃ bhāskarācārya na | yonau nāle sarandhikamiti |

rudrayāmale |

<p. 152a>

yonyamadhye vilaṃ kuryāt tadāhyagrāhi saṃjñakaṃ |

taduktaṃ gaṇeśa vimarṣiṇyāṃ |

kuṇḍasya rūpaṃ jānīyāt paraṃmaṃ prakṛtervapuḥ |
udaraṃ kuṇḍamityāhu hastāvubhayataḥ smṛtau ||

pādau pañcama koṇe dve yonodyathā candra rāje |
yoniḥ kāraṇa bhūtasya hastasya syāt padaṃ mahat ||

tena tatraiva havyānāṃ vidhānāntanmayaṃ tvataḥ | kalāni pūrṇā viṃvorosau | 

yo yoṣṭhaṃ varddhayed vidvān nābhiṃ vṛttā kṛti tathā |
tat tatkuṇḍānurūpamvā kuryāt sādhakasattamaḥ ||

<p. 152b>

yonikuṇḍe tathā padme yoni padmaṃ tu kārayet |
śatādi navaśatānāt tu muṣṭiṃ kuṇḍenu homayet ||

hastamātraṃ sahaśre tu dvihaste mayute smṛtaḥ |
caturhaste lakṣe mātraṃ ṣaṭkure daśalakṣakaṃ ||

daśahastāntat havane ko prāṃmapi daśaiva hi |
daśahastāt paraṃ kuṇḍaṃ nāsti home mahītale ||

tatra dvihastādi kuṇḍe mekhalā | taduktaṃ sāradātilake |

kuṇḍe dvihastatājñeyā vasudeva guṇāṅguṇā |

<p. 153a>

catuhaste tu kuṇḍe vā casu tarka yugāṅgulāḥ ||

kuṇḍedṛsakaretāḥ | syurdaśāṣṭārddhaṅgulācitāḥ |

vasuhastamite kuṇḍe bhānuṃ paktyāṣṭakāṃgulāḥ |
daśahastamite kuṇḍe manubhānu daśāṅgulāḥ ||

āyāmochāpato jñeyā mekhalā sarvato budhaiḥ |
atha dvihastādi kuṇḍānāṃ pramāṇa yathā yāmale ||

ekahastā dvikuṇḍānā pumānamavidhīyate |
purāṣaṇmukha hastena yaduktaṃ candramaulinā ||

<p. 153b>

ekahasta dvihastādi gadatomīniśāmayaḥ |
trayatriṃśāṃgulaṃ śūtraṃ tiladvādaśakānvitaṃ ||

dvihastakuṇḍe vidhivat pūrvaṃvatparikalpayet |
trihaste catvāriśatila dvādaśakoṇitaṃ ||

catuhaste tu kuṇḍe satripañcāśāṅgulo caret |
tena dvādaśakaṃ sūtraṃ pañcahaste nivodhame ||

catuṣaṣṭyāṃgulaṃ sūtraṃ tiladvādaśakoṇitaṃ |
aṣṭāśītyaṃgulaṃ sūtraṃ tiladvādaśakoṇitaṃ ||

<p. 54a>

saptahaste tu kuṇḍe vai sutraṃ vidyān parityajet |
saptanavanyaṅgulaṃ sūtraṃ dvinavadvādaśakoṇitaṃ ||

navahaste tu kuṇḍe vai sūtraṃ tantu vidāṃ matāṃ |
nava dvādaśasaṃyuktaṃ ṣadūttare śatāṃgulaṃ ||

daśahastasya kuṇḍasya uddhare tatra vinmataṃ |

atra viśeṣa |

atra dvihastādi kuṇḍe mekhalāyonyādau prakṛta hasta 
caturviśāṃśenāṅgulādvivarddhanaṃ | tadarpyā patitoraṇi prabodhamātraṃ | 
taduktaṃ vṛhadyoginī hṛdaye | dvihastādiṣu kūṇḍe | vyomasūtrañca yadbhavet |

<p. 154b>

taccaturviṃśati cāreṇa nānāṃgula parigrahaḥ |
tadaṅgula pramāṇena sarva kuṇḍeṣu sarvataḥ ||

mekhalā yoni galādi kalpanaṃ parikīrtitaṃ |
evaṃ sarvatra parimānaṃ jñātvā kuṇḍaṃ kuryāt ||

ajñānadoṣo yathā | yadāha viśvakarmā |

khāte'dhike bhaved rogī hīne dhenu dhanakṣayaḥ |
vanna kuṇḍaṃ tu saṃtāyo maraṇaṃ chinnamekhalā ||

mekhalā rahite soko hyadhikena vinākṛtaṃ |
apatyadhvaṃsanaṃ prokta kuṇḍaṃ yatkaṃṭha varjitaṃ ||

<p. 155a>

anyatrāpi śrībhairava ṣoḍaśe sutrādhike suhṛdbhedo mānabhīnodaridratā |

āyodhaḥ kaṃṭha hīnaisyāda siddhi mūlakhātake |
adhike vittanāśastu hīne dūkha pravartate ||

vyādhayaśca pravartante hīmoṣṭe syādapasminī |
uccāre sphuṭite chidre saṃkule vā mṛtirbhavet ||

iti tastmātu vai jñātvā kuṇḍaṃ ca racayediti | taduktaṃ rudrayāmale |

iti saṃkṣapato devimānaṃ kuṇḍeṣu darśitaṃ |
yoginī hṛdaye dṛṣṭaṃ bhāṣitaṃñca muniścayaṃ ||

<p. 155b>

divyaillokopakārāyastehenāni vaceditaṃ |
praṇipatya guro jñātvā kuṇḍānāṃ racane caret ||

athāgni kāryāṃ vakṣe kuṇḍasyottare mantrī nityanaimittika kāmyeṣu tatkarmeṣu 
tatkarmānuguṇatayā tattaddhomānūmānena tattadākāreṣu viraciteṣu caturaśrādiṣu 
āgamalakṣalakṣiteṣu kuṇḍeṣu sthaṇḍileṣu vā yāṃmaṃ kūryāt |

tatrāṣṭādaśa saṃskāraiḥ kuṇḍaṃ kūryāt |

<p. 156a>

taduktaṃ lakṣadeśike tantre |

aṣṭādaśasyuḥ saṃskārā kuṇḍānāṃ tatra coditāḥ |
vikṣaṇaṃ mūlamantreṇa śaremantreṇa mārjanaṃ ||

vilepanaṃ kalārūpa kalpanantadanaṃtaraṃ |
triśūtrīkaraṇaṃ pañcāddhadhayenārcanaṃ mataṃ ||

astreṇa vajrikaraṇaṃ hṛdayena kuśaiḥ śubhaiḥ |
catuḥpathaḥ tanūtreṇa tamuyādakṣapātanaṃ ||

yoge kuṇḍonisaṃkuryān saṃskārairevarāritaiḥ |

aśaktānpratyāha |

<p. 156b>

athavā tāni saṃskuryāccaturbhirvīkṣaṇādibhiḥ |
vikṣaṇaṃ mūlamantreṇa śareṇa prokṣaṇaṃ mataṃ ||

tāḍanaheti mantreṇa astra maṃtreṇa mārjanaṃmiti |
asmin kuṇḍe prāgagraṇā udayagāstrimrotimrorekhā vilikhet ||

lekhānāṃ devatā tatraivoktā prāgagrā smṛtā |
devādeśavāpurandarāḥ ||

rekhānāmūdagāgrāṇāṃ brahmavaivasvatendavaḥ |
athavā ṣaṭkoṇaṃ trikoṇaṃ vṛttaṃ caturasraṃ kuṇḍābhyāntare likhet | 
tatroktarvamaṇāyogapīṭhamarcayet |

<p. 157a>

vāmāyai namaḥ | hyeṣṭāyai namaḥ | raudrau namaḥ | ambikāyai namaḥ |

etāḥ śaktayo mekhalopari pūrvādito arcayet | muccārya | śrītārākuṇḍāyai namaḥ 
| iti saṃpūjyaḥ | 

tanmadhye nīlāṃ sarasvatīṃ tārā ṛṭu snātāṃ vāgīśvarīṃ yajet |

tataḥ suvarṇādi pīṭhe maṇisaṃbhavamvā śrotriya gehajaṃ vāramiti 
vijenoddhṛtpānīya huṁ phaṭ kravyādebhyaḥ svāhāḥ | iti kravyādāṃ 
saṃparityatya | 

<p. 157b>

tadagni mantreṇa saṃśodhye kavacenāvaguṇṭhya dhenu mudrāṃ pradarśya 
varūṇabījenāmṛtikṛtparamiti bījena vahnināṃ caitanyamutpādya karābhyāṃ 
muddhṛtpatriḥparitrāmya medinī pṛṣṭajānuḥ śivabījabuddhyākuṇḍamadhye 
sthitayonoryogīśvara vāgeśvarayo saṃgamaṃ saṃcintyatasyāṃ yonau 
adhomukhamagniniḥkṣipyaḥ |

hrīṁ vahnimūrtaye namaḥ | ityabhyarcya hṛllekhāmuccarat iḍayā kṛṣya 
kuṃbhakayogena suṣumnā sthita sahaśradala kamaje

<p. 158a>

vaindavāgni bāhyodara vahnibhyāṃ saṃyojya yonimudrayā dakṣiṇanādyā 
hṛllekhāmucaran agniṃ virecya kūrcabījamuccaran vahni caitanyāya namaḥ |

iti vāgīśvarī garbhanāḍyīṃ taccaitanyaṃ saṃyojñya saṃsthāpya jvālinī mudrāṃ 
pradarśayet | tataḥ samidindhanābhyāṃmāchādya agniṃ cinmantreṇa prajvālayet | 
cinmantro yathā |

oṃ citpiṃgala hana (2) daha (2) paca (2) sarvajñā jñāpaya svāhā |

<p. 158b>

oṃ tato vahni brahmaṅge vinyasya mūlādī yogāt sādaraṃ abhyarcayet |

tadyathā |

sahaśrārciṣe hṛdayāya namaḥ | svasti pūrṇāya śirase svāhā | uttiṣṭa puruṣāya 
śiṣāye vaṣaṭ | dhūmavyāpine kavacāya huṁ | saptajihvāya netratrayāya vauṣaṭ |
dhanurddharāya astrāya phaṭ || ityaṅgābhyarcya |

oṃ vaiśvānarajātaveda ihāvahalohitākṣa sarva karmāṇi sādha (2) svāhā |

iti mūlenāvāhya |

tārāgni svahutāsane bhitvaṃ 

<p. 159a>

tārāgni rasitā nāma datvā vahniṃ dhyāyet |

tataḥ saptahastaṃ tripādaṃ dviśīrṣaṃ catubhivviṣāṇaistridhā baddha madhyaṃ 
pisaṃgai yutaṃ locanaṃstarka saṃkhyaidvinā saṃraśantaṃ catuśotramagni |

raktāṃbujasthaṃ pralamvitaikaṃ pāṭañca pṛṣṭena gataṃ vṛṣendraṃ |
svasaṃmukhaṃ dakṣiṇakaiścaturbhibhīmaistribhirvāhubhirabhyupetaṃ ||

śaktiṃ vahniśrukśruvau savyahastairvāmai hastairtomalaṃ tālavṛttaṃ |

<p. 159b>

sasarpi pūrṇataptasauvarṇa pātraṃ śaṃsvat dhyāyet saptajihvāṃ dadhānaṃ |

athavā evaṃ dhyāyet | baṃdhū puṣpasaṃkāsaṃ sutaptakanaka prabha | padmahastaṃ 
yaṃjanārthaṃ vadana dvaya śobhitaṃ | saptachandāya makaravasana trayavigrahaṃ | 
tridhāgnyātma tripādāvyaṃ havya kavya vināśakaṃ |

brahmātma sūryadagdā tṛhotuścatuḥ hrī virājitaṃ |
pañcarātraṃ pāsupataṃ lokāyatamahā mataṃ ||

<p. 160a>

bauddhavaidikimitye tat ṣadviṅgala vilocanaṃ |
vedārthaṃ caturaśrotraṃ stotraśrostramayadhvaniṃ ||

sapātāla jaṭājūtamaṇī koṭīrabhāsuraṃ |
homāṅganaśamāyuktaṃ hemakuṇḍalamaṇḍitaṃ ||

raktāṃbhoruha madhyasthaṃ svastikāsanasaṃyutaṃ |
pṛṣṭadeśe samālambittāttīya caraṇāmbujaṃ ||

sadāśabdāya mānente siddhamānaṃ svatejasā |
śaktivahni śrukvauva caturbhiddakṣabāhubhiḥ ||

tomalaṃ tālavṛkṣaṃ ca sauvarṇa ghṛtapātrakaṃ |
vāme tribhirbāhubhiśca dadhānaṃ rakta vāsasaṃ ||

<p. 160b>

hiraṇyakanakā raktā kṛṣṇa dakṣāsana sthitā |
suprabhāvāti raktā ca rasanā bahurūpiṇī ||

imā jihvā jñāta tatvā vadana sarvamāsthitā |
etābhiḥ saptajihvābhiḥ rupetaṃ pātatvānanaṃ ||

vyāvṛtottāna vadanaṃ sādhakābhiṣṭa darśanaṃ |

evaṃ tasya mukhe hiraṇyāgata raktā kṛṣṇāsuprabhā ati raktā bahurūpā iti jihvā 
svanāma sadṛśavarṇā | jvalajvālajave pūṣaḥ 

<p. 161a>

surapi gandharva yakṣanāgapiśācarākṣasā devatādhiṣṭitāḥ |

śacintya ṣaṭkoṇamadhyeṣu pūjayet | taduktaṃ gaṇeśavimarṣiṇyāntuḥ |

hiraṇyāṃbhastu hemābhā śūlapāṇerdiśi sthitā |
vaidūryavarṇa kanakā prācyāyāṃ diśi saṃsthitā ||

taruṇāditya varṇābhāraktā jihvāgni saṃsthitā |
kṛṣṇānīlābhra saṃkāsā nai(-)ṛttyādiśi saṃsthitā ||

sūprabhā padmarāgābhāvārūṇyādisi saṃsthitā |
ati raktājapābhāsā vāyavyāṃ diśi saṃsthitā ||

<p. 161b>

bahurūpā yathā khyātā dakṣiṇottaratasthitā |

ṣaṭkoṇa rahite tu |

hiraṇyāvāruṇe proktā śaṃkare bahurūpikā |
yāmye rakta tathāgneryāmatiraktā ca saṃsthitā ||

suprabhāpūrvadik saṃsthākṛṣṇāyāmya diśi sthitāḥ |
kanakāñāmu saṃjñāyākuṇḍamadhyasamāśritā ||

yathā |

oṃ hrīṁ hīmmuhiraṇyāyai namaḥ | oṃ hrīṁ ṣyuṃgagāṇāyai namaḥ | oṃ hrīṁ 
rāṃpruṃ raktāyai namaḥ |

<p. 162a>

oṃ hrīṁ aṁ kṛṣṇāyai namaḥ | oṃ hrīṁ aṁ suprabhāyai namaḥ | oṃ hrīṁ aṁ 
atiraktāyai namaḥ | oṃ hrī yyuṃ bahurupāyai namaḥ | iti jihvā sapta saṃpūrya |

mekhalo paritasuṣumnāvartmanāstambhayitvā etasyā evāṣṭaka jayena 
dakṣanāsāpuṭe vāyuṃ vilecayet | evaṃ yathā śaktiprāṇāyāmaṃ kṛtvā 
ṛṣyādi nyāsaṃ nyaset |

yathā śirasi ākṣobhya ṛṣaye namaḥ | mukhe |
bṛhatī chandase namaḥ |

<p. 162b>

eka jaṭādi devatāyaibhyo namaḥ | mūlādhāre |
hrīṁ bījāye namaḥ | hṛdaye |
phaṭ śaktyāye namaḥ |

śeṣākṣarānuccārya sarvāṃgaṃ kīlakāye namaḥ |
punastathaiva mama druta kavitva pāṇḍitya siddhaye viniyogaḥ ||

karāṅgaṃ nyāsaṃ kuryāt | tathā |

hrīṁ ekajaṭāyai aṃguṣṭābhyāṃ namaḥ | aṃguṣṭayoḥ |
hrīṁ tāriṇyai tarjanībhyāṃ namaḥ | tarjanyoḥ |
huṁ vajrodake madhyamābhyāṃ namaḥ | madhyamayoḥ |
haiṁ ugrajaṭe anāmikābhyāṃ namaḥ | anāmikayoḥ |

<p. 163a>

hrauṃ mahāparisare kaniṣṭikābhyāṃ namaḥ | kaniṣṭayoḥ |
hraḥ piṅgogaika jaṭe karatalapṛṣṭābhyāṃ namaḥ | karatalapṛṣṭayoḥ |

iti karanyāsaḥ | atha ṣaḍaṃgāni |

hrāṁ ekajaṭāyai hṛdayāyai namaḥ | iti tarjanīmadhyamānāmikābhi hṛdayeḥ |
hrīṁ tāriṇyai śirase svāhā | tarjanīmadhyamābhyāṃ |
huṃ vajrodake śikhāyai vaṣaṭ | ityadhoṅguṣṭaśikhāya |
hraiṁ ugrajaṭe kavacāya huṁ | iti hastadvayābhyāṃ śira ādi pādaparyantaṃ |

<p. 163b>

hrauṁ mahāparisare netrayāya vauṣaṭ | iti tarjanī madhyamānāmikābhiḥ netratraye 
|| 

hraḥ piṅgograika jaṭe astrāya phaṭ | iti tarjanīmadhyamābhyāṃ ||

urddhaurddhatālatraye choṭikābhirdaśadigbaṃddhanaṃ kārya |
evaṃ ṣaḍaṅgaviṃnyasya brahmāṃjali viracya ātmābhedena kṣaṇaṃ ||

dhyāye | yathā |

pratyālīḍhapadārpināghriśava hṛdghorāṭṭahāsāparākhaḍgendīvara 
kartṛkhapparabhujā huṁkāra bījodbhavā |

<p. 164a>

kharvā nīlaviśālapiṅgalajaṭājūṭogranāgairyutājāḍyaṃ nyasya kapālake 
trijagatāṃ hantyugra tārāsvayaṃ | tatkarakalitadūrvākṣatarakta candanākṣatādi 
milita dinakarakiraṇa kusumāṃjalau mātṛkāmantraṃ dhyātvā 
hṛdayānmūlamantratatejomayīṃ śuddhajñāna caitanyamayītāṃ saṭcakra 
krameṇa śiraḥ sthita sahaśradala kamalakarṇikāntagataparamaṇi brahmaṃ 
prāpayitvā 

<p. 164b>

samabhibhāreṇa tadamṛtāṃ budhau viśrāmyatadamṛtalolībhūtāmānanda(##-)

deveśi bhakti sulabhe parivārasamanvite |
yāvatvāṃ pūjayiṣyāmi tāvatvaṃ susthiro bhava ||

ekajaṭe ihāvaha (2) ityañjali sthāpanena darśayet | iha tiṣṭa (2) iti sa evādhyo mukha |
iti sannidhehi | ityaṅguṣṭamuṣṭibhyāṃ | iha sannirudhyasva | 
saivāṅguṣṭagarbhiṇī muṣṭibhyāṃ |


<p. 165a>

tataḥ ātmaddeṅge ṣaḍaṅgavinyasye ||

āṁ hrīṁ krauṁ svāheti prāṇapratiṣṭāṃ kṛtvā | śrīmadeka jaṭe vajra puṣpaṃ 
pratīcha huṁ phaṭ svāhennyanena pañcopacāraircayet | āgneryā |

hrāṁ ekajaṭāyaṃ hṛdayāye namaḥ | aiśānyāṃ |
hrīṁ tāriṇyai śirase svāhā | nai(-)ṛtye |
hūṁ vakrodake śikhāya vaṣaṭ | vāyavyāṃ |
hrai ugrajaṭe kavacāya huṁ | karṇikāyaṃ |
hrauṁ mahāparisare netratrayāya vauṣaṭ | caturdikṣu |

<p. 165b>

hraḥ piṅgograika jaṭe astrāya phaṭ | 

atha devyāmaulau |

oṃ akṣobhya vajrapuṣpaṃ pratīcha huṁ phaṭ svāhā | iti saṃpūjya 
devyāvāyavyādīśa paryantaṃ ||

gururūpaśaktimarccayet |
oṃ urddhakeśānandanātha vajrapuṣpaṃ pratīcha huṁ phaṭ |

oṃ vyomakeśānandanātha vajretyādi | oṃ nīlakeśānandanātha vrajetyādi |
oṃ vṛṣadhvajānandanātha vajre puṣpetyādi | ete divyaughā |

oṃ vaśiṣṭānandanātha vajrapuṣpaṃ pratīcha hūṁ phaṭ svāhā |

<p. 166a>

oṃ kūrmānandanātha vrajetyādi | oṃ mīnanāthānandanātha vrajetyādi |
ete siddhaughā | oṃ mayāhedyasūvrajetyādi | oṃ vijayādyasuvrajetyādi | oṃ 
mahodarya suvajretyādi | oṃ parānandanātha vajretyādi | oṃ 
pārijātānandatparipūrvādito brahmādi pūjaye | yathā |

brāhmī māheśvarī kaumārī vaiṣṇavī vārāhī indrāṇī cāmuṇḍā mahālakṣmī | 
āṁ brāhmyai namaḥ | drī maheśvarāryai namaḥ |

<p. 166b>

oṃ kaumāryai namaḥ | ṛ vaiṣṇavyai namaḥ | ḹṁ vārāhyai namaḥ | eṁ aiṁ 
indrāṇyai namaḥ | oṃ oṁ cāmuṇḍāyai namaḥ | aḥ mahālakṣmai namaḥ | 

tadbahi |

lakṣmyai namaḥ | sarasvatyai namaḥ | rabhyai (2) | prīttyai (2) | kīttyai (2) | śāntyai (2) | 
puṣṭyai (2) | tuṣṭyai (2) | tadbahirlokapālān | tadbahi |

vajra śakti daṇḍa khaḍga pāśa aṃkuśagadāśūlacakrapadmānyetāni 
lokapālāyudhāni |

<p. 167a>

ādyākṣarabījayuktairnāmonterārādhya paridhi paristaraṇa prāṇātprācī 
varjadijucāryayet |

yathā kuṇḍamadhye mekhalāyāṃ mekhalā samadīrgha yajñakāṣṭa trayaṃ prācī 
varjapūrvāgra dvayaṃ uttarāgrameka evaṃ kuśāvapyargreṇa mūlachādayan 
pūrvāgrapaktidvayaṃ uttarāgrapaktimekīmāstatet |

āṁ brahmaṇe namaḥ | dakṣiṇe brahmāṇaṃ pūjayet | tataḥ śrukaśuvo 
tripratapyatau vāma haste datvāṃ dakṣiṇa hastena prokṣaye (2) |

<p. 167b>

punaḥ pratarpānmanodakṣiṇabhāge sthāpayet | ājyasthālīmānīyātreṇa mokṣya 
tasyāmāyyaniḥkṣipyatāṃ kūṇḍānnuddhṛtāgnau niveśayet | ityābhijñānaṃ |

darbhayugalaṃ prajvāle āniḥkṣiptā nale kṣipet |
dīptena darbhayugalena āhyaṃ nīrājyāgnau viniḥkṣipet ||

prajvālitāṃ darbhān ghṛtena pradarśya agnau visarjayet |

jalavisṛśet | iti saṃskāraiḥ saṃskārena ghṛtaṃ juhuyāt |

<p. 168a>

atha śuvenasthālī dakṣiṇabhāgānnāma mantreṇa dakṣiṇe agnaye svāhā hṛdaya 
mantreṇa vāmabhāgādājyamādāya | somāya svāhā |

iti vāmalocarane madhyādagni somābhyāṃ svāhā | iti bhālalocane |

dakṣiṇādagne svasti kṛte svāhā | tatastāreṇa vyāhṛtī juhuyāt | tadyathā |

oṃ bhūḥ svāhā | oṃ bhuvaḥ svāhā | oṃ svaḥ svāhā | oṃ bhūrbhuvaḥ svāhā | 
tato nāmakaranādīnāṃ saṃskārāṇāṃ praṇavādyena 

<p. 68b>

namonta evaṃ hṛllekhādyena vā sapta saptāhuti juhuyāt | yathā |
oṃ hrīṁ aniṣyamānasya agnergarbhādhānaṃ kalpayāmi namaḥ |
agnergarbhādhānaṃ |

oṃ agne puṃśravanaṃ kalpayāmi namaḥ | iti puṃśravaṇaṃ |
oṃ hrīṁ agneḥ sīmanto nayanaṃ kalpayāmi namaḥ | iti sīmanto nayanaṃ |
oṃ hrīṁ agnerjātakarma kalpayāmi namaḥ | iti jātakarma |
oṃ hrīṁ agnernnāmakaraṇaṃ kalpayāmi namaḥ | iti agnetvaṃ tārāgni nāmāsi | iti 
nāmakaraṇaṃ |

<p. 169a>

hrīṁ agnenti kramanaṃ kalpayāmi namaḥ | iti nikramanaṃ |
hrīṁ agneścūḍākaraṇaṃ kalpayāmi namaḥ | cūḍākaraṇaṃ kalpayāmi |
hrīṁ agne upanayanaṃ kalpayāmi namaḥ | iti upanayanaṃ |
hrīṁ agne vedādhyayanaṃ kalpayāmi namaḥ | iti vedādhyayanaṃ |
hrīṁ agne samāvartanaṃ kalpayāmi namaḥ | iti samāvartanaṃ kalpayāmi namaḥ | 

hrīṁ agne godānaṃ kalpayāmi namaḥ | iti godānaṃ |

<p. 169b>

hrīṁ agni vivāhaṃ kalpayāmi namaḥ | iti vivāhaṃ |

tatastatrāgnau vidhivat | dhyātvā bāhyābhyarcya |
agneraikāṃ vibhāvyamūlena ṣoḍaśāhutirjuhūyāt | punamūlena 
ṣoḍaśāhutirjuhuyāt | etadvayaṃ vaktaiva karaṇaṃ nāḍīsaṃdhānaṃ | tatastri 
madhurāktaṃ raktakaravīrairvā anyena vā aṣṭottaraśataṃ nityahome | bandhūka 
kusumai bhūpavasyāya | sarpilavaṇahomābhyāṃ kāminī samākarṣaṇāya |

<p. 170a>

candana puṣpaiḥ saubhāgyāya | mallikājātī punnāga kadambaiḥ puṣpairājakusumai 
sarvārtha siddhai | durvātilājyāhutirāmuṣe | kṣīrāktaistagaraiḥ kavitvāya | 
candanāgurukarpuraiḥ sarvābhiṣṭāya ghṛtāktamālatīpuṣpai druta kavitvāya | 
puraścaraṇavidhau tu |

nīlotpalenākhaṇḍāya bilvapatreṇa vā daśāṃmaśaṃjuhūyāt | vahuraprakārastu 
mūlamuccārya tataḥ svāhā |

<p. 170b>

idaṃ devyai tataḥ punarmahāvyāhriti homayet | yathā |

oṃ bhūragnaye pṛthivyai mahate svāhā | bhuvo vāyave cāntarikṣāya ca dive ca 
mahate svahā | oṃ svaḥ ādityāya candramase nakṣatrebhyaśca vai svāhā |
oṃ bhūrbhuvaḥ sva agnaye cādityāya candramase nakṣetrebhyañca mahate svāhā |

iti hutvā ārjyapūrṇena śuvena śruvamāpūjya tatrākṣata kusumā niḥkṣipet | 
tadupari adhomukha śuva datvā urddhaṃ mūkhena mūlaṃ nādāntamūccārya 
vāmapādapūraḥsaraṃ ||

<p. 171a>

avichinnadhārayā vauṣaḍantena pūrṇāhutiṃ hutvā upaviśya devī 
gaṃdhādibhirārādhya tadaṃta devatā gaṇaṃ tadaṃmeva ca |

vilīnaṃ dhyātvā pūrvavat visarjayet | śaktaścet saṃrakṣet |

atha haviṣyānnavidhi |

mantrānte svāhākāramuccāryadvavirnnikṣipyānte idamamūkāyeti sambandhaḥ | 
havirdānantunpūnjapāninā na kartavyaṃ | taduktaṃ tripurāntahāre |

citrahastena yaddānaṃ huyate ca hutāśane |

<p. 171b>

dātu punyaphalaṃ nāsti hotā ca narakaṃ vrajet ||

iti śrīmahābhairavatantre |

havirūtāna hastena vaiśvānara mukhe hutaṃ |
hotuścakṣurvināśāya yajamānopi naśyati ||

[iti tārārahasyavṛttau homanirṇayo nāmaḥ trayodaśaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 13 ||


evaṃ nigaditā vidyā tāriṇī sarvasiddhidā |
idānīṃ śṛṇu vakṣāmi vāsanāmātmatāmayīṃ ||

vyomno prakāśamānastvaṃ rasannāyatramagninā |
tayorviṣa ikāroyaṃ vidūnā tantrikā matā ||

<p. 172a>

takāra sarvapāpaghno rephastatva prakāśakaḥ |
bindūmānī mahābījaṃ śabdarāśeḥ prakāśakaṃ ||

caitanyarūpa saṃsārabhīṣaṇaṃ muktidāyakaṃ |
phatkāra sarvajāḍyānāṃ nāśakaṃ tatprakāśakaṃ ||

evaṃ samastarūpeṇa kevalā citkalāparā |
sarvavedamayī sākṣāchabdabrahmaśvarūpiṇī ||

ānandarūpiṇī nīlā ātmānanda pradāyiṇī |
praṇavo brahmarūpāsā sohaṃ tatva svarūpiṇī ||

<p. 172b>

iti te kathitā vidyā vāsanā bhuktimukti ye |
evaṃ yo vetti śuddhātmā sādhako guru śikṣayā ||

sa yogī sa ca vijñānī jīvaṃ muktaḥ sadāśivaḥ |

atha mantrasiddhyartha maṃtra śikhāmahārahasyatantre |

śrīdevyuvāca |

bhagavan prasīda sarvajña sarvaprāṇi hiterata |
yenāvaśya bhave siddhiḥ rūpāya vada śaṃkaraḥ ||

śrī īśvara uvāca |

śṛṇu devi paraṃ jñānaṃ sarva jñānottamottamaṃ |
yena vijñātamātreṇa kṣipraṃ vidyā prasīdati ||

<p. 173a>

mūlakalpe tu yā śaktirbhujaṃgākāra rūpiṇī |
etadarbhanāvartana praṇa ityucyate budhaiḥ ||

jhillivāracya madhurā krūjandī satato sthitā |
gachantī brahmaraṃdhre praviśanti svaketana ||

yātāyātaṃ krameṇaiva tacca kūryāmanomayaṃ |
tena mantra śikhājātā sarvasiddhi pradīpikā ||

tamaḥ purṇe gṛhe yastu yatkiñcit pratibhāṣate |
śikhā hīnāstathā mantrā na siddhyaṃti kadācana ||

<p. 173b>

śikhopadeśaḥ sarvatra gopitaḥ parameśvaraḥ |
vitānena na siddhi syāt varṣakoṭī śatairapi ||

tasmāt tvayāpi girije gopitavyaṃ prayatnataḥ |

iti śikhā mantrā | mantraśikhā | athāntaryāgaḥ | rudrayāmale |

athāntaryejanaṃ vakṣe dṛṣṭvā dṛṣṭa phalapradaṃ |
yogiṇāṃ yatra jāyante adhipāśca narāḥ sadā ||

gurodhyānaṃ prakūrvīta yatnāt pūrvaṃ viśāladhī |
snānaṃ budhastataḥ kūrya svamvidānanda siddhaye ||

<p. 174a>

tadyathā śṛṅgāta nilayā kuṇḍalinī samutthāpya kula paṃke ruhaṃ parabindūṃ 
niṅbhidya tatra druta parāmṛta dhārayā mūla śṛṅgāṃtargataṃ tatra nimajjet 
| 

taduktaṃ yāmale |

snāyācca vimale tīrthe puṣkare hṛdayāśrite |
bindutīrthe naraḥ snāyāt punarjanma na vidyate ||

iḍāsuṣumnā śivatīrthakesmin jñānāmbu pūrṇā vahata śarīre |
brahmadyuti snāti tayoḥ sadāyat kintasya gaṃgairapi puṣkaraiścaḥ ||

<p. 174b>

atha saṃdhyā |

mūlavidyāsvarūpiṇī taḍitkoṭi prabhāṃ mṛṇālatantu nibhāṃ kuṇḍalinīṃ 
kulāmṛtarasabhāvena saṃdhyā kūryāt |

taduktaṃ rudrayāmale |

śivaḥ śaktyāḥ samāyogo yasmijñāna prajāyate |
sā saṃdhyā kulaniṣṭānāṃ samādhisthaiḥ pragīyate ||

atha tarpaṇa |

mūlādhārāt somasūryāgni rūpiṇīṃ kuṇḍalinīṃ samusthāpya paraṃ 
bindūnibhidyatadabhūtā mṛtena deha devatāṃ tarpayet para devatāṃ |

<p. 175a>

athārgha vidhiḥ |

bindusthānamādhāranādasthāne kalārūpapātraṃ nādānta 
candramaṇḍalāmṛtājñā cakraśuddhyā śaktitejasā saṃpūjya deha devatāṃ 
tarpayet | tarpanaiḥ taduktaṃ bhairave |

brahmadvārā dadhobhāge taccāntaṃ pātramuttamaṃ |
kāmāsāreṇa saṃpūjya tarpayantena khecarīṃ ||

nyāsā yathā |

ṣaṭcakrasthitā māttṛkānanī karaṃ nyāsaḥ |

taduktaṃ rudrayāmale |

<p. 175b>

ādhāre liṃganābhau hṛdaya sarasije tālumūle lalāṭe dve patre ṣoḍaśāre 
dvidaśa daśadale dvādaśārddha catuṣke |

vāsānte vālamadhye upha kaṭha sahite kaṇṭhakūpe svarāśca haṃsaṃ tatvārtha 
yukte sakala dalagataṃ kaulamārga prasiddhiṃ |

pāṭha hakṣau daḍamadhyenyasa tu vimaladhīrṣūddhi saṃmanti vṛdyai |

atha ṣaḍaṃgāni gotamīye |

iḍyamānā hṛdānmānaṃ hṛdaye syārcidātmakaṃḥ |

<p. 176a>

kriye tatparatvena hṛnmayena tataḥ paraṃ |
sarvajñādi guṇottuṃge sarve hrīṁ ca parānmani ||

kriyati viṣayāhāro śiromantreṇa deśikaḥ |
hṛchiro rūpaḥ ciddhāma mayamābhāvanādṛḍham ||

kriyate nija devasya śikhāmantreṇa deśakaḥ |
mantrātmakasya dehasya mantravācyena tejasā ||

sarvatovarmamantreṇa kriyate nānyamanvati |
yaṅgatādi parajñānamanvirūpe parātmani ||

hṛdayādi mayaṃ tejaḥ syādai tat netra saṃjñitaṃ |

<p. 176b>

andhyātmikādi rūpaṃ yat sādhakasya vināśayet ||

avidyā jātamantrasya paraṃ dhāma samīritaṃ |

atha dhyānaṃ |

tadūktaṃ udayākarapaddhatyāṃ |

śaktidvaya puṭāntastha kamaladvaya saṃsthitaṃ |
jyotistatvamaya dhyātvā kulākula viyojanaṃ ||

śṛṅgāṭadvayamadhyasthaṃ śaktidvaya puṭī kṛtaṃ |
sadāsamarasandhyānantatkulaṃ yoginī mayi ||

punaruktaṃ |

kiraṇasthaṃ yadāgnisthañcandra bhāskara madhyagaṃ |

<p. 177a>

mahāśūnye layaṃ kṛtvā purṇastiṣṭati yogirāt ||

nilālamba pade śūnye yat teja upajāyate |
tad garbhamabhyasennityandhyānamevantu yogiṇāṃ ||

atha pūjā | yathā |

antarmukhena manasā viṣayādikaṃ sarva paratejasi samarpaṇamiti pūjanaṃ | 
taduktaṃ bhairava tantre |

arcayaṃ viṣayaiḥ puṣpaistatkṣaṇāntatmayo bhavet |

anyatrāpi |

nyāsastatmayatā buddhiḥ sohaṃ bhāvena pūjayet |

<p. 177b>

atha japau yathā |

suṣumnāntargataṃ cichakti rupabrahmagranthisūtra granthitasya 
merusamanvitānulomavilomena kuṇḍaliṇīmutthāpya japet |

taduktaṃ mātṛkārṇave |

mālā pañcāsikā proktā sutraṃ śakti śivātmakaṃ |
granthitaṃ kūṇḍalī śakti kalānte meru saṃsthitāḥ ||

atha homaḥ |

nābhikūṇḍe kuṇḍalinī vidagnau vāsanendhane dīpte parāmṛta haviṣu sumnā 
śruvā |

<p. 178a>

akṣavṛttīrvakṣamāṇamantreṇa juhūyāt |

mantro yathā |

mūlamuccāryanābhimaṇḍalacaitanyarūpāgnau manasā śruvā jñāna pradīpake 
nilamakṣaravṛttījuhomyahaṃ |

svāhā ityekāhutiṃ datvā mūlamūccārya |
dharmādharma havīrdvipta rūpāgnau manasā śruvā ||

suṣumnāvartmanā nityamakṣavṛtti juhomyahaṃ |
svāhā iti dvitīyāhutiḥ ||

mūlamūcāryā |

prakāśākāśahastābhyāṃ havanaṃ ātmano śruvā |
dharmādharma phalā snehaṃ pūrṇavahnau juhomyahaṃ svāhā ||

<p. 78b>

antarniraṃtara nibandhanamedhamāne māyāndhakāraparipanthini samvidagnau |
ātmaprakāśana marīcikāśibhūmau viśvaṃ juhomi vasudhādiśi vāvasānamiti ||

atha yogaḥ |

taduktaṃ haṃsapāramesvaratantre kathitaṃ paramaṃ brahmaṃ yogaṃ śṛṇu 
varānane ādhāre tu gudasthāne paṅkajañca caturdalaṃ |

karṇikāyāṃ sthitā yoniḥ kāmākhyāyatameśvarī aparokṣa hi kaṃdarpyamādhāre 
ca trikoṇakaṃ |

<p. 179a>

svayaṃbhuliṅgamadhye tu paścimābhimukha priye |
tasmāt tudvyaṅgulādūrdhvaṃ adho madhyaṃ tu dvyaṃgulaṃ ||

ekāṅgulaṃ tu taṃ madhye caturaśrantrikoṇakaṃ |
tanmadhya tu śikhi sthānan taptahāṭakaṃ saṃnibhaṃ ||

bandhūka puṣpasaṃkāśa taḍillekhe ca vīsphurat |
saptācci raśmi saṃyuktaṃ kālāgni rudragarbhakaṃ ||

ādikṣakāraparyantaṃ kalādaśa samanvitaṃ |
ayamagniḥ samūddiṣṭa sūryañca kathayāmi te ||

<p. 179b>

vasti deśe mahābhāge madhyamā mūlamāśrite |
sindūrasannibhambījaṃ javādāḍimasannibhaṃ ||

ravistatraiva jānīyāt kalādvādaśasaṃyutaṃ |
kalādyādvādaśabījaṃ yugmayugmaṃ sureśvari ||

tanmadhye sa parāddhantu udyadāditya sannibhāṃ |
rajaśaktirmahābhāge ravivāyu sthitaṃ jagat ||

śirobinduriti khyāto manaścandra prakīrtitaṃ |
ādībījamunmanī ca gagaṇaśca caturvidhaḥ ||

<p. 180a>

ādibīja mahākāśaṃ nijacandraṃ mano bhavet |
unmanī prāṇacandraśca mitrācandra vināśinī ||

sarvacandramayo yogī dhyānaṃ samabhyaset tataḥ |
oṃkārasthā śikhāsukṣmā ātmaikyāṃ cidrupāṃ kalā ||

cintayantī parāvasthāṃ jihvāstadaśanan dṛḍhaṃ |
sūkṣayā saha cātmānamekī bhūtantu cintayet ||

haravaktasyaṃ saṃyogāt sā śikhā varddhayet priye |
brahmagranthiṃ tato bhitvā kulītaṃ chinna mastayo ||

<p. 180b>

brahmarandhre suṣumnāyāmvāyurviśatimadhyamāṃ |
svādhisthānantato bhitvā śravaṇaṃ viśati dvayaṃ ||

manipūre nābhideśe brahmaṇaḥ sadananpriye |
dīptajyotirmayaṃ śuddhaṃ tatobhindyāt sadāgatiḥ ||

tadurddhvaṃ vaiṣṇavaṃ sthānaṃ nīlotpaladalaprabhaṃ |
brahma granthiṃ hṛdibhitvā kātī dvetriguṇātmakaṃ ||

dakṣakarma tato datvā tālumūlaṃ svarātmakaṃ |
rudrālayaṃ tato bhitvā lalāṭaśca maheśvarī ||

<p. 181a>

māheśvarī indu kalāṃ merau nirodhikāraṇam |
śaṃkhinīmānasaṃ prāpyavāsthi śūnyavibhartisaḥ ||

amṛti yadi sargasthaṃ paramānanda lakṣaṇaṃ |
sahaśrāramahāpadmaṃ raktakiñjalkaśobhitaṃ ||

drutaraktāmbuje kṣābhaṃ dhārāpāta pravarṣaṇaṃ |
mahāsamudra madhyasthaṃ nīlaṃ kṣīramayaṃ priye ||

urddhādhāre śṛṇuyatproktaṃ | tanmayodraniraṃjanaṃ ||

nityānandamayī devīṃ dhyāyet tatra samāhitaḥ |
sahaśradala padmācca pīyuṣaṃ prāpayet priye ||

<p. 181b>

pītvā pītvā punaḥ pītvā mūlādhāre praveśayet |
punaḥ kūlāmṛtaṃ pītvā punareva viśetkulaṃ ||

devisthāne sahaśrāre prāviśedākulaṃ priye |
dvādaśārṇa punarbhitvā yonimudrānibaṃdhanāt ||

pītvā punarmūlādhāre piṃgalayā guṇadvayaṃ |
vastinādikayormadhye udyānañca sureśvarī ||

jālaṃdharaṃ tathā vaktre guḍe ca kāmarūpakaṃ |
hṛdimadhye pūrṇagiriṃ śrīhadṛstālukopari ||

<p. 182a>

grivau pūrṇaṃ girīpīṭhaṃ kalpodyānaṃ śirasthitaṃ |
yejetkalpataruṃ tasmin sādhakabhiṣṭa siddhidaṃ ||

dhyāye lipitarornūle devī tanmaya paṃkaje |
vadanti sudhiyo vṛkṣaṃ nityavarṇamayaṃ priye ||

sacinmaya mahābījaṃ bindunāda mahāśivaṃ |
pṛthivyakṣara śākhābhiḥ sarvāśāṃ suvijaṃbhitaṃ ||

sapāsakṣara pātraiśca saṃchādita jagatrayaṃ |
vahni varṇāṅkulairdīptaṃ ratnairiva suradrumaḥ ||

marutāṃ tulasatpuṣpai dyotayaṃ taṃ puraḥśriyāṃ |
ākāśārṇa phalainetraṃ sarvabhūtā śriyaṃparaṃ ||

<p. 182b>

mahāmṛtākṣamadhubhiḥ siyaṃ taṃ parameśvarīṃ |
vedāgamādibhiḥ proktaṃ samunnati manoharaṃ ||

śivaśakti mayaṃ sākṣāt chāyāśrita jagantrayaṃ |
tanmūle bhāvayad devī sarvadeśarirīṇāṃ ||

evaṃ ciṃtanamātreṇa kiṃ na siddhyaṃti bhūtale |

taṃtrarājepi |

sāmānya yogaprakaraṇaṃ |

mūrddhāta vidyā madhyesthaṃ sudhāvarya vidhāyakaṃ |
vibhāvayantiti nanujapedekāgra mānasaḥ ||

<p. 183>

maṇḍalāt kavitā siddhiḥ sarvabhāṣāmapī bhavet |
vādādīṣu ca sarvatra devatātmā jayī bhavet ||

sakalajanī stotre |

ānandalakṣaṇamatāhata nāsti deśe nādātmanā parigataṃ tava rūpamīḍe |
antargatena manasā paricīyamānaṃśaṃsaṃti netra salilaiḥ pulakaiśca dhanyāḥ |

upahāso na kartavyo yathā śāstra samīritaṃ |
vidheyamasya marmajñairvīrāvaddho yamaṃjaliḥ ||

<p. 184>

lambodarasya pautreṇa kamalakara sūnunā |
alekhi śaṃkareṇaiṣā vāsanādi vinirṇaya ||

[iti śrīśaṅkarācārya viracitāyāṃ tārārahasyavṛttau taṃtracūḍāmaṇau 
vāsanānīrṇayo nāma pañcadaśamaḥ paṭalaḥ samāptam] || 15 ||

śubham |

<samvat 1957 sālamiti | roja | kṛṣṇājī |>

<samāptam |>




